window.FWN_CHAOTIC_SWORD_GOD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CHAOTIC_SWORD_GOD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4001,"title":"Chapter 4001: Chapter 4002: The Three Old Servants (1)","paragraphs":["It was not just the Space-splitting Venerable. Even the three old servants who had followed Daowei Chengqing for all these years were shocked. They gazed at the Reverent Observance Heaven nearby in disbelief.","They had crossed more than half of the Immortals’ World and precisely arrived at their destination. They could not achieve such a feat alone.","“What’re you staring at me for? I asked you, where is he?” Daowei Chengqing’s face sank slightly. He noticed the traces of fighting here. The violent storms of energy continued to sweep through outer space. He had already developed an ill feeling.","“It’s the crown prince Daowei Chengqing. I am the Yellow Slope Master from the Daoist Sect of Thousand Leaves. Greetings to your majesty...”","“I didn’t think that someone as lofty and impressive as the crown prince would also be drawn here. I come from the Sword Sect of Lightning Python. I am known as the Azure Lightning Master. Greetings to your majesty...”","At this moment, the Immortal Exalts in outer space all gathered over. All of them were friendly, clasping their fists towards Daowei Chengqing with smiles. When they glanced past the three old servants behind Daowei Chengqing, there was a great sense of wariness about them.","They could sense that the presence of the three old servants was tremendous like an abyss and boundless. They were more terrifying than any of the Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts they had met before.","They were truly unfathomable!","Daowei Chengqing completely ignored the Immortal Exalts around him. He stared straight at the Space-splitting Venerable, which left the surrounding Immortal Exalts quite awkward. However, none of them dared to become displeased over this.","Any one of his servants could annihilate them all. With such a great difference present, they did not dare to show any attitude towards Daowei Chengqing.","Under Daowei Chengqing’s gaze, the Space-splitting Venerable’s forehead became covered with a thin layer of sweat. Although he was only facing a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, he felt extremely uneasy despite already being a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. He was unsettled.","That was because the person before him was a living legend of the Immortals’ World. He had single-handedly created a glorious myth.","The Space-splitting Venerable gulped with difficulty and said reluctantly, “Your majesty, Yang Yutian suddenly appeared and collected the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain from the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens with lightning speed. I went to stop him, but I was heavily injured by the Divine Formation of the Heavens in his possession, which was why I could not contact your majesty in time.”","Daowei Chengqing’s face sank slightly. “He’s only an Immortal Emperor, yet he slipped away under your watch? This isn’t the Skyscraping World. Your powers aren’t restricted here, yet you couldn’t even keep your eye on an Immortal Emperor?”","“I have been useless. I have let down your majesty’s expectations.” The Space-splitting Venerable did not put on the airs of an expert at all. He even grovelled a little bit in front of Daowei Chengqing.","Daowei Chengqing was rather annoyed. From the energy storm that still lingered in the surroundings, he knew that the Space-splitting Venerable was bending the truth. The reality was slightly different from what he was saying.","“Your majesty, don’t tell me you’re also interested in the sovereign god artifact on Yang Yutian?” asked a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt nearby with a clasped fist.","These words made Daowei Chengqing furrow his brows. He was interested in a sovereign god artifact on Jian Chen, but what he was interested in was different from everyone else.","At this moment, Daowei Chengqing seemed to sense something. His indifferent gaze immediately sharpened, suddenly gazing into the depths of the sea of stars.","His gaze landed on a regular planet that was extremely far away from the Reverent Observance Heaven. A burly, middle-aged man stood there, also gazing at the Reverent Observance Heaven in the distance.","From so far away, the Reverent Observance Heaven had already become the size of a speck of dust.","“He can detect my existence even from so far away. Sure enough, this Daowei Chengqing is not simple.” A hint of surprise appeared in the middle-aged man’s eyes. The way he looked at Daowei Chengqing changed in a subtle manner.","“However, Jian Chen’s performance has taken me by surprise slightly. Originally, I thought he would need me to interfere in order to escape, yet he managed to escape all by himself. No one should be able to find him for a while as long as he doesn’t proactively expose himself.”","“Though, he sure is brash. For the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, he’s actually taken on such a great risk...”","The middle-aged man muttered to himself before slowly turning around. Countless stars seemed to flash around him. In the next moment, he suddenly vanished, having left instantly.","After he had left, Daowei Chengqing also withdrew his gaze outside the Reverent Observance Heaven. He sighed gently. “I never thought that an existence on the level of heavenly emperors would be hiding here. They even seemed to be secretly protecting Jian Chen. Whatever, even if Jian Chen failed to escape from your hands, you would have never been able to stop a heavenly emperor.”","Daowei Chengqing turned his gaze and stared off in the direction of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. He sighed and said, “The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens may have declined, but some of its residual might remains...”","After saying that, Daowei Chengqing turned around and left with the three servants. He did not stay for a moment longer.","In outer space, the three servants flew back to the Waymight clan with Daowei Chengqing at great speed. They felt rather perplexed as they gazed at Daowei Chengqing. After all, he had travelled to the Reverent Observance Heaven instantly and only remained for a few seconds before returning to the clan.","“Master, is that junior called Jian Chen really that important in your eyes? He’s actually enough for you to specially make your way to the Reverent Observance Heaven.” One of the servants could not help but ask this. They were all very clear that Daowei Chengqing must have paid a price that they were unaware of in order to use the secret technique that allowed him to cross more than half of the Immortals’ World instantly.","That was because to a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, this ability should have been completely impossible.","“That junior is facing some poor circumstances right now. Far too many people in the Immortals’ World are searching for him. If you really have taken a liking to this person, why don’t we let out the news, so he can proactively join master? With your current level of prestige and influence, there are countless Immortal Exalts in the Immortals’ World who want to seek refuge under you, let alone a mere Immortal Emperor like Jian Chen...”","“Yeah. As long as he has your protection, just who in the Immortals’ World will still have the courage to touch him? Even the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor will have to reconsider the consequences...”","The two other servants spoke up as well. When they mentioned heavenly emperors, they did not show the wariness towards them that these experts usually received. They spoke with ease.","“Any prodigy has a sense of pride. Getting him to join me is not as easy as you might think.” Daowei Chengqing smiled.","At this moment, the presence of one of the servants became chaotic. His powerful presence erupted from his body uncontrollably, producing a violent tide of energy in outer space.","Immediately, the resplendent galaxies dimmed, and the stars all seemed to shake.","Despite being at the Seventh Heavenly Layer, his presence was no weaker than the Eighth Heavenly Layer. As a matter of fact, he even surpassed most Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.","Since he had lost control of his presence, the other two servants urgently used their powers to protect Daowei Chengqing. Afterwards, one of them took Daowei Chengqing into the distance with a flash.","However, when they looked at the servant who had lost control, the two other servants only showed a hint of envy. There was no worry at all. Instead, they were happy for him.","Gradually, rings after rings of profound patterns rose up from the body of the servant who lost control. They contained the deepest secrets of the universe and were incomprehensible.","The patterns of ways rapidly spread across the old servant’s body, covering him very quickly. The servant’s presence also rapidly skyrocketed, showing signs of breaching the Seventh Heavenly Layer and reaching the eighth.","“Master, please grant the technique to me!” Suddenly, the servant dropped down onto one knee towards Daowei Chengqing. There was a hint of madness within his respect.","Daowei Chengqing narrowed his eyes and furrowed his eyebrows firmly."]},{"number":4002,"title":"Chapter 4002: Chapter 4003: The Three Old Servants (2)","paragraphs":["At this moment, the surroundings sank into an eerie silence. The old servant who was in the middle of breaking through remained on the ground with one knee. The admiration and fervency in his eyes did not decrease at all as he waited for Daowei Chengqing to grant him the technique.","His presence continued to skyrocket as if he would reach the Eighth Heavenly Layer at any moment.","The two other servants stood by Daowei Chengqing, looking at the person breaking through enviously.","As for Daowei Chengqing, his eyebrows remained firmly locked the entire time as his eyes shone with uncertainty.","No one said anything. No one did anything either, maintaining the same position as before. Time seemed to come to a standstill.","A minute later, Daowei Chengqing said calmly, “I am unable to grant you the technique right now.”","When they heard that, the three old servants were all startled. They were extremely surprised and taken aback. In particular, the old servant who was breaking through became filled with some dread and a deep sense of uneasiness.","“Master, h-have I disappointed you in any way?” the servant said fearfully. It was difficult to imagine that for someone who had reached such a terrifying cultivation, a supreme expert who could summon clouds and rain with a flick of his wrist, revered by all, would actually be so unsettled.","“My memories from back then still have not completely awakened. Some of it is still missing, which is why I cannot grant you the technique right now!” Daowei Chengqing said sternly.","When he heard that, the old servant’s expression changed drastically. Blood immediately drained from his face.","The two other servants also gulped. Their hearts immediately sank.","“Why do you need me to grant you the technique? Tell me in detail,” Daowei Chengqing asked.","“Master, when you first emerged from the Hole of Reincarnation, you passed on a profound cultivation method to us all and granted us a special item. Over the years, the reason why our cultivation has grown so rapidly is not just due to the profound cultivation method that you granted us, master, but also because of that special item.”","“The growth in our cultivation and comprehension is directly connected to that item. Without that item, even if we continued arduously practising the cultivation method that you granted us, we would have never reached our current cultivation in such a short amount of time.”","The two servants by Daowei Chengqing’s side began explaining to him. When they mentioned the special item, their eyes shone with a strange light.","“Our cultivation and comprehension is entirely built off that special item. By relying on that item to increase our strength, it actually comes with many restrictions. Every time our strength increases, we need a corresponding technique to remove the various seals on that item, o-or...”","The servant faltered. His face only became paler.","“Or what?” Daowei Chengqing furrowed his brows deeply.","“Or we will face a backlash from the special item and be doomed,” one of the old servants said glumly.","The servant in the middle of the breakthrough said with difficulty, “In the past, you only gave us a part of the secret technique before you reincarnated. The technique was enough for us to reach the Seventh Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, but we don’t have the secret technique for the Eighth Heavenly Layer.”","Reaching there, his body began to shake. His voice also began to falter. “M-m-master, I-I can’t keep it suppressed for much longer.”","The two other servants’ faces changed drastically. If he could not keep it suppressed and he reached the Eighth Heavenly Layer, then it would be certain death. No one could save him.","Suddenly, one of them remembered something. His eyes suddenly lit up, and he said, “Oh right. Master, you did say in the past that once our cultivation loses control and is about to break through to the Eighth Heavenly Layer, only the Dominion’s Brush and the Book of the Populace can resolve this issue apart from the secret technique that you grant to us.”","“Master, do you still remember saying this in the past?” The two servants looked at Daowei Chengqing hopefully.","Daowei Chengqing shook his head and said blankly, “I don’t remember it at all. Did I really say that back then?”","“Master, you don’t have to worry. I’m certain that as your strength increases, those memories will return to you. There will be a day when you remember everything from the past.” The servant comforted him.","Daowei Chengqing waved his hand and said, “Right now is not the time to discuss my memories. Since the Dominion’s Brush and the Book of the Populace can resolve this problem, let’s deal with your issue first.” With a flip of his hand, a tablet from the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance immediately appeared in Daowei Chengqing’s hand. He channelled his energy into the tablet. Glyphs of ways immediately appeared.","On the Wondrous Success Heaven, a sovereign god artifact divine hall stood quietly in the forbidden zone in the depths of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance. From time to time, it would flash with violet lightning.","The elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance levitated in the air with her legs crossed inside the divine hall. She radiated with a terrifying presence. Even amongst other Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, very few could match her presence.","Compared to when she faced the four supreme ancestors of the Sacred Beast clan on the Reverent Observance Heaven, Fang Jing had clearly become much stronger.","Her strength seemed to be growing with every passing moment. Even without the Dominion’s Brush, her strength was growing at an unparalleled rate.","Suddenly, the terrifying presence from Fang Jing was withdrawn. She opened her eyes and immediately vanished, arriving outside the divine hall.","A maidservant waited politely outside. She bowed towards the elder princess and informed the master of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance.","In the next moment, the master of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, Fang Yuyun, appeared quietly. He bore a resplendent and confident smile. He said amicably, “Jing’er, you’ve finally emerged. Have you benefitted from your secluded cultivation this time?”","“Oh right, do you still remember the Sword Sect of Yang Soul, Jing’er? The ancestor of the Sword Sect of Yang Soul, the Heavenloss Master, is currently at our Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance as a guest. He said he had something important to report to you. He’s already spent many years waiting here for you.”","“Jing’er, do you think you have the time to meet with the Heavenloss Master?”","Despite facing his daughter, Fang Yuyun’s manner of speech and behaviour was still rather reserved, afraid to cause any offence.","“Father, tell him to go back. I have no time,” Fang Jing said relaxedly. She obviously knew who the Heavenloss Master was. In the past, he was an existence that the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance could only look up to. As a matter of fact, if he had paid a visit to the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, they would welcome him with the highest honour.","As for now...","Fang Jing took a step and vanished, having left the Wondrous Success Heaven and arrived in the vast outer space. Afterwards, she tread through space, traversing worlds at a time, making her way to Daowei Chengqing’s location extremely quickly."]},{"number":4003,"title":"Chapter 4003: Chapter 4004: Four Divine Mountains","paragraphs":["Daowei Chengqing sat in outer space peacefully as he quietly gazed at the three servants nearby.","By now, the three old servants had already gathered together. The two others erupted with a tremendous presence, using great might to suppress the servant who was breaking through, trying their best to stop him.","These kinds of breakthroughs were like instantaneous enlightenment. They were extremely swift and difficult to control. If it were only the one servant’s power alone, he would probably struggle to last until the elder princess had arrived.","After all, everything they possessed originated from the treasure from the Hole of Reincarnation. Under the effects of this exotic treasure, their situation could not be understood through regular logic.","Finally, the elder princess of the Heavenly Palace of Great Radiance, Fang Jing, arrived after several hours. She wielded the Dominion’s Brush in her hand with over a dozen laws coiled around it like raging dragons. She shattered the space around her along the way, rushing over as quickly as possible.","“Brother!” Fang Jing immediately looked at Daowei Chengqing who sat on the side with a smile. She was extremely friendly.","Daowei Chengqing nodded gently in response. He pointed at the three servants and said, “Jing’er, I’ll have to rely on you for the matters here.”","Fang Jing looked at the three servants and seemed to see the issue with a single glance. “Brother, have you still not recalled the method to resolve this yet?”","Daowei Chengqing shook his head quietly.","Fang Jing sighed gently and said, “Your worries from back then really did end up happening. Before you reincarnated, you were worried that you would not be able to recover your memories completely or some accident would happen and prevent your memories from returning. They might even end up as incomplete. As a result, you specially instructed me to use the power of the Dominion’s Brush to resolve their issues when the need arose.”","“However, this is a method that only deals with the symptoms and not the underlying cause. The power of the Dominion’s Brush can indeed control their cultivation and prevent them from breaking through to the Eighth Heavenly Layer.”","“However, if they do want to reach the Eighth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, it’ll still have to be you who deals with it in the end.”","With that, Fang Jing appeared before the three old servants. With a casual toss, the Dominion’s Brush levitated above the head of the old servant. It produced a hazy glow as an ancient and profound presence pervaded the surroundings.","As Fang Jing produced a series of seals with her hand, the Dominion’s Brush immediately glowed brightly. Afterwards, a tremendous energy fell from it like a flood, turning into a curtain of energy that enveloped the servant.","Enveloped by the power of the Dominion’s Brush, a white bead slowly appeared above the servant’s head. It was only the size of a thumb. It was like white jade, shining with a hazy light as if it was some kind of ornamental gemstone.","When the white bead appeared, a presence unique to the Hole of Reincarnation filled the surroundings. It was very profound and bore the aura of the ways, which was very vague and difficult to describe.","But at this moment, the white bead began to tremble gently under the power of the Dominion’s Brush as if it feared something.","In the end, a seal fell down and stuck firmly onto the white bead. The white bead returned to the old servant’s body.","The white bead fell quiet, and the servant’s breakthrough came to a sudden halt. It had immediately deflated like a balloon.","“It’s finally been dealt with.” The two other servants who took part in suppressing him both let out sighs of relief before thanking Fang Jing.","Fang Jing stowed the Dominion’s Brush away and said without minding, “We’re all one family. Being so polite with one another instead makes us seem more like outsiders.” After a pause, Fang Jing gradually became stern and said to the three of them, “However, there is something that you must remember. The power of the Dominion’s Brush can only temporarily suppress your breakthrough. Your problem still has not been completely resolved. As a result, before my brother recovers his memories, you cannot try and break through. You even have to do your best to suppress any growth in your cultivation.”","“If you can’t keep it under control, remember to contact me immediately when you break through. In the present Immortals’ World, there’s probably no one else aside from me that can help you.”","“Thank you for your warning, your highness. We understand!” The three servants answered together.","However, one of the servants’ eyes shone with uncertainty. He said hesitantly, “Your highness, didn’t our master say that the Book of the Populace could also stop us from breaking through back then?”","“The Book of the Populace?” Fang Jing sneered as a hint of coldness flashed through her eyes. “The Book of the Populace can indeed stop it, given that the wielder knows the corresponding method and can wield the power of the Book of the Populace.”","“Without the corresponding method, without being able to wield the power of the Book of the Populace, it won’t be able to resolve anything even if it’s in the hands of a Grand Exalt.”","......","...","At this moment, in a foreign region of space far away from the Reverent Observance Heaven, Jian Chen sat on a damaged meteor. The mask from the Illusionary Daemon race and the Divine Armour of Heavenflight hid his presence flawlessly. None of it leaked out.","“ I’ve finally gotten my hands on the most important Energy-gathering Divine Mountain out of the eighteen. ” Jian Chen opened his hand slowly. The fist-sized Energy-gathering Divine Mountain appeared.","Gazing at the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in his hand, Jian Chen was unable to hide his excitement.","This excitement was even greater than when he originally obtained the three Energy-gathering Divine Mountains from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants.","The Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens was the most important one. In the past, he had managed to sense the whereabouts of the three divine mountains in the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants through it.","“There were some risks, but it’s all worth it as long as I’ve recovered this Energy-gathering Divine Mountain.” Jian Chen was in a great mood. Now that he had obtained the most crucial mountain, he could gradually track down the whereabouts of the other ones.","Afterwards, Jian Chen placed the newly-obtained Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in the Primeval Divine Hall, combining it with the three other mountains.","With that, the formation assembled from the four Energy-gathering Divine Mountains immediately gathered spiritual Qi several times faster than before.","“ The three divine mountains could gather spiritual Qi from three hundred million kilometres away. Now that I have four, the range has suddenly increased to a billion kilometres away... ” Jian Chen could not help but click his tongue in amazement as he sensed how much stronger it had become.","With just an additional Energy-gathering Divine Mountain, the rate at which it gathered spiritual Qi had increased by over nine times. That was unexpected.","However, the increase only consolidated Jian Chen’s determination to find the other divine mountains.","He had already realised that with each additional Energy-gathering Divine Mountain, the rate at which he gathered spiritual Qi would multiply. Once he got his hands on a fifth divine mountain, it was very likely for the range to surpass two billion kilometres.","At this moment, Su Le called out in Jian Chen’s soul. However, he did not reply immediately. Instead, he continued to remain in hiding, travelling across a few more regions of space using the Laws of Space before stopping.","“I’m already extremely far away from the Reverent Observance Heaven now. Those people shouldn’t be able to find me here.” Jian Chen looked around at the surroundings before hiding inside a meteor and entering his sea of consciousness."]},{"number":4004,"title":"Chapter 4004: Chapter 4005: The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt","paragraphs":["In the sea of consciousness, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul was still firmly suppressed. He was forced into a corner.","At this stage, none of the three sovereign god artifact spirits could overpower the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, but he could not fight back either. They were locked in a stalemate.","At this moment, a feeble soul hovered near the suppressive power created by the three sovereign god artifacts. It stared at the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul curiously in elation. Its eyes flickered with temptation like a hungry wolf circling a plump sheep.","The feeble soul was one of the seven experts who dwelled inside Jian Chen’s sea of consciousness, Su Le!","“What are you looking for me for?” Jian Chen’s voice rang out. Shortly afterwards, an illusionary figure condensed within the sea of consciousness.","“Sect master, are you planning on destroying this person’s soul or making him submit?” Su Le’s voice rang out. Her feminine voice sounded quite magnetic, making it extremely pleasant to the ear.","Shortly afterwards, her soul changed as well. It turned into a winged woman only the size of a palm. As her golden wings fanned gently, she radiated with rings of golden haze, which seemed to be filled with a sense of holiness.","Jian Chen glanced at the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul before looking at Su Le again. “You’re interested in him?”","Su Le’s eyes shone brightly with a sense of excitement. “Sect master, if you plan on destroying this soul, then we have an even better idea. Not only will it deal with this issue for you, but you can even make use of it in a better way.”","“Tell me in detail.” Jian Chen’s eyes lit up slightly. The matter that had troubled Jian Chen the most recently was a way to deal with the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul for good.","Jian Chen had tried persuasion, but the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul refused to acknowledge him. He was a prideful expert, unafraid of death.","As for destroying him, Jian Chen still was not capable of that.","“We can devour his soul and use his soul to help us recover,” said Su Le. Her eyes were filled with desire. The way she looked at the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul was as if he was highly nutritional food.","“You can even devour his soul?” Jian Chen was surprised. Devouring souls could not be achieved by just anyone, much less devouring the soul of an expert at such a high level.","At the very least, the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt who had already recovered his cultivation at the Fourth Heavenly Layer was powerless over the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul.","It was not because the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt was weak. The disparity between the Fourth Heavenly Layer and the Seventh Heavenly Layer was simply too large. There was a qualitative difference, one that could not be circumvented.","“If it’s just me, then no. After all, I’m too weak right now. With the strength of this soul, it probably won’t be me devouring him but him devouring me. However, there is someone among us who can because this is one of his innate abilities,” said Su Le.","“Who is he?” Jian Chen followed up.","“The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt!” Su Le said.","Jian Chen’s gaze immediately locked onto one of the six souls and awakened it.","The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt’s soul was also very feeble. He appeared as a palm-sized middle-aged man. He had a very bulky build, thick in the waist and the shoulders. He gave off a brawny presence.","“Hmm? I didn’t expect another fellow in the same circumstance to actually be trapped here.” When the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt discovered the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul, he was immediately surprised. There was also a hint of sympathy as someone in the same predicament.","“Eternal Peace, this is a great opportunity for us. It’ll all come down to whether you’re willing to put in the work.” Su Le told the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt about her thoughts.","The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt’s eyes shone brightly. He was extremely elated. He looked at Jian Chen eagerly with surprise. “Sect master, are you really willing to give this soul to us? This is a Seventh Heavenly Layer Grand Prime. If you can get him to submit to you, he’ll be of great assistance.”","“This person would rather die than submit. Since that’s the case, I’ll just give him to you,” Jian Chen said generously. Using the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul to help the seven souls recover some of their strength was already the best way to deal with this issue. It was not wasteful at all.","However, as Jian Chen looked at the feeble Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt before him, he could not help but have some second thoughts. “Though with your current ability, are you really able to devour this soul?”","The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt smiled rather awkwardly. “Definitely not in one go, but I can if I take my time. Although my soul is very weak right now, I was still an Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Prime in the past. Meanwhile, devouring his soul doesn’t come down to my strength but my natural ability.”","“Eternal Peace, I’ll lend you a hand. Let’s do this!” Su Le said rather impatiently.","Shortly afterwards, Su Le appeared behind the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt. She pressed her hand against his back gently and used a secret technique to channel the power of her soul into him.","The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt was stern. With Su Le’s support, the power of his soul immediately increased. Afterwards, he sucked in a deep breath as a strange power surged out. He directly targeted the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul.","When this power appeared, Jian Chen shivered inside. He felt like his own soul had become slightly unstable.","At this moment, he even developed the feeling that if the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt used this innate ability to devour his soul, even he would not be able to stop it.","At this moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul seemed to sense something. His soul fluctuated violently as pulses of power that were enough to startle Jian Chen surged out. If it were not from the suppression of the three sovereign god artifacts, Jian Chen would not have been able to withstand this power.","The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul seemed to be greatly threatened. His soul rapidly compressed together, becoming extremely consolidated. It seemed impregnable.","But in the end, he was not able to maintain his guard. A feeble wisp of the power of his soul was stripped away, hovering before the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt.","The power of this wisp of soul was around the strength of a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal’s.","However, this loss to the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was no different from losing a hair on his body.","“We’ve succeeded!” Su Le’s eyes lit up. She saw hope.","Jian Chen’s eyes narrowed. Despite the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt’s current feeble state, he had still managed to strip something from an expert as powerful as the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. He could not even guard against it. Such an innate ability shocked Jian Chen.","“Who are you?”","At this moment, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy spoke up. A blurry face appeared in his soul, staring straight at the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt. His eyes shone with a chilling light, naturally radiating with a sense of importance."]},{"number":4005,"title":"Chapter 4005: Chapter 4006: Strengthening Together","paragraphs":["“You’re actually asking who I am? And who are you?” The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt replied with a question.","“I am Clear and Cloudy of the Divine Sect of Ancient Souls. People call me the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy!” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s gaze was still fixed on the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt.","“Since you’ve stated your origins, I should return the favour too. Listen up. I am Eternal Peace. You can refer to me as the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt!” The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt chuckled.","“The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt? That can’t be right. In the entire Immortals’ World, there are only so many late Immortal Exalts. Every single one of them has made a name for themselves. However, there is no such Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt among these people,” the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy said sternly.","“Hahahaha, who said I’m from the Immortals’ World. I’m from the Saints’ World, so it’s perfectly normal if you haven’t heard of me before.” The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt sneered.","“An expert of the Saints’ World?” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s gaze immediately sharpened. He glared at Jian Chen and said coldly, “Junior, how dare you collude with the Saints’ World. Don’t you know that our Immortals’ World has always been mortal enemies with the Saints’ World?”","“Where are you seeing that I’m colluding with the Saints’ World? Can’t you tell that they’re already completely subservient to me?” Jian Chen stared at the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul. This was the first time they had communicated since the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy had been suppressed.","“Hmph, how can you make an expert like the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt yield to you with your ant-like strength?” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy responded subconsciously, but he regretted that as soon as he said it. After all, he could see how both the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt and Su Le treated Jian Chen like he was their master.","However, he was unable to believe how supreme experts like the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt and Su Le would actually lower their heads to an ant.","Even if this ant had tremendous fortune, obtaining three sovereign god artifacts, that was not enough for late Immortal Exalts to yield to him.","“Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy, I’ll give you a choice. Yield to me and your life will be spared.” Jian Chen offered an olive branch to the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy.","“You want me to submit? Hahahaha, why don’t you take a good look at yourself first? I might as well tell you this. Even if I perish here, I will never submit to you.” The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s laughter was rather mad. Afterwards, he sank into complete silence and no longer said anything.","Jian Chen was powerless. The Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was different from the seven experts of the Saints’ World. For the sake of survival, the seven experts were willing to accept humiliation and were willing to cast aside their dignity. As long as they could survive, they were willing to do anything.","On the other hand, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy was someone who would rather die than yield.","By now, the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt had already begun refining the sliver of soul that he had forcefully stripped from the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy. Even though this sliver was very weak, only equivalent to the strength of a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, it was still highly beneficial to the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt with how feeble he was right now.","Su Le ventured forward. Her eyes shone greedily, also wanting a piece of this, but she was sternly warned by the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt. “Don’t touch. This wisp of his soul has yet to leave his main body completely. In your state, you will only face great danger if you touch it recklessly.”","When she heard that, Su Le quickly retreated, but she did not forget to remind him. “I helped out too. Don’t forget about my share.”","“Don’t worry, your share will be here.” The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt was stern. A grindstone appeared between his hands. This was produced by his innate ability. As the grindstone spun, it ground away at the wisp of the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul again and again.","Jian Chen watched closely. He could clearly feel that with each grinding, the wisp of soul stripped from the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy became slightly clearer as if some of the impurities inside, or something else, had been slowly crushed and eliminated.","“Sigh, if I were in my peak condition, it would be nowhere near this troublesome. I’d just swallow him in a single gulp, but now, I’m forced to be careful.” The Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt sighed gently.","Very soon, the wisp of soul had been completely cleansed. It turned into a wisp of power of the soul, something akin to a puresoul, but it was still slightly lacklustre compared to a true puresoul.","The Eternal Peace Daemon Sovereign split the power of the soul into three portions. He kept one of the portions for himself before giving the second to Su Le.","“Sect master, this is yours.” With a wide smile, the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt offered the third portion to Jian Chen.","Jian Chen hesitated for a moment before absorbing it decisively. He immediately felt his soul grow by a negligible amount.","After all, it was only equivalent to the soul of a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, and it had been split into three portions. That was obviously insignificant to Jian Chen now.","Jian Chen shut his eyes and savoured it closely. He furrowed his brows very soon. He had already detected a small issue hidden inside. The wisp of power he had just absorbed struggled to fuse with his soul perfectly. A gap between them existed, which required further refinement before he could turn it completely into his own power.","“ It still can’t match a puresoul after all. ” Jian Chen sighed inside. Shortly afterwards, he looked at Su Le and the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt. They had just finished absorbing their wisp of power as well. As if they had just eaten something highly nutritious, their feeble souls immediately strengthened substantially.","“Wonderful! Wonderful! Wonderful! This is just too wonderful! Once we absorb Clear and Cloudy’s soul completely, we’ll definitely recover substantially.” After tasting the benefits, the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt was unable to hide his excitement. Su Le was elated as well. She could see the hope of recovery.","“Since this works, then you can recover together,” said Jian Chen. He awakened the five other slumbering souls. Before he had awakened the generals in the Primeval Divine Hall, he could not let the seven experts recover too much of their strength, just in case they escaped his control.","Immediately, the souls of Bai Jinchi, the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt, the Might Venerable, the Red Phosphor Grand Prime, and the Unparalleled Emperor all gathered over.","Apart from Bai Chijin and the Origin Composition Daemon Exalt, the five other people had all been Eighth Heavenly Layer Grand Primes during their peak.","“Eternal Peace, why didn’t you wake us up earlier if there was something so good? You’ve gone too far...”","“Eternal Peace, we all have to serve the sect master now. We’re all in one boat. You can’t be as selfish as you were before anymore...”","“To think you wanted to keep it all to yourself. If the sect master didn’t tell us, we wouldn’t have even known...”","The five souls all interjected one after another. Their eyes shone brightly, unable to hide their excitement.","Compared to the high spirits of the five souls, the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt instead had a frown. Even just splitting the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul into two and sharing it with Su Le was insufficient. Now that five other people had appeared, there was even less to go around.","At the same time, the blurry face appeared again on the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s suppressed soul. He gazed at the seven souls deeply. He was unable to hide the shock in the depths of his eyes.","This time, the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy did not say anything just like before. He was very prideful."]},{"number":4006,"title":"Chapter 4006: Chapter 4007: The Taiji Heaven","paragraphs":["Afterwards, the six other souls all gathered around the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt as they rubbed their hands enthusiastically, urging him on excitedly and eagerly.","After a period of rest, the Eternal Peace Daemon Exalt began to use his innate ability a second time, forcefully extracting another wisp from the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul.","The wisp was still at the strength of a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. Afterwards, it was split into eight portions. Jian Chen also received a tiny portion.","Originally, Jian Chen wanted to decline it. He did not want to absorb the Ancestor of the Clear and Cloudy’s soul, as it came nowhere close to puresouls. He was worried about it leaving behind any latent issues. After all, he was not like the seven experts. They were all once late Immortal Exalts. Their methods were all exceptional, and their abilities were extraordinary. They did not fear these latent issues.","But after further thought, he was unable to resist the temptation in the end. He planned on stopping after absorbing a little. That way, even if there were latent problems, he could control the impact appropriately.","“ My primary goal now is to gather the remaining Energy-gathering Divine Mountains. It’ll completely come down to the Energy-gathering Divine Mountains to determine when the seven experts will recover their full strength. ”","“ As long as I place the seven experts into the bodies of the generals in the Primeval Divine Hall, I don’t have to worry about them betraying me at all. By then, even if I’m up against a heavenly emperor, I’ll be able to fight back. I won’t have to hide away anymore. ”","“ If the Divine Formation of the Heavens is completed and it can truly demonstrate its power as a Grand Exalt’s formation, I’ll be able to maneuvre around when I face a Grand Exalt even if I can’t defeat them. ”","“ Though for the complete Divine Formation of the Heavens, I do have enough Immortal Exalts and Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. I’m just lacking quite a few Immortal Emperors and Immortal Monarchs... ” Jian Chen calculated inside.","His current strength had basically been elevated to the maximum already. No matter how he tried in the future, he would struggle to overcome these invisible shackles.","Due to being part of the Martial Soul lineage, he would struggle to reach Immortal Exalt with his comprehension. In other words, no matter what kind of laws he comprehended, the Ninth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor would be his limit.","If it were only the restrictions from the Martial Soul lineage, then that would be fine. When the Martial Soul lineage produced nine successors in its history, the nine successors could work together and force open a crack in the curse that prevented them from reaching Immortal Exalt. That way, even if the Martial Soul lineage could not reach Immortal Exalt in comprehension, their cultivation would not be limited.","However, Jian Chen happened to cultivate the Chaotic Body. The Chaotic Body also struggled to reach Immortal Exalt.","The eighteenth layer was the limit. He had yet to find a way to reach the nineteenth layer that came afterwards.","As a result, the only method that Jian Chen could think of right now to increase his strength was to rely on foreign sources.","“ And there’s the mysterious tribulation that the sword spirits are talking about too. I’m not that weak anymore. I’ve basically reached the limit of what I’m capable of. I wonder when this mysterious tribulation is going to happen and what form it will take. ” Jian Chen felt a vague sense of danger. He struggled to imagine just how terrifying the mysterious tribulation that even fazed the twin swords would be.","In the past, the twin swords choosing him and the Primeval Divine Hall’s recognition were both connected to this tribulation.","It was as if the tribulation allowed the twin swords and the Primeval Divine Hall to see just how extraordinary he was.","“ I need to retrieve the lost Energy-gathering Divine Mountains, but I also need to further strengthen the Divine Formation of the Heavens, ” a figure suddenly flashed through Jian Chen’s mind. His gaze began to flicker. He was hesitant.","“ Perhaps I need to see if I can rope in an Immortal Emperor. Even though it’s not very likely, I still have to give it a try. ” Jian Chen’s gaze gradually became determined. Shortly afterwards, he took out a star chart and gained his bearings before heading off into the sea of stars.","At the same time, he disassembled the four Energy-gathering Divine Mountains in the Primeval Divine Hall again. He continued to use three Energy-gathering Divine Mountains to gather spiritual Qi from areas far away from the Primeval Divine Hall. He kept the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain from the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens on hand. He would sense it every now and then, searching for the other divine mountains.","In an unknown space in the Immortals’ World, a colossal chessboard replaced the surrounding stars. This was the match between the Heavenly Talisman Venerable and the Wicked Immortal Elder. It seemed like a game of chess, but it was another form of intense conflict. The two of them were evenly matched.","The space outside the Reverent Observance Heaven would split open from time to time, forming a terrifying crack that stretched across the entire place. At the same time, powerful presences would emerge from inside, leaving the countless cultivators of the Reverent Observance Heaven in fright.","This was the battle between the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor and the Dungeon Demon God. The Dungeon Demon God had specially come for the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor. He wanted to prevent him from obtaining the sovereign god artifact, so the battle between them would not be ending any time soon.","The news that Jian Chen had appeared on the Reverent Observance Heaven spread through the thirty-three heavens in an extremely short time. Many experts across the Immortals’ World all gathered on the Reverent Observance Heaven.","The arrival of these people immediately pushed the number of Immortal Exalts on the Reverent Observance Heaven to a historic high.","“What? The formation in Jian Chen’s possession can even heavily injure the Space-splitting Venerable of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants?”","“The Space-splitting Venerable is a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, yet even he can’t withstand the formation’s attack. That’s just unbelievable.”","“The worst part of it is that the formation can launch two attacks. That doesn’t match the rumours at all...”","A group of Immortal Exalts, tempted by the sovereign god artifact, had gathered outside the Reverent Observance Heaven. When they received the most recent news, many of their faces changed. They became wary and concerned.","“From what has happened recently, it looks like Jian Chen is nowhere near as easy to deal with as we imagined. If we handle it badly, it might even cost us our lives. Should we continue with this or not?”","“Hehehe, with risk comes reward. Since you want to contend for this opportunity, shouldn’t you bear the risk as well...”","“Whatever, I’m not going to compete with you. You can go fight over it yourselves. Even if this is a tremendous opportunity, you’ll need to be fortunate enough to enjoy it...”","Jian Chen’s feats in battle on the Reverent Observance Heaven had scared off a few Immortal Exalts. Immediately, many of them scattered, backing out of this struggle.","The people who backed out were all relatively weaker. Everyone who remained were the experts.","Some of the experts had already gathered in groups of threes and fives, forming alliances. They contemplated how they would find where Jian Chen was hiding together.","Yet at this moment, the root of it all, Jian Chen, had already arrived on the Taiji Heaven without anyone knowing.","The Taiji Heaven had over twenty peak organisations with Immortal Exalts. However, among these peak organisations, most of them only had early Immortal Exalts. Only a handful possessed mid Immortal Exalts.","The Black Demon Palace was one of the more reputed organisations on the Taiji Heaven. Not only did they have a mid Immortal Exalt, but they had more than just one of them.","On this day, outside the Black Demon Palace, the tremendous presence of a mid Immortal Emperor suddenly appeared, approaching the Black Demon Palace slowly.","The appearance of this presence broke the peace of the Black Demon Palace. The presences of multiple Immortal Emperors erupted from the depths of the Black Demon Palace, rushing over in an overwhelming manner.","“Who dares to infringe on our Black Demon Palace!”","As an elderly voice rang out from the depths of the Black Demon Palace, multiple Immortal Emperors appeared silently, arriving outside the sect formation in a flash.","An old man in cloth robes hovered before these great elders of the Black Demon Palace, radiating with the presence of a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","“Sir, who are you? Why are you trying to provoke our Black Demon Palace?” the great elder barked. With a single glance, he recognised that the person before him was not from the Taiji Heaven. After all, he knew all of the Immortal Emperors on the Taiji Heaven. There was no such person like this.","“You’ve misunderstood, fellows. I’ve come with rich gifts to visit the Black Demon Palace. I have no intentions of provocation. If I have caused you any disrespect, please forgive me.” The old man in cloth robes withdrew his presence. He was very polite in demeanor. As he said that, he took out a jade box and slowly passed it towards the great elders of the Black Demon Palace.","The leading great elder accepted the jade box. He glanced at the old man doubtfully before opening the box slowly.","Immediately, bright, hazy light flowed out from the jade box, together with a heavy fragrance.","The great elders of the Black Demon Palace immediately recognised the item. Their faces all changed because it was a high grade God Tier heavenly resource.","Under ordinary circumstances, only Immortal Exalts possessed heavenly resources of such quality. They were the primary people who used them.","The great elders from the Black Demon Palace eased up slightly. They would have to be more than simply sincere for an Immortal Emperor to present them a high grade God Tier heavenly resource as a gift.","“May I ask where you’re from and which organization you originate from, sir?” a great elder of the Black Demon Palace asked. He was clearly more friendly than before.","“I wander the Immortals’ World with no fixed residence. However, I have come to your Black Demon Palace this time because I want to meet with an acquaintance.” The old man in cloth robes smiled gently.","“Oh? And you have an acquaintance in our Black Demon Palace? May I ask who it is?”","“Her name is Xue Shuangyue!” the old man said.","However, when they heard her name, the great elders of the Black Demon Palace’s faces all changed slightly. They furrowed their brows and stared at the old man. They were clearly doubtful.","“Fellow, do you really know elder Xue? In our Black Demon Palace, elder Xue’s status is different from other great elders. If you’re lying through your teeth about this, the consequences will be quite severe,” one of the great elders said sternly.","The old man was unfazed. He clasped his fist. “Please help me pass on a word to fellow Xue. I have something to discuss with her. As for my exact identity, fellow Xue will naturally find out who I am once I meet with her.”","“If that’s the case, then we’ll help you pass on the word. Whether elder Xue wants to meet with you or not is not something we can decide,” said one of the great elders.","Afterwards, the old man was invited into one of the discussion halls of the Black Demon Palace. One of the Immortal Emperor great elders stayed behind to accompany him, while the others all dispersed."]},{"number":4007,"title":"Chapter 4007: Chapter 4008: Xue Ji","paragraphs":["In the discussion hall, the great elder who remained behind to accompany him spoke incessantly, introducing some of the glorious history and startling events of the Black Demon Palace. As he mentioned these fascinating matters, he could not help but show great pride.","“Oh right, and there’s that Immortal Emperor called Yang Yutian who’s recently appeared in the Immortals’ World. He’s used multiple identities as disguises like Jian Chen of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, the Thousand Immortal General Chang Yang of the Observance Heaven City, as well as Yang Yutian of the Skyscraping World. Even to this day, no one is certain what his true identity is. However, this person is very outstanding. He’s just an Immortal Emperor, yet he managed to stir up such a great mess in the Immortals’ World. Many Immortal Exalts have tried pursuing and encircling him, but he’s still managed to escape...”","At this moment, the great elder changed the topic of conversation and began discussing the most popular matter recently with deep emotion.","“I’ve heard about this as well. The reason why Yang Yutian managed to escape from a group of Immortal Exalts is just due to the treasures in his possession,” the old man in cloth robes commented. He spoke calmly.","“Even with such treasures, an Immortal Emperor will still struggle to escape from the interception of a group of mid or even late Immortal Exalts. As a result, even if you ignore his treasures, Yang Yutian’s abilities are still unprecedented. Even throughout the history of the Immortals’ World, you won’t be able to find many prodigies like that.” The great elder from the Black Demon Palace spoke with great admiration. He also offered up an endless stream of respect internally.","As an Immortal Emperor, he understood just how unbelievable it was for a fellow Immortal Emperor to maneuver around with ease through an encirclement involving a group of Immortal Exalts and even heavenly emperors.","When he heard that, the old man only smiled.","The two of them chatted leisurely in the discussion hall as they waited patiently. After four whole hours, the great elder of the Black Demon Palace, Xue Shuangyue, finally arrived gracefully.","She was a woman dressed in black clothes. Despite seeming to be in her forties already, time had not left too many traces on her face, so she maintained some of her alluring beauty from her younger years.","Xue Shuangyue clearly possessed significant status in the Black Demon Palace. As soon as she arrived, the accompanying great elder of the Black Demon Palace stood up in a hurry and clasped his fist rather respectfully towards her.","Xue Shuangyue nodded towards the great elder before looking at the old man. Her gaze immediately turned coldened. “Who are you? I don’t seem to know you.”","“Elder Xue, do you really not recognise this person?” The great elder’s face immediately changed slightly. His gaze towards the old man turned slightly cold as well.","The old man smiled gently and said, “Fellow Xue, it’s not convenient for us to speak here. Could we step aside and talk?”","Xue Shuangyue stared at the old man emotionlessly for a moment before saying calmly, “Elder Hua, could you pass on the word to forbid nearby disciples from approaching this place?”","“Alright, I’ll go and make arrangements immediately.” The great elder understood what she was saying. He knew she was dismissing him, so he left the discussion hall without any hesitation.","However, as soon as he left the discussion hall, the senses of his soul extended out, contacting the other great elders in the depths of the Black Demon Palace.","“ That Immortal Emperor deceived us. Elder Xue doesn’t know him, ” elder Hua communicated.","“ Is that the case? But don’t panic. He won’t be able to stir up much of a mess in the territory of our Black Demon Palace... ”","“ They still gifted us a high grade God Tier heavenly resource after all. They’re a guest. Even if they’re hiding their identity, it doesn’t change that fact... ”","“ Let’s wait and see. As long as he doesn’t do anything over the top, we’ll treat him as a guest... ”","“ Though we can’t afford to be careless either. After all, elder Xue’s identity is special... ”","In the depths of the Black Demon Palace, the great elders who were originally indifferent about what happened here all released the senses of their souls to pay close attention to the situation in the discussion hall.","As Xue Shuangyue produced a seal in the discussion hall, a barrier of light immediately draped down, isolating the entire hall from the outside world.","The barrier of light did not possess any particularly powerful defences. Its primary purpose was to isolate sound and block off senses of the soul.","“Tell me, who exactly are you? What are you looking for me for?” Xue Shuangyue looked at the old man in cloth robes like she was interrogating him.","The old man’s eyes shone with a strange colour. He stared straight at Xue Shuangyue and gradually became stern. “I’ve come to find you because I hope you can return to the sect, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.”","When she heard that, Xue Shuangyue’s face immediately changed. Her gaze became extremely sharp. She said softly, “Who exactly are you?”","At this moment, the old man’s presence changed. He was no longer a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor but a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","As his presence changed, even his appearance morphed in an overwhelming manner. He went from an old man in his golden years to a young man with a resolute face.","“It’s you!” Xue Shuangyue’s eyes narrowed. She was surprised.","She was not unfamiliar with this person. When she paid a visit to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens on the Reverent Observance Heaven, he was the sect master at the time, Jian Chen!","However, Jian Chen was merely a nameless individual back then. In Xue Shuangyue’s eyes, he was only a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal with a mysterious backing.","But now, his name was already known by many experts of the Immortals’ World.","“Xue Ji, do you still recognise your former identity as a disciple of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens?” Jian Chen stared at Xue Shuangyue with a shining gaze.","When she heard the name Xue Ji, Xue Shuangyue could not help but tremble. Her expression became mixed as if some old memories that she had sealed away a long time ago had just been awakened.","Jian Chen stood there and stared at Xue Shuangyue quietly.","Xue Shuangyue remained silent for a very long time before saying slowly, “Xue Ji of the past is already dead. My identity is now Xue Shuangyue, a great elder of the Black Demon Palace.”","When he heard that, Jian Chen sighed gently. “If you’ve really relinquished your identity as a disciple of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, you wouldn’t have silently assisted the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens over all these years, much less personally visit the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens to ask me about my identity face to face.”","“The reason why you did all that was because you still recognise your identity as a disciple of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.”","Xue Ji sucked in a deep breath and forcefully suppressed her emotions. She stared at Jian Chen in interest. “And what is your true identity? Why are you actively getting involved in this mess?”","“Yang Yutian and Chang Yang are both my pseudonyms. Jian Chen is my true name. As for my identity, I am the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, a person who bears great hopes, wanting to lead the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens to greatness again.”"]},{"number":4008,"title":"Chapter 4008: Chapter 4009: Roping in a Former Member","paragraphs":["“I know that you’re currently the master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, but that’s not what I’m asking. What I really want to know is the identity that most people in the Immortals’ World don’t know about. For example, who is behind you?” Xue Shuangyue had calmed down completely. Her eyes recovered her former coldness, staring straight at Jian Chen. “Our Black Demon Palace also carried out an extremely close investigation into you. While we can’t say we know everything, we have grasped quite a lot of information about you. As a result, don’t even think about using information that everyone knows to try and deceive me.”","“In the Immortals’ World, apart from the people in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, I basically have no one else behind me. Of course, there are still some experts in the Immortals’ World who still secretly support the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. I’m sure you know that too, so I won’t elaborate on it,” said Jian Chen.","Xue Shuangyue shook her head. She still refused to believe Jian Chen’s words as she said, “You still refuse to tell me the truth. If there are no other factors at play, why did the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor of the Heavenly Star Palace go to such great lengths to assist you? As for the explanation that the sovereign god artifact on you has caught the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor’s eye, I don’t really care about what other people think, but I’m extremely certain that the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor wasn’t after the sovereign god artifact on you.”","“What relationship do you have with the Heavenly Star Palace, or should I say the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor?” Xue Shuangyue stared at Jian Chen in interest.","From how she behaved, Jian Chen knew that Xue Shuangyue had gotten the wrong idea. She probably thought he had some kind of hidden familial connection to the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.","After all, the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor had provided him with tremendous assistance outside the Skyscraping World. He even went as far as to make an enemy out of the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, facing him in battle.","Although there would be some skirmishes between heavenly emperors, figures at their heights rarely took action personally. For the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor to go to such great lengths for Jian Chen, his support for Jian Chen must have been beyond belief.","“I have no relationship with the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor. The reason why the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor assisted me is simply because I’m the sect master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.” Jian Chen smiled.","“In all these years, you’re not the only sect master that’s appeared in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. The previous sect master, Chen Shuzhi, served as the sect master for all those years, but he never received such treatment. Why did you deserve such great support from the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor instead?” Xue Shuangyue continued to ask. She knew that Jian Chen was indeed extraordinary. Not only was he a peak Immortal Emperor, but he also possessed a sovereign god artifact.","But in her eyes, even with all these outstanding factors, Jian Chen was not enough for a heavenly emperor to go to such lengths.","“I’m different from Chen Shuzhi. Chen Shuzhi’s true identity was a member of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants. No matter how flawlessly he hid his identity, he could not fool those peak experts. That’s why he never received the support of some peak experts despite being the sect master.”","“I’m different. I’m truly working towards the revival of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, which is why senior heavenly emperor was willing to assist me,” Jian Chen said seriously.","“Do you take me for a fool? You’ve earned the support of figures like heavenly emperors from your enthusiasm alone? If that really was the case, who knows how many people in the Immortals’ World would receive the assistance of heavenly emperors. Jian Chen, you’re still hiding this from me. Perhaps I can also suspect that you possess unspeakable motives for slipping into the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens as well,” Xue Shuangyue said coldly.","Jian Chen sighed gently. He was powerless. “Fellow Xue Ji, why don’t we talk about something else? You must be aware of my current predicament. Right now, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens is at its most important moment. It desperately needs the addition of experts like fellow Xue Ji. I was wondering if you’d be willing to offer up some of your strength to restore the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens to its former glory.”","“I don’t trust you.” Xue Shuangyue’s expression did not change.","Jian Chen furrowed his brows. After some thought, he said, “Then do you trust elder Nong?”","When she heard elder Nong, Xue Shuangyue’s gaze fluctuated. To the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, elder Nong could be described as a living fossil. He was born during the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens’ most glorious time. He had witnessed the rise and fall of the sect and had survived till its current decline.","In the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, elder Nong perhaps was not very powerful, but he was definitely the most senior, revered by all disciples.","“I want to meet elder Nong,” said Xue Shuangyue.","“Sure!” Jian Chen nodded and immediately contacted the artifact spirit of the Primeval Divine Hall. In the next moment, elder Nong was sent out with a flash.","“Greetings, sect master!” As soon as he appeared, elder Nong bowed towards Jian Chen. The respect he showed completely originated from the bottom of his heart.","“Elder Nong, fellow Xue wanted to meet with you, which was why I brought you out,” Jian Chen said very casually to elder Nong.","“Greetings, senior Xue!” Elder Nong turned around and clasped his fist towards Xue Shuangyue.","Gazing at the old man before her, Xue Shuangyue’s expression was slightly mixed. After a moment of silence, she said gently, “Elder Nong, you are highly respected in the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Do you really believe this person can bring a new future to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens instead of leading it to its destruction?”","“I trust the sect master. If even the sect master can’t achieve this, then the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens has no future to discuss,” elder Nong said in guarantee.","“Elder Nong, I never thought your faith in this person would reach such a level of blindness. It truly surprises me.” At this moment, a vigorous voice rang out from nowhere. A middle-aged man silently appeared beside Xue Shuangyue.","“Greetings, Black Heaven Master!” Elder Nong bowed in a hurry.","Jian Chen was not surprised by the middle-aged man’s appearance at all. He clasped his fist calmly and said, “Greetings Black Heaven Master!”","Before he came to the Black Demon Palace, Jian Chen had investigated quite a bit about the Black Demon Palace. He was obviously extremely familiar with the Black Heaven Master.","The Black Heaven Master was a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt and the first ancestor of the Black Demon Palace. At the same time, he was Xue Shuangyue’s husband.","Xue Shuangyue looked at the Black Heaven Master in a questioning manner. Actually, meeting with elder Nong was not her idea but her husband’s.","At this moment, the Black Heaven Master also gazed at elder Nong deeply. From the moment elder Nong appeared, he could see just how much respect elder Nong had towards Jian Chen.","That was respect and admiration completely from the bottom of his heart. He completely obeyed any order from Jian Chen. He had never behaved like this even during the period when the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had three Immortal Emperors.","The Black Heaven Master had already seen elder Nong when the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had three Immortal Emperors, so he obviously noticed his attitude towards them.","At this moment, the Black Heaven Master looked at Jian Chen and sighed. “Jian Chen, have you ever considered that getting Shuangyue to join the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens at a time like this is actually harming her? You can’t even protect yourself right now, so why rope Shuangyue into it? Don’t tell me Shuangyue alone is able to change your current situation?”","“Let alone just Shuangyue. Even if you throw in our entire Black Demon Palace, you won’t be able to change your current situation.”"]},{"number":4009,"title":"Chapter 4009: Chapter 4010: Xue Ji Enters the Primeval Divine Hall","paragraphs":["When he heard the Black Heaven Master mention getting the entire Black Demon Palace to join, Jian Chen’s eyes immediately lit up. “Black Heaven Master, please forgive me for asking this, but how many Immortal Emperors does the Black Demon Palace have in total?”","The Black Heaven Master furrowed his brows slightly as if he had never expected a question like this from Jian Chen, but he still replied, “Over twenty in total!”","As a peak organisation that had multiple Immortal Exalts and their strongest expert was even a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, possessing over twenty Immortal Emperors was basically up to standard.","Jian Chen became tempted. He only had nine Immortal Emperors with him right now. If he could rope in the Black Demon Palace, then the number of Immortal Emperors would directly rise above thirty.","Jian Chen held back this temptation and clasped his fist. “Black Heaven Master, there is something that you’re right about. Even if the Black Demon Palace got involved, I won’t be able to completely change my current situation, as I don’t have the power to fend off Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts for the time being.”","When he reached there, Jian Chen paused as his eyes shone with a strange colour. He said in guarantee, “But as long as Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts don’t get involved, then I’ll be able to maneuvre around in front of any kind of opponent.”","The Divine Formation of the Heavens’ current strength was already on par with Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts. If he had the three Immortal Exalts, over twenty Immortal Emperors, and the several dozen Immortal Monarchs of the Black Demon Palace, the formation would definitely grow substantially in power. Perhaps he could not fend off Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, but he would be able to contend against Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts at the very least.","The Black Heaven Master glared at him and said in exasperation, “You’re really thinking of getting our Black Demon Palace to join you? I’ll tell you loudly and clearly that it’s impossible. Don’t even think about it. Even if you already possess the terrifying power to contend against heavenly emperors, let alone Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, our Black Demon Palace will never get involved in this mess.”","“The legacy and lineage of our Black Demon Palace stands above all else. If we get involved with the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, our Black Demon Palace will face destruction at any moment.”","“The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens is attached to too many matters. It’s not something that our Black Demon Palace can get involved with.”","Jian Chen looked at Xue Shuangyue and said sternly, “Fellow Xue Ji, I formally extend an invitation to you as the master of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. I hope you can return to the sect, as the sect right now is in desperate need of experts like you.”","“Jian Chen, Shuangyue’s strength is well below yours. You are harming her.” The Black Heaven Master sighed gently. There was no anger or fury in his voice, only a sense of helplessness.","“Senior, I know you’re very worried about fellow Xue Ji. However, if the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens truly wants to be restored, I alone am not enough. I need the assistance of even more disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. Perhaps this will endanger fellow Xue Ji, but I can guarantee you that if one day, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens really faces the misfortune of destruction, I will definitely be the one to die first.” Jian Chen stressed his words, demonstrating his determination that even triumphed over death.","Afterwards, he looked at Xue Shuangyue with shining eyes. His gaze gradually sharped. “Of course, you’re welcome to decline as well, fellow Xue Ji. If you refuse, I won’t force it on you. I’ll leave immediately, and I won’t disturb you ever again.”","“Fellow Xue Ji, I want to know your decision now.”","Xue Shuangyue’s gaze flickered rapidly, filled with struggle and hesitation. From time to time, a sense of determination would appear in her gaze as if she wanted to cast aside all qualms and do what she had always wanted to do.","But shortly afterwards, she would think of something, and she would begin to hesitate again.","“Shuangyue... Sigh...” The Black Heaven Master looked at Xue Ji gently and painfully as if he wanted to say something, but it ultimately turned into a lengthy sigh.","The two of them had spent so many days and nights together, so how could the Black Heaven Master not understand Xue Shuangyue’s heart? Xue Shuangyue had already changed her appearance and severed her past, even becoming one of the great elders of the Black Demon Palace.","But in reality, she had never forgotten about her past sect. She held feelings that she was unable to drop. Even after a million years, it was unable to wash away the sense of connection that lay buried in the bottom of her heart.","That was why she had always been assisting the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens silently over all these years. Even though it was not much, it was enough to see her intentions.","“You have a sovereign god artifact on you?” After a moment of silence, Xue Shuangyue suddenly asked Jian Chen.","Jian Chen nodded. This had stopped being a secret a long time ago.","“Are the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens all inside the sovereign god artifact?” Xue Shuangyue continued.","“That’s right!”","“I want to take a look at the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens right now,” said Xue Shuangyue.","Jian Chen smiled gently. “Let me get the artifact spirit to send you inside. Don’t resist.”","Xue Shuangyue immediately felt a suction force appear from thin air. The force was not powerful. She could easily break free from it with her strength as an Immortal Emperor, but she did not resist it.","In the next moment, Xue Shuangyue vanished, having entered the Primeval Divine Hall already.","“Senior, would you like to go in and take a look too?” Jian Chen then looked at the Black Heaven Master.","The Black Heaven Master shook his head. A hint of wariness flashed through the depths of his eyes. This was a sovereign god artifact. Once he entered it, he would be put at a disadvantage.","Elder Nong also returned to the Primeval Divine Hall. Jian Chen manifested inside the Primeval Divine Hall as a wisp of his soul, condensing an illusionary figure that personally led the way. He toured the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens with Xue Shuangyue. All of the disciples he encountered along the way bowed towards him respectfully. Their eyes were filled with fervour and admiration.","In the eyes of many of the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, Jian Chen had already become a god-like existence.","In the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, Xue Shuangyue’s eyes were filled with reminiscence and mixed feelings. She traversed each mountain at a steady pace and crossed rivers after rivers. Her face was filled with emotion and sighs.","“Compared to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens in the past, there has indeed been an overwhelming change. In the recent years, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens has indeed become much more powerful under your leadership,” said Xue Shuangyue. She smiled gently. It seemed that seeing the changes that the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens had gone through put her in a much better mood.","“I heard you emptied out the entire Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants?”","“Yeah. Most of what you see is an offering from the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants.” Jian Chen smiled gently.","“But this is all nothing. C’mon, I’ll show you the real foundations of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.”","Afterwards, Jian Chen brought Xue Shuangyue to where the Divine Formation of the Heavens was set up.","As soon as they reached there, a swirl of spiritual Qi gathered from the surroundings. This was a phenomenon created from several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals absorbing the spiritual Qi of the world.","Even though she had already heard that Jian Chen had several tens of thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, when Xue Shuangyue truly saw fifty thousand of them sitting before her, she was still unable to hide her shock.","She struggled to imagine how Jian Chen had managed to assemble fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","There was not a single peak organisation in the Immortals’ World that would produce fifty thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","“This is the formation you possess?” Xue Shuangyue glanced past the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals and immediately recognised that they sat in a particular order, assembling a profound formation.","From even further away, she could sense the presence of a few Immortal Emperors.","Jian Chen nodded and sighed. “This is the Divine Formation of the Heavens, the protective formation from the Observance Heaven City. It is a Grand Exalt’s formation, but we can’t unleash its full power due to insufficient numbers. Currently, it is only equivalent to a regular Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt.”","“When I invited you to join the sect, it was actually to strengthen this formation. Only if this formation grows in power will our Sword Sect of Violet Heavens become even more confident in our power.”"]},{"number":4010,"title":"Chapter 4010: Chapter 4011: Another Recruited","paragraphs":["As she listened to Jian Chen’s introduction of the Divine Formation of the Heavens, a strange colour flashed through Xue Shuangyue’s eyes.","She had obviously heard of the reputed Divine Formation of the Heavens before. Now that the declining Sword Sect of Violet Heavens possessed such a profound formation, she was filled with delight.","“Greetings, sect master!”","At this moment, several Immortal Emperors in the distance sensed Xue Shuangyue’s presence and gathered over. Afterwards, they bowed towards Jian Chen, showing great respect.","“Hmm? Is this another new fellow joining us? Sect master, why don’t you introduce her to us?” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt’s voice rang out. A dark cloud surged in the surroundings, rapidly condensing into a middle-aged man of a particularly tall and large stature.","The Immortal Devouring Orchid also gathered over. It shrank to a fraction of its original size, wrapping around Jian Chen’s wrist intimately like a blade of grass. It acted like it was a bracelet.","Jian Chen gave a simple introduction of Xue Shuangyue to everyone before telling her, “They are all experts of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens right now. They are all working for the sect.”","“Senior, you’re a Demon Exalt. Why do you obey Jian Chen who’s only an Immortal Emperor?” Xue Shuangyue looked at the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. Clearly, she was a little cautious of him.","“Hehehehe, little girl, the sect master’s cultivation might not be high, but his methods are beyond imagination. Being able to serve right beside him is my greatest honour.” The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt let out a strange laugh.","“Even the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor has seen the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt. The Thousand Soul Demon Exalt is completely trustworthy,” Jian Chen added at an appropriate time. 一听到乱星天帝,雪霜月顿时为之动容,心中已经意识到如千魂魔尊这样的强者肯屈尊于剑尘麾下,那必然是乱星天帝的功劳。","When she heard him mention the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor, Xue Shuangyue’s expression changed. She had already assumed that an expert like the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt was willing to serve under Jian Chen due to the Chaotic Star Heavenly Emperor.","As for what the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt said, she only treated it as making conversation.","After all, in her eyes, Jian Chen simply was not Daowei Chengqing at the end of the day. No matter how extraordinary he was, he definitely could not make a Demon Exalt become his follower with the strength of an Immortal Emperor.","Afterwards, Xue Shuangyue looked at the Immortal Devouring Orchid on Jian Chen’s wrist. When she sensed the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s presence as an Immortal Exalt, she was shocked once again.","This time, the shock she felt was even stronger than when she saw how obedient the Thousand Soul Demon Exalt was.","That was because she could tell the Immortal Devouring Orchid’s affection and intimacy with Jian Chen could not be faked.","A mighty Immortal Exalt plant actually demonstrated such behaviour towards a measly Immortal Emperor. Xue Shuangyue basically found that inconceivable.","“So it’s all true,” Xue Shuangyue murmured. She thought of the various rumours in the Immortals’ World regarding Jian Chen.","Rumours were just rumours at the end of the day. Only when she personally entered the Primeval Divine Hall did she confirm them.","After leaving the Primeval Divine Hall, Xue Shuangyue seemed to become quite unsettled. Her gaze constantly drifted away as her expression changed time and time again.","In the Primeval Divine Hall, she witnessed the changes of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens. She saw all those disciples cultivating and the source of confidence for the sect.","Without any exaggeration, she would have never expected the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens to change so much.","She also saw a glimmer of hope towards the restoration of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.","The Black Heaven Master gazed deeply at Xue Shuangyue. “Shuangyue, I don’t know what you saw, nor do I want to know. I only want to tell you that even if the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens has decent foundations and has a method to threaten Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts, that’s still not enough for self-preservation. If you rashly join the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens and some accidents occur in the future, even I will be powerless.”","“At the same time, you have to consider for Lin’er.”","When she heard him mention Lin’er, Xue Shuangyue shuddered violently, and her expression rapidly changed. A hint of pain appeared in her eyes.","Jian Chen also pulled his gaze back. There was a hint of reluctance and hesitation.","Before he came to the Black Demon Palace, he had grasped enough information. He knew that the Black Heaven Master and Xue Shuangyue had a daughter called Zhou Lin. She had already reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","In reality, if it were not for the circumstances, he really did not want to rope in some former members of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens at a time like this. After all, it would only drag these former members out of their current safety back into danger. It could even claim their lives.","But in order to strengthen the Divine Formation of the Heavens as quickly as possible, he was forced to do so.","Now, the Divine Formation of the Heavens had already become the greatest hope for restoring the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens to its former glory. Only by making the formation stronger would he have the confidence to bring the disciples of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens back to the Reverent Observance Heaven, defending against all enemies.","The Divine Formation of the Heavens was the easiest method to reach the level of Grand Exalts. In this aspect, it even surpassed the three sovereign god artifacts.","After thinking about it, Jian Chen still ended up saying, “Think about it closely. If you have any qualms, you can choose to remain in the Black Demon Palace. I will stay on the Taiji Heaven for three days. After these three days, I will come again.”","After saying that, Jian Chen clasped his fist towards the Black Heaven Master and was about to leave.","“Hold on!”","Right when Jian Chen was about to leave the hall, Xue Shuangyue suddenly stopped him. Jian Chen turned around, only to see that the hesitation and struggle originally in Xue Shuangyue’s eyes had already vanished. It was replaced by determination.","“I don’t need three days to consider. I can tell you clearly right now. From this moment onwards, I, Xue Ji, discard my identity as great elder Xue Shuangyue of the Black Demon Palace and formally return to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.” Xue Shuangyue’s voice was firm, filled with resolve.","“H-have you really thought it through?” On the side, the Black Heaven Master’s face was gloomy. He was dejected. Even when he could forcefully interfere, he did not do that, choosing to let Xue Shuangyue make the decision.","“Dear, do you blame me?” Xue Shuangyue turned her head towards the Black Heaven Master with deep emotions. She was racked with guilt.","The Black Heaven Master shook his head. He gently pulled Xue Shuangyue into his arms and said, “I don’t blame you. As long as you’re happy, I’ll support you in any decision you make.”","“And, after spending all those years with you, how can I not understand your thoughts? Over the years, you’ve never been able to let go of that sect. You were once racked with worry over that sect, but unfortunately, due to your strength and the circumstances, you could not do too much. Now that you finally see a glimmer of hope after all this difficulty, how could you give up on it?”","“I’ve thought about stopping you, but I’m also aware that even if you stayed behind, this will exist as a regret in your heart. Perhaps I would have protected you, but it would also be a source of pain in your heart, blocking your thoughts and your cultivation, making future breakthroughs difficult.”","Xue Shuangyue’s body trembled gently. She said softly, “Jian Chen’s appearance has allowed me to see the hope of restoring the sect, so I can’t let anything happen to him. If he’s lost, the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens will never have a second person with the same capabilities.”","“He is the hope of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, as well as the only sliver of hope that’s appeared across all these years. Since he needs my power, then how can I, Xue Ji, let down the sect over my selfish reasons?”","“Dear, Lin’er will be entirely in your care from now on...”","“If you are able to maintain your safety, please come and visit. The Sword Sect of Violet Heavens is your home. The Black Demon Palace is also your home...”","After a difficult farewell, Xue Ji resolutely chose to leave with Jian Chen. As for the Black Heaven Master, he remained in the Black Demon Palace. To him, the legacy of the Black Demon Palace outweighed all else. Its importance even surpassed his wife.","He needed to watch over the Black Demon Palace!","“Fellow Xue Ji, aren’t you going to visit your daughter?” Right before departing, Jian Chen asked Xue Ji in concern.","“Lin’er is currently serving a post in the Observance Heaven City,” said Xue Ji.","Jian Chen was surprised. To serve a post in the Observance Heaven City as a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, she must have been one of the fifty thousand soldiers. She was a part of the Divine Formation of the Heavens in the Observance Heaven City.","That was not a position that any person could earn. After all, even prodigies from courts of heaven would try and earn posts in the Observance Heaven City. As a result, whether it were posts for Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals or Immortal Monarchs, they were all occupied by prodigies among prodigies."]},{"number":4011,"title":"Chapter 4011: Chapter 4012: Searching the Taiji Heaven","paragraphs":["Jian Chen used the mask from the Illusionary Daemon race to change his appearance, disguising himself as the same old man who originally entered the Black Demon Palace. Afterwards, he swaggered out of the hall with Xue Shuangyue.","Xue Shuangyue was in low spirits. She gazed at the beautiful landscape in the surroundings. A sense of reluctance swelled up in the depths of her heart.","From the depths of the Black Demon Palace, the senses of souls from a few great elders lingered outside the discussion hall the entire time, paying close attention to Xue Shuangyue’s safety.","When Xue Shuangyue emerged from the hall, they immediately noticed that something was slightly off with her expression.","“Elder Xue, is there anything you need our assistance with?” The great elders immediately appeared before Xue Shuangyue. When they glanced past Jian Chen on the side, there was clearly a hint of caution.","Xue Shuangyue glanced past the great elders in front of her slowly before bowing towards them deeply. She said softly, “Elders, the Black Demon Palace will be in your care from now onwards.”","“Elder Xue, w-what do you mean by that?” The great elders leapt in fright from Xue Shuangyue’s actions. All of them were at a loss as for what to do.","“I will be leaving the Black Demon Palace, so I won’t be able to serve alongside you anymore,” Xue Shuangyue said softly.","“What? You’re leaving the Black Demon Palace?” The great elders looked at one another. They were filled with doubt and confusion.","Xue Shuangyue said nothing more. She stared at the landscape of the Black Demon Palace emotionally one last time before leaving with Jian Chen without looking back.","The great elders looked at one another outside the discussion hall. They were stumped by Xue Shuangyue’s sudden decision.","“What’s happened with elder Xue?”","“I don’t know. I just feel like she’s being rather strange.”","“And what does she mean by leaving the Black Demon Palace? Even if she has something important to tend to, she can just leave temporarily. There’s no need to do this.”","Watching Xue Shuangyue leave, the great elders all muttered to themselves. They all felt like something was off, but no one was bold enough to cause problems for Xue Shuangyue in the Black Demon Palace.","However, right as they hesitated over whether they should chase her and get to the bottom of this, a long, gentle sigh rang out from behind them.","The sudden voice took the great elders by surprise, as none of them had sensed the presence of someone else. They immediately looked back, only to see the Black Heaven Master standing there silently, watching Xue Shuangyue leave with a very lonely expression.","“Greetings, ancestor!” The faces of the great elders of the Black Demon Palace changed slightly. They bowed in a hurry, showing great respect.","“Go back to doing what you should be doing. Shuangyue’s matters are no longer for you to worry about.” The Black Heaven Master waved his hand at them. He was in a sullen mood.","“May we ask what has happened with elder Xue?” A great elder mustered the courage to ask.","“What else could have happened? She’s clearly been abducted...”","“What? A-a-abducted?” When they heard that, the great elders were all dumbfounded.","“From this moment, Xue Shuangyue’s name is to be formally removed from our Black Demon Palace. She is no longer a member of the Black Demon Palace. Let the entire Taiji Heaven know about this...”","......","...","“What do you plan on doing next?”","After leaving the Black Demon Palace, Xue Shuangyue and Jian Chen flew together, speeding through an unknown region of the Taiji Heaven. She looked towards Jian Chen and asked.","From the moment she left the Black Demon Palace, she was no longer Xue Shuangyue. She had recovered her past identity, disciple Xue Ji of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens!","However, she was not a regular disciple but a great elder of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens!","“There’s no rush. Let’s go for a stroll around the Taiji Heaven first.” Jian Chen took out the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain that had shrunk to a fraction of its original size. Whenever he passed a region, he would stop and sense around.","“What are you doing?” Seeing how Jian Chen would stop every now and then, Xue Ji could not help but stare at the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in Jian Chen’s hand curiously.","As a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, she had an extremely sturdy mind. In such a short amount of time, she had already recovered from her sorrow of leaving the Black Demon Palace, re-embracing her new identity.","Jian Chen opened his hand and showed the fist-sized Energy-gathering Divine Mountain to Xue Ji. “Do you know why I was willing to take on such a huge risk to retrieve this Energy-gathering Divine Mountain? This Energy-gathering Divine Mountain is different from the others. Through it, I can sense the lost divine mountains.”","“However, its range is limited. As a result, I plan on visiting each region of the Taiji Heaven first to carry out a close search.”","“The Energy-gathering Divine Mountains can only gather spiritual Qi. Even if you assemble all the lost Energy-gathering Divine Mountains, they can’t be used against any experts. Are they really that important?” Xue Ji asked in confusion.","“They are no less important than the Divine Formation of the Heavens. It will directly impact whether we can return to the ancestral grounds of the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens,” Jian Chen said without giving too much of an explanation.","Xue Ji became even more confused, but she understood that Jian Chen had quite a few secrets. He was trying his hardest to hide most of them, refusing to tell her, which was why she did not ask any more about it as someone sensible.","She only cared about one thing. As long as Jian Chen truly was the person who brought hope to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, that was enough. Everything else did not matter.","“You’re more familiar with the Taiji Heaven than me, so I’ll have to trouble you with serving as my guide during the time we spend on the Taiji Heaven. I can also learn some more detailed information from you. Once we leave the Taiji Heaven, you can enter the sovereign god artifact to cultivate.”","“Apart from when I need the Divine Formation of the Heavens against powerful opponents, I will handle all other battles. You won’t need to do anything.” As Jian Chen said that, he had already stowed away the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain, proceeding to the next destination with Xue Shuangyue.","Xue Ji served her role as a guide properly. Along the way, she introduced the various organisations of different sizes that stood on the Taiji Heaven and personally led the way for Jian Chen.","She was an Immortal Emperor who had spent a great deal of time cultivating on the Taiji Heaven after all. Xue Ji’s understanding of the Taiji Heaven could not be compared to Jian Chen’s crude investigations. As a result, Xue Ji’s explanations on the side had saved Jian Chen a lot of effort.","The Taiji Heaven was extremely vast, even larger than any of the planes in the Saints’ World. It was equivalent to two whole planes. When it came to some of the weaker cultivators, even if they had several tens of thousand years, they would probably struggle to traverse the entire heaven.","However, to Jian Chen and Xue Ji who were already Immortal Emperors, crossing through the Taiji Heaven was as simple as it could get. They only needed to take a casual step to travel several million kilometres.","Afterwards, Jian Chen carried out a fine search on the Taiji Heaven. He did not even spare any barren wilderness that no one would normally set foot in. As for some of the peak organisations on the Taiji Heaven, he would intentionally pause near them before sensing for Energy-gathering Divine Mountains while maintaining his distance from the formations. After all, he wanted to avoid alerting their experts."]},{"number":4012,"title":"Chapter 4012: Chapter 4013: The Fifth Divine Mountain","paragraphs":["As he searched like this, Jian Chen crossed through more and more regions of the Taiji Heaven. He also searched through numerous peak organisations one by one.","Although peak organisations were Jian Chen’s main focus, he did not spare any medium-sized or smaller organisations either.","He was aware of the principle that not all treasures would gather in the hands of powerful experts. Some cultivators that did not seem particularly powerful could obtain certain treasures through sheer luck or coincidences as well.","After all, after all these years, those in possession of the Energy-gathering Divine Mountains might not necessarily be the same people or organisations that initially took them.","Several days later, Xue Ji brought Jian Chen to the outskirts of a primitive mountain that was filled with extremely dense spiritual Qi and they stopped there. Afterwards, she hesitated to advance any further, as if she was wary of this place.","“Whose territory is this?” Jian Chen stared into the dense mist and his face gradually became stern. In the deepest spot, he could sense an extremely powerful formation.","“Up ahead is the Thousand Mountains clan. It’s best if we don’t get too close to them, to show them the respect they deserve,” Xue Ji said sternly.","“The Thousand Mountains clan, the second greatest organisation on the Taiji Heaven?” Jian Chen’s eyes shone. The information in his possession about the Thousand Mountains clan was not as detailed as Xue Ji’s, but he still knew a little bit.","The greatest organisation on the Taiji Heaven was called the Cosmic Hollow. The ancestor of the Cosmis Hollow was the greatest expert on the Taiji Heaven, a powerful existence at the peak of the Sixth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt. It was said that he was only a step away from the Seventh Heavenly Layer.","There were numerous Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts on the Taiji Heaven, but the reason why the ancestor of the Cosmic Hollow could claim the title of the greatest was entirely due to one of his glorious feats in battle in the past. He managed to last ten rounds against a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt with his strength at the Sixth Heavenly Layer without being defeated!","It was also after that battle that he consolidated his title as the greatest expert on the Taiji Heaven.","After the Cosmic Hollow was the Thousand Mountains clan. The Thousand Mountains clan’s strongest expert was also at the Sixth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Exalt, but it was said that this person was a junior who rose up much later than everyone else.","It was exactly because of the rise of this junior that it pushed the Thousand Mountains clan that was originally even far beneath the Black Demon Palace to the height of the second greatest organisation on the Taiji Heaven.","Xue Ji stared at the clan in the mist in a slight daze and said gently, “The Thousand Mountains clan right now is no longer the second greatest organisation on the Taiji Heaven. They’ve surpassed the Cosmic Hollow to become the greatest.”","“However, this is a secret that only a limited few on the Taiji Heaven know about. In the knowledge of regular cultivators or smaller organisations, the Cosmic Hollow is still the greatest.”","When she reached there, Xue Ji suddenly turned her head and stared at Jian Chen in a strange way. She said, “Actually, the reason why the Thousand Mountains clan rose up to become the greatest is connected to you.”","“Really? It’s connected to me?” Jian Chen was surprised.","Xue Ji nodded and said sternly, “When you destroyed the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants and went missing, the ancestors of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants were furious but they had nowhere to vent, so they turned the entire Reverent Observance Heaven upside down. It was also from that time that the ancestor of the Thousand Mountains clan clashed with the Space-splitting Venerable of the Immortal Sect of Colossal Elephants outside the Reverent Observance Heaven. Afterwards, the rumour was that the ancestor of the Thousand Mountains clan defeated the Space-splitting Venerable.”","“Ever since then, the greatest organisation on our Taiji Heaven became the Thousand Mountains clan.”","When he heard that, Jian Chen was left at a loss for words. For a moment, he had no idea how to respond or react.","“Do you still want to check the Thousand Mountains clan?” Xue Ji looked at Jian Chen.","“Of course I do. No one is an exception. Let alone a Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, even if the Thousand Mountains clan had a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, I’d still check them,” Jian Chen said firmly.","When she heard that, Xue Ji laughed. She said, “You’d check them even if they have a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt? Don’t tell me you plan on snatching food from the jaws of a tiger?”","“Maybe not that. I obviously won’t make a futile effort against an opponent I can’t defeat. I just want to confirm the locations of the Energy-gathering Divine Mountains. As long as I know which organisations possess them, then I’ll be able to slowly come up with a way to retrieve them.” As Jian Chen said that, the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain had already appeared in Jian Chen’s hand. He did not get too close to the Thousand Mountains clan. Instead, he maintained a certain distance away and began sensing for the Energy-gathering Divine Mountains.","Xue Ji stood to one side rather nervously. She was extremely worried that an Energy-gathering Divine Mountain would appear in the Thousand Mountains clan. She was afraid that Jian Chen would offend the Thousand Mountains clan and potentially get the Black Demon Palace involved.","Suddenly, Jian Chen shuddered inside. Through the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain, this hazy, familiar feeling appeared again. It directly pointed at the Thousand Mountains clan.","There really was an Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in the Thousand Mountains clan!","Jian Chen was both surprised and delighted by finding a lost Energy-gathering Divine Mountain so soon. However, in order to prevent any mistakes, he used the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain in his hand as a guide and began to make a closer and more precise judgement.","Only after an entire minute did Jian Chen stow the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain away. His gaze was deep.","Xue Ji could sense the changes in Jian Chen’s gaze, which made her heart tighten. She asked in a hurry, “Do they have one?”","“They do! The Thousand Mountains clan has an Energy-gathering Divine Mountain!” Jian Chen’s eyes shone brightly as he stared straight at the Thousand Mountains clan.","“What? They actually have one?” Xue Ji was startled. Her fears really did come true. What she worried about the most had ended up happening.","“Then what do you plan on doing next?” She asked closely. There was a hint of worry in her eyes.","Jian Chen turned towards Xue Ji and said with a slight smile, “The strongest ancestor of the Thousand Mountains clan is not on the Taiji Heaven, so I can retrieve the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain like retrieving something from my own pocket. No one can stop me. However, you don’t seem to wish for me to come into conflict with the Thousand Mountains clan.”","Xue Ji subconsciously glanced in the direction of the Black Demon Palace. She sighed gently, “The strongest ancestor of the Thousand Mountains clan is not where, but if you want to retrieve the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain from them, you’ll still have to use the power of the Divine Formation of the Heavens.”","“That way, everyone will know that you’re responsible for what happened here. In the future, it’ll all be fine if I don’t show myself, but once I appear in the Divine Formation of the Heavens, the Thousand Mountains clan might go after the Black Demon Palace.”","“Once something like that happens, the Black Demon Palace won’t stand a chance against the Thousand Mountains clan. Apart from being powerful, the strongest ancestor of the Thousand Mountains clan has a deeper background, which is a member of the upper echelon of the Courtyard of Ways, one of their decision makers!”","“Compared to the Soaring Immortal Heavenly Emperor, is the upper echelon of the Courtyard of Ways stronger? There’s even a heavenly emperor personally coming after me, so am I supposed to fear a Thousand Mountains clan?” Jian Chen disagreed.","Xue Ji faltered, but shortly afterwards, she seemed to be willing to accept whatever decision Jian Chen wanted to make again.","It was true. From the moment she decided to leave the Black Demon Palace and return to the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens, some outcomes had already become set in stone.","“How do you plan on going about it?”"]},{"number":4013,"title":"Chapter 4013: Chapter 4014: Taiji Spiritual Qi","paragraphs":["“Are there any grievances between the Thousand Mountains clan and the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens? Or perhaps the Thousand Mountains clan has targeted the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens in the past?” Jian Chen said in thought.","Xue Ji pondered before saying, “According to my understanding, there has never been any contact between the Thousand Mountains clan and the Sword Sect of Violet Heavens.”","Jian Chen nodded. He understood that the information in Xue Ji’s possession could not be too complete. After all, some secretive matters would be covered up flawlessly, so even Immortal Exalts could not find anything. Given Xue Ji’s strength, she obviously would not know too much.","“Thousand Mountains clan! Lu Wujin!” Jian Chen murmured softly. He could not help but recall the recent encirclement outside the Reverent Observance Heaven when his identity had been exposed. The Space-splitting Venerable and numerous other Immortal Exalts had intercepted him. At that moment, someone wielding a sovereign god artifact had appeared.","He had never seen this person before, but he learnt his identity from the cries of the surrounding people.","He was Lu Wujin, one of the vice city lords of the Observance Heaven City!","Lu Wujin’s appearance had drawn away the attention of a few experts. The presence of heavenly emperors also momentarily distracted everyone, allowing Jian Chen to slip away successfully.","However, Jian Chen was certain that Lu Wujin had not shown up at that time to come after him. Not only did he not lock onto him with his presence, but his attention seemed to be on the other Immortal Exalts as well.","Since Lu Wujin was not after him, then there was only one other possibility—he was there to assist him in escaping.","Xue Ji hovered in the air uneasily, waiting for Jian Chen’s decision. Even though she had already thought it through herself, she still did not wish for them to come into conflict with the Thousand Mountains clan.","After all, the Thousand Mountains clan was also an organisation on the Taiji Heaven, just like the Black Demon Palace!","“C’mon, let’s go and search the next place!” Suddenly, Jian Chen stowed away the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain with a flip of his hand and left without hesitation.","Watching Jian Chen fly away, Xue Ji was taken aback. She immediately caught up and asked, “Since the Energy-gethering Divine Mountain is in the Thousand Mountains clan, aren’t you going to pay them a visit?”","“There’s no hurry. I’ll obviously be taking back the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain from the Thousand Mountains clan, but now is not the time. I’ll find a time in the future to pay a visit to the Observance Heaven City and meet with their strongest ancestor, Lu Wujin. I’ll see if I can get the Energy-gathering Divine Mountain through peaceful means,” Jian Chen said without looking back. He was in quite a good mood.","He was not afraid of being unable to retrieve the Energy-gathering Divine Mountains. He was afraid of not being able to find where they were hidden.","He had tracked down the whereabouts of the fifth Energy-gathering Divine Mountain so quickly, so Jian Chen was extremely satisfied with this efficiency.","Only thirteen remained out of the seventeen lost Energy-gathering Divine Mountains.","Afterwards, Jian Chen continued searching through the Taiji Heaven as if he refused to relent until he had turned over every single stone.","Before long, Jian Chen passed over a primitive mountain range before stopping above a great valley. He stared at the bottom of the valley, and his eyes shone with a strange colour.","“The spiritual Qi here seems to be rather unique,” Jian Chen muttered to himself softly.","Xue Ji looked around and said, “This is the Taiji mountain range. The Taiji mountain range is rather famous on our Taiji Heaven. Every several tens of thousand years, it will produce some special spiritual Qi. If the spiritual Qi is absorbed by weaker cultivators, they can benefit tremendously from it. Not only will their cultivation improve drastically, but it can even consolidate their foundations and purify their minds.”","“Among the thirty-three heavens of the Immortals’ World, this spiritual Qi is only produced on our Taiji Heaven, which is why it’s known as Taiji spiritual Qi.”","“However, once you reach Immortal Exalt, the Taiji spiritual Qi will lose its effects.”","After hearing that, Jian Chen’s eyes shone with a strange light. He reached out towards the valley beneath him, and the space in the entire valley twisted. The spiritual Qi within several thousand kilometres gathered towards him, amassing in his hand in the end. It turned into fist-sized ball of mist.","In the centre of the ball of mist was a wisp of grey spiritual Qi that seemed a little stronger. It was clearly different from the rest.","At this moment, the special strand of spiritual Qi was like a lively little snake. It slithered around in the ball of spiritual Qi in Jian Chen’s hand. It was filled with intelligence like a clever, living, little fairy.","When Xue Ji saw the wisp of spiritual Qi, her eyes shone with a strange colour. She said with some surprise, “This is the Taiji spiritual Qi I was talking about. Taiji spiritual Qi doesn’t usually appear. It only emerges from deep underground when it’s about to erupt once every several tens of thousand years.”","“In other words, the Taiji spiritual Qi is about to erupt from the ground?” Jian Chen asked. He constantly studied the Taiji spiritual Qi and also unleashed his powerful senses of the soul as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, extending it underground. He pierced through layers and layers of rock and soil, wanting to see how the Taiji spiritual Qi was formed.","However, in the deepest location, the senses of his soul were blocked by an invisible force, unable to advance even an inch past it.","Jian Chen was not surprised by this, as all of the heavens were like this. They were either protected by a powerful formation or there was a mysterious force. These barriers might have been nothing in the eyes of Immortal Exalts who had reached the peak of cultivation, but they were barriers that could not be traversed for Immortal Emperors.","“It’s said that in the most central location of the Taiji Heaven, there’s an extremely powerful Grand Exalt’s formation protecting it. It is believed the Taiji spiritual Qi seeps out from the Grand Exalt’s formation.” Perhaps because she noticed how Jian Chen was investigating deep underground, Xue Ji actively explained on the side.","This could be regarded as a great secret on the Taiji Heaven. Only a specific portion of experts who dwelled near the peak knew about it.","At this moment, the spiritual Qi in the valley under Jian Chen suddenly began to multiply. It grew thicker and thicker before forming a great thick cloud, enveloping the entire mountain range.","A hint of surprise flashed through Jian Chen’s eyes, as the spiritual Qi in the mountain range was so dense that it almost rivalled the Skyscraping World.","As the spiritual Qi multiplied, Jian Chen could clearly sense more and more Taiji spiritual Qi, scattered in every corner of the mountain range.","Simultaneously, many pairs of eyes snapped open across the various organisations of the Taiji Heaven, filled with depth and antiquity. All of them glanced in the direction of the Taiji Heaven.","“The Taiji spiritual Qi is about to erupt. Elders, lead the disciples to compete for it...”","“The spiritual Qi that erupts once every several tens of thousand years has finally appeared. This time, we must ensure that even more disciples obtain the Taiji spiritual Qi...”","“Every time the Taiji spiritual Qi erupts, the mainstay of an organisation will grow much stronger. We can’t let this opportunity slip past us...”","......","...","At this moment, the many organisations of the Taiji Heaven began to take action. It was not just peak organisations with Immortal Exalts. Even smaller organisations with only Immortal Emperors and Immortal Monarchs took part, leading their disciples in a scramble towards the Taiji mountain range.","Xue Ji gazed down from above the Taiji mountain range. “It’s impossible to hide the eruption of the Taiji spiritual Qi. It’ll become very busy here very soon. Even our Black Demon Palace will be sending disciples.”","“There isn’t anyone who seals off this place in an attempt to monopolise the spiritual Qi?” Jian Chen asked.","Xue Ji shook her head and said, “The Taiji spiritual Qi is something shared across the entire Taiji Heaven. The various organisations have already reached an agreement. Whenever the Taiji spiritual Qi erupts, they will all send their disciples here for a fair competition.”"]},{"number":4014,"title":"Chapter 4014: Chapter 4016: The Disciples of the Black Demon Palace","paragraphs":["Jian Chen watched Xue Ji leave. With his vision as a Ninth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, he could take in the entire Taiji mountain range even if he did not use the senses of his soul. He discovered that Xue Ji did not go to the Black Demon Palace. Instead, she found an early Immortal Emperor. After a short conversation, she returned to Jian Chen’s side with an item.","“I’ve dealt with the issue of missing an entry. Your disciple can enter and exit the formation freely with this tablet. However, the formation around the Taiji mountain range can detect cultivation. Once an Immortal Monarch approaches, the formation will attack them mercilessly.” Xue Ji passed the tablet over to Jian Chen.","Jian Chen accepted the tablet and studied it. Through the organisation’s symbol on the tablet, he could tell that they did not have an Immortal Exalt.","“I originally wanted your disciple to enter the Taiji mountain range under the name of the Black Demon Palace. That way, she’ll have the protection of all the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal disciples of the Black Demon Palace, so she’ll have an easier time in the Taiji mountain range at the very least. However, I’m also worried about causing the Black Demon Palace some unnecessary trouble if this were exposed, so I had to borrow the identity tablet of another organisation for her entry.”","Xue Ji looked at Jing Mumu and said, “The Wind Guiding Pavilion. Remember, you are entering the Taiji mountain range under the name of this organisation. I’ve also contacted great elder Ye from the Black Demon Palace. Once you enter the Taiji mountain range, the disciples of the Black Demon Palace will take care of you. You can choose to travel with them if you want to.” Xue Ji really did not have high hopes for Jing Mumu. The competition for the Taiji spiritual Qi did forbid Immortal Monarchs, but the main competition would basically occur between Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. With Jing Mumu’s cultivation as a peak Xuan Immortal, coupled with the fact that she was alone, she would truly struggle to make any progress.","However, this is all that Xue Ji could do.","“Mumu, after you enter the Taiji mountain range, do your best to collect as much Taiji spiritual Qi as possible,” Jian Chen said to Jing Mumu before finding a jade bottle from his Space Ring and tossing it to her.","The jade bottle was a low grade god artifact. It could be used to store various items. Even Jian Chen had no idea who he had obtained it from.","Xue Ji shot him a glance and said in exasperation, “And you even want your disciple to collect as much Taiji spiritual Qi as possible? It might look like there’s a lot of Taiji spiritual Qi in there, but the competition is similarly fierce. With your disciple’s cultivation, it’ll be almost impossible to obtain even a single strand of Taiji spiritual Qi. Even I am only able to get the disciples of the Black Demon Palace to leave a wisp of Taiji spiritual Qi for you. Furthermore, Taiji spiritual Qi cannot be stored over long periods of time, or its effects will drastically diminish. For the best effects, you should absorb it on the spot.”","Jian Chen smiled and looked at Jing Mumu. “Mumu, are you confident in yourself?”","Jing Mumu swiveled her eyes and asked, “Master, are you certain that Immortal Monarchs won’t appear in the Taiji mountain range?”","“You don’t have to worry about that. All of the peak organisations on the Taiji Heaven are watching outside. No one has the courage to break this rule. However, while Immortal Monarchs won’t appear, that won’t eliminate the appearance of any talented prodigies. They can rival Immortal Monarchs as Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals,” said Jian Chen.","“As long as Immortal Monarchs won’t appear, I definitely won’t disappoint you, master.” Jing Mumu was confident.","On the side, Xue Ji furrowed her brows slightly. She could tell that Jing Mumu did not seem to take the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals of the Taiji Heaven seriously. If she were also a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, then so be it. With the guidance of an Immortal Emperor like Jian Chen, she would clearly have a standing even among her realm of cultivation.","However, she was clearly just a peak Xuan Immortal.","In Xue Ji’s eyes, it was far too arrogant for a peak Xuan Immortal to look down on Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","Afterwards, Jian Chen gave a few more instructions and Jing Mumu left, entering the Taiji mountain range using the identity tablet from the Wind Guiding Pavilion.","Of course, when she left, Jian Chen also gave Jing Mumu many life-preserving measures.","At this moment, the Taiji spiritual Qi began to erupt more and more frequently in the Taiji mountain range. It appeared strand after strand, scattered across the various corners of the Taiji mountain range.","Many disciples from peak organisations had already begun competing against one another inside. They had been personally brought here by the Immortal Emperors of their sects, so they were the first group to enter the Taiji mountain range. They already amounted to over a hundred thousand.","Among them, the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals amounted to half. The remaining were many Xuan Immortals and some Daluo Golden Immortals.","Many of these Xuan Immortals and Daluo Golden Immortals had extraordinary statuses, so they were personally accompanied by Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal bodyguards.","As a matter of fact, there were even some Daluo Golden Immortals who used over a dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals to protect themselves.","Around the outskirts of the Taiji mountain range, more and more smaller organisations arrived. With their entry, the number of people in the Taiji mountain range began to swell. The total directly pushed past a million.","Even when quite a lot of Taiji spiritual Qi had appeared, it was nowhere near enough to fulfill the needs of a million people. As a result, the appearance of each strand of Taiji spiritual Qi would be accompanied with various conflicts.","The Black Demon Palace sent in close to a thousand people. They were not entirely Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. They also had Xuan Immortals and Daluo Golden Immortals mixed in. All of the disciples wore the same uniform with the symbol of the Black Demon Palace, making it very easy to distinguish.","By now, the group from the Black Demon Palace had already scattered. The disciples dispersed through the various regions either alone or as groups.","In one of the regions with relatively more people, almost a hundred disciples of the Black Demon Palace gathered together, forming a ring around three disciples to protect them.","Out of the three disciples, one was a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal and the other two were Xuan Immortals. All of them gripped a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi in their hands, currently focusing on refining and absorbing it.","In the surroundings, all of the disciples looked towards the three of them with undisguised envy.","Taiji spiritual Qi did not simply go to whoever obtained it. Whenever these disciples from peak organisations encountered Taiji spiritual Qi, it would go to those with higher statuses first. Disciples without any proper background would be forced to queue behind them.","As the three disciples of the Black Demon Palace refined the Taiji spiritual Qi, figures constantly appeared in the surrounding mountains, but all of them backed away silently without any exception when they recognised their identity.","Ye Kai was the leader of these disciples. Not only was he the strongest core disciple from the Black Demon Palace, but his background was also impressive. Great elder Ye was his ancestor.","At this moment, Ye Kai hovered in the air with his legs crossed and eyes shut, silently watching over the three disciples who absorbed the Taiji spiritual Qi.","Suddenly, his expression changed. He took out a jade slip and sent the senses of his soul inside.","A while later, Ye Kai furrowed his brows. There was a hint of doubt and perplexion on his face. He scanned the surrounding disciples and said, “Junior brothers, there’s a new mission. Great elder Ye has ordered us to find this person and protect her to our greatest ability. Moreover... moreover, we are to give her the next strand of Taiji spiritual Qi.” As he said that, Ye Kai extended a finger, and Jing Mumu’s portrait appeared from thin air."]},{"number":4015,"title":"Chapter 4015: Participating in the Competition","paragraphs":["“A fair competition? In what way is it fair?” Jian Chen casually asked.","“Immortal Monarchs, Immortal Emperors, and Immortal Exalts can’t participate. Only cultivators beneath Immortal Monarch can enter the Taiji mountain range to compete against one another freely.”","“There are so many realms beneath Immortal Monarch. Human Immortals, Earthen Immortals, Heavenly Immortals, Golden Immortals, Daluo Golden Immortals, Xuan Immortals, and Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. Don’t tell me there aren’t any restrictions on these cultivation realms?” Jian Chen shook his head with a gentle smile. He felt like this so-called fairness was rather hilarious.","Xue Ji sighed gently. There was a hint of helplessness in her voice. “Actually, forbidding Immortal Monarchs and beyond from interfering is already the greatest form of fairness they can achieve. Otherwise, if you have Immortal Emperors or even Immortal Exalts personally harvesting Taiji spiritual Qi en masse, the smaller organisations on the Taiji Heaven won’t be able to get involved at all. The Taiji spiritual Qi might be useless to these experts, but it is the best treasure for nurturing the mainstay of their organisations. Without any rules, Immortal Exalts will act without any regard. In the end, it will devolve into a situation where several peak organisations monopolise the entire Taiji mountain range.”","At this moment, figures had already begun surging in the distance. Immortal Emperors had already arrived near the Taiji mountain range. They all carried spatial god artifacts. With a toss, they immediately released their disciples from them.","In a short moment, over fifty Immortal Emperors had gathered around the Taiji mountain range. They were not just from the peak organisations but also many first-rate organisations based on the Taiji Heaven.","On top of that, the number of people continued to increase.","A place for teleportation had even been set out in the outskirts of the Taiji mountain range. Many ancient teleportation formations were assembled there. Too much time had passed since they were last used, so the white jade used to form the floor had already become covered by a thick layer of fallen leaves.","But before long, several of these teleportation formations erupted with blinding light simultaneously. Powerful spiritual Qi turned into a storm that unfurled, blowing the thick layer of fallen leaves into the sky before ripping them to shreds.","After the light subsided, numerous Immortal Monarchs appeared on the teleportation formation!","They came from slightly weaker organisations. Because they did not have any Immortal Emperors, they could only travel here through teleportation formations.","“Elder Xue, I didn’t expect to see you here.” At this moment, a ruddy old man silently appeared a hundred metres away from Jian Chen and Xue Ji. His gaze towards Xue Ji was filled with mixed emotions, as well as a hint of confusion.","“ELder Xue, I heard you left the Black Demon Palace? Could you tell me what happened?” the old man continued to ask. His face was filled with pity and concern.","“This is great elder Ye. He’s an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor, one of the well-respected seniors in the Black Demon Palace.” Xue Ji actively introduced him to Jian Chen before looking at him and saying, “Great elder Ye, are you personally leading the disciples here to compete for the Taiji spiritual Qi?”","The old man called great elder Ye sighed gently. “Originally, this was not something that I should have concerned myself with, but with your departure, our Black Demon Palace is down a great elder, which is quite a large loss in strength. As a result, it had to be me to watch over the situation here, just in case those old rivals of ours try to bully our disciples.”","“Thank you for your efforts, great elder Ye.” Xue Ji bowed deeply towards him.","“Elder Xue, your gesture is too great for me to accept.” Great elder Ye dodged it quickly. Afterwards, he tried to convince her to stay. “Elder Xue, the Black Demon Palace is your home. Can you really bear to part with it like this?”","Xue Ji’s gaze was determined. She said firmly, “Great elder Ye, let’s not talk about this, or it might lead to the Black Demon Palace’s destruction.”","“What? The sect’s destruction? Elder Xue, this...” Great elder Ye was quite frightened by her statement. He stared at Xue Ji with surprise and uncertainty. He struggled to imagine just what kind of enemy could actually force the Black Demon Palace into a situation like that.","After all, in great elder Ye’s eyes, the Black Demon Palace was a peak organisation with three Immortal Exalts. The strongest of them, the Black Heaven Master, was a Fifth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. An organisation like that had quite the reputation across the entire Immortals’ World. It was not an organisation that anyone could bully.","Then great elder Ye looked at Jian Chen beside Xue Ji. Right when he wanted to ask something, Jian Chen spoke up before he could say anything, “Fellow Ye, there are some matters that are inconvenient to discuss at this moment in time. If you really want to know the reason why fellow Xue has left the Black Demon Palace, you will naturally find out about the truth soon.”","At this moment, a tremendous formation unfurled in the surroundings, radiating with a terrifying pressure that startled the Immortal Emperors. It immediately covered the entire Taiji mountain range.","Some of the Immortal Emperors who were originally in the region covered by the formation were also thrown back far away.","Jian Chen, Xue Ji, and elder Ye were no exception. They were all pushed to the outskirts of the Taiji mountain range by the formation’s power.","From the moment the formation took shape, great elder Ye was forced to clasp his fist towards Xue Ji and bid farewell. The competition for the Taiji spiritual Qi was about to begin. There were many matters that he had to go and arrange.","“This formation is not weak. It should be able to barely block the attacks of Seventh Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalts.” Jian Chen studied the formation before his eyes and could not help but praise it.","“This formation was assembled by all the peak organisations on our Taiji Heaven. We use the formation to divide and separate the regions. This formation ensures the fairness of the competition.” Xue Ji stared into the distance and said, “Let’s go and keep searching the Taiji Heaven.”","“Wait. Let’s not leave in such a hurry.” Jian Chen stopped Xue Ji who was about to leave. He stared at the Taiji mountain range enveloped by the formation. There was a hint of interest on his face.","Xue Ji furrowed her brows at this sight. “Don’t tell me you want to send in those disciples from the sect to compete for the Taiji spiritual Qi? Even if you ignore the issue that their legacy might not be complete and they will struggle against the disciples of these peak organisations, exposing them will only increase the risk of exposing yourself.”","“I obviously won’t get the disciples in the sect to participate in this. They are indeed quite a fair bit off from the disciples of peak organisations with complete legacies.” After saying that, Jian Chen waved his hand, and the beautiful Jing Mumu in a white dress appeared beside him.","“This is my disciple, Jing Mumu. She just happens to be in need of Taiji spiritual Qi, so I plan on letting her compete for it.” Jian Chen introduced her to Xue Ji. Jing Mumu bowed extremely politely, showing great respect.","“A peak Xuan Immortal? Her cultivation is too weak. If she doesn’t have a powerful background supporting her, even if she comes across Taiji spiritual Qi by luck, she’ll have it taken from her before she can even absorb it.” Xue Ji shook her head gently. She was not very confident in Jing Mumu.","“You don’t have to worry about that. I’m very confident in this disciple of mine. You only need to make some arrangements so that she can enter the Taiji mountain range. She just happens to be in need of the Taiji spiritual Qi produced here,” said Jian Chen.","“Alright, then I’ll go and make arrangements.” Xue Ji turned around and left."]},{"number":4016,"title":"Chapter 4016: Chapter 4017: Battle for the Spiritual Qi","paragraphs":["Apart from the three absorbing the Taiji spiritual Qi, all the other disciples looked over in response. Many of them furrowed their brows.","“Senior brother Ye Kai, who is this? I don’t think I’ve seen them before...”","“Great elder Ye actually wants us to protect this woman? We’re core disciples of the Black Demon Palace. In particular, you’re the strongest out of all of the core disciples. Who exactly is this woman that even you, senior brother Ye Kai, must protect her?”","The disciples discussed. Some of them refused to accept this, while others felt curious.","However, without any exceptions, all of them understood that since a great elder of the Black Demon Palace had spoken, this woman’s background must have been significant.","Ye Kai did not say too much. He was solemn as he expanded the senses of his soul, searching for the tracks of this person in the nearby region.","In the eyes of Immortal Emperors, the Taiji mountain range obviously was not large. They could easily envelope the entire mountain range with the senses of their souls.","However, the senses of souls from Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals came nowhere close to the senses of souls from Immortal Emperors. Even with Ye Kai’s cultivation at the peak of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, he could only cover a tiny region. He could reach less than a hundredth of the entire area when he pushed the senses of his soul to the limit.","Very soon, Ye Kai opened his eyes. He did not find the traces of the person he was looking for in the range of the senses of his soul.","At this exact moment, the three disciples absorbing the Taiji spiritual Qi all roused. One of them, a Xuan Immortal called Sheng Zhibai, said excitedly, “This Taiji spiritual Qi is just fantastic. A single strand of Taiji spiritual Qi is almost equal to a hundred years of arduous cultivation for me.”","“Senior brother Ye Kai, let’s keep searching for Taiji spiritual Qi. I feel like if I absorb a few more strands of Taiji spiritual Qi, my cultivation will reach peak Xuan Immortal. I’ll be able to make preparations for my breakthrough then,” said another Xuan Immortal disciple eagerly. He acted as if he deserved to claim all of the Taiji spiritual Qi for himself without any consideration for the other disciples.","His name was Sheng Zhiyi. He came from the same branch as Sheng Zhibai.","In the surroundings, many of the disciples who watched over them were displeased, but no one dared to say anything, much less even indicate any signs of displeasure.","That was because their backgrounds were significant. Even the strongest core disciple, Ye Kai, who had great elder Ye supporting him, was forced to treat these two Xuan Immortals with respect. They were all afraid of causing significant offence.","One of the three Immortal Exalt ancestors of the Black Demon Palace, Ancestor Sheng Yun, was the ancestor of these two disciples.","Ye Kai hesitated momentarily. He recalled the mission that great elder Ye had issued to him. He wanted to lead everyone and complete great elder Ye’s mission first, but when he thought of the powerful background of these two Xuan Immortal disciples, he was unable to refute them immediately either.","“Senior brother Ye, is there something wrong?” Perhaps because he had noticed that Ye Kai was in a tough spot, Sheng Zhibai furrowed his brows slightly. He was slightly displeased.","Due to their glorious ancestor, there were not a lot of fellow disciples in the Black Demon Palace that dared to offend them. Even when they came to the Taiji mountain range, they would try to satisfy them first with the Taiji spiritual Qi before giving it to other disciples.","“It’s not a problem. C’mon, let’s keep looking for Taiji spiritual Qi.” Ye Kai immediately made up his mind. He could only set aside great elder Ye’s mission for the time being and deal with it once he had satisfied these little devils.","Right as Ye Kai was about to leave with over a hundred disciples, the jade slip on him glowed with a gentle red colour. Another message had arrived.","The Taiji mountain range was enveloped by a formation. The formation’s defences were so powerful that even some mid Immortal Exalts could not penetrate it with the senses of their souls. As a result, if the seniors outside wanted to communicate with their disciples in the Taiji mountain range, they had to resort to these special methods.","When Ye Kai saw the jade slip glow with a dim red light, his face immediately changed, as this often indicated the urgency of a matter. The contents of the message were definitely significant.","Ye Kai did not dare to hesitate. He immediately checked the jade slip as quickly as he could, but shortly afterwards, he became slightly stunned.","“It’s actually a red message. Senior brother Ye Kai, has an emergency happened?” On the side, a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal woman asked. She was one of the three people absorbing the Taiji spiritual Qi.","Ye Kai looked at the female disciple. He was extremely stern. Afterwards, he glanced at Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai and said sternly, “Junior sister and junior brothers, we’ll have to set the matter of finding Taiji spiritual Qi for you aside for the time being. Great elder Ye has issued an urgent mission for us to complete immediately.\"","As he said that, a map of the Taiji mountain range appeared in Ye Kai’s hands. He pointed at one of the locations and said, “Great elder Ye has ordered us to gather here immediately to assist a fellow.”","“What kind of person would even require personal protection from us? Don’t tell me that our matter of absorbing Taiji spiritual Qi is no longer important?” Sheng Zhiyi said very unhappily.","“Senior brother Ye Kai, you can get other disciples to complete great elder Ye’s mission. We still have to collect Taiji spiritual Qi, so we don’t have time for it.”","When he heard that, a hint of anger appeared in Ye Kai’s eyes.","“Since it’s an urgent mission from great elder Ye, we obviously can’t waste any time. We better go.” At this moment, the female disciple who absorbed the Taiji spiritual Qi earlier spoke up. She completely ignored the haughty attitudes of Sheng Zhibai and Sheng Zhiyi.","Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai’s faces immediately hardened, but they squeezed out smiles very quickly. “Since senior sister Jing Yao has spoken, what are we waiting for? Senior brother Ye Kai, lead the way.”","Ye Kai nodded and immediately led everyone in the direction that great elder Ye had indicated to them as quickly as possible.","At this moment, in a valley in the Taiji mountain range, Jing Mumu hovered three hundred metres in the air. Beneath her feet was a large, lush forest.","“This should be the Taiji spiritual Qi that master talked about, right?” Jing Mumu gripped a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi in her hand and studied it curiously.","But at this moment, a dazzling streak of red light shot towards Jing Mumu at high speed.","It was an arrow that contained the power of the laws. Its power was on the level of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","This level of attack was extremely fatal to all Xuan Immortals. They could perish from the slightest carelessness.","However, Jing Mumu smirked. She gently kicked off the tip of her foot, and she immediately moved away, dodging the arrow by a millimetre. She did that all with great ease.","Boom!","The red arrow struck a rock behind her, erupting with a great rumble. The entire valley shook. Countless plants were obliterated under the violent storm of energy produced by the arrow.","In the distance, over a dozen cultivators flew over. They all carried bows on their backs, and they were all Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","“Girl, you better hand your Taiji spiritual Qi to us. It will only cause you problems if you keep it,” the leading middle-aged man said calmly.","The Taiji spiritual Qi had virtually all been collected by now. Every strand that appeared would lead to an unavoidable battle.","Even though Taiji spiritual Qi continued to emerge from underground, far too many people had entered the Taiji mountain range. It was nowhere near enough to go around."]},{"number":4017,"title":"Chapter 4017: Chapter 4018: Weapons Drawn","paragraphs":["The two sides hovered three hundred metres apart, facing one another. One side was a single person, only a peak Xuan Immortal in cultivation.","The other side had over a dozen people who were all Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals!","Jing Mumu stared at them calmly. She did not show any signs of panic or fear. She seemed to be extremely relaxed. She smiled gently. “This strand of Taiji spiritual Qi is very safe in my hands. On the other hand, you would be in danger if it ended up in your hands.”","The Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals all furrowed their brows slightly when they saw how composed Jing Mumu was.","“ Senior brother, this woman probably has quite the background. Otherwise, with her cultivation as a Xuan Immortal, how can she remain so calm in front of us? ”","“ Senior brother, let’s just let this strand of Taiji spiritual Qi go. This Xuan Immortal’s origins are probably quite impressive. After all, she’s bold enough to move alone, and she doesn’t fear us at all. That’s very abnormal... ”","People had already begun communicating with their leader.","The leader furrowed his brows slightly and immediately scolded them. “Junior brothers and sisters, if you want to obtain anything in the Taiji mountain range, you can’t be so fearful. Opportunities don’t just fall into your lap. You’ll have to earn them through your own ability. I won’t be giving up on this strand of Taiji spiritual Qi.”","At this exact moment, numerous figures flickered across the nearby valley. A few more cultivators appeared, also ranging from Xuan Immortals to Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","“Hmm? There’s a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi here...”","“We’ve finally found some Taiji spiritual Qi. The Taiji spiritual Qi is only growing rarer and rarer now. They’re basically claimed by experts as soon as they appear. We had no chance at all...”","The surrounding cultivators gathered over as they murmured. They all seemed to be very cautious.","“Our Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows discovered this strand of Taiji spiritual Qi first, so I do hope you can all do us a favour and not compete with us.” One of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals with a bow on his back called out.","When they heard him mention the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, everyone’s faces in the surroundings changed. They all became wary.","The Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows was one of the peak organisations of the Taiji Heaven. They had Immortal Exalts. An existence like that possessed great influence over the smaller organisations.","The surrounding cultivators all backed away. They did not want any conflict with the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows over a single strand of Taiji spiritual Qi.","“Lady, which sect do you belong to?” a disciple of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows yelled out.","“Who cares what sect I’m from? If you want the Taiji spiritual Qi in my possession, then hurry up and come get it. Otherwise, I’m leaving.” After saying that, Jing Mumu really just turned around to leave like no one else was around.","“Hold on. Leave the Taiji spiritual Qi or forget about leaving this place.” A disciple of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows bellowed, blocking Jing Mumu’s path with a flash. He drew his bow and a sharp presence locked onto her.","It was also at that moment that coldness flashed through Jing Mumu’s eyes. Icy killing intent vaguely appeared. Her presence underwent a sudden change like a sword had just been drawn from its sheath.","The disciple who blocked Jing Mumu’s path shivered inside. He actually developed a strange sense of fear. He felt like he was not facing a junior whose cultivation was far beneath his but a supreme expert in hiding.","In the distance, the other disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows watched closely. No one stopped them as if they wanted to probe her out with this person.","“Stop! People of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, if you dare to touch her, our Black Demon Palace will definitely make you pay a heavy price!”","Right when conflict was about to erupt between Jing Mumu and the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, a loud yell rang out from afar. It erupted between the mountains like thunder.","As soon as the voice quietened, streaks of light shot over with great speed, heading straight towards Jing Mumu’s direction.","“The Black Demon Palace! It’s the disciples of the Black Demon Palace...”","“From how aggressive they seem, they seem to be coming for us. Since when did our Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows provoke the Black Demon Palace...”","......","...","Watching the group of over a hundred disciples from the Black Demon Palace approach them, the expressions of all of the disciples from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows changed. Wariness and sternness filled their eyes.","The disciple who had his arrow drawn and locked onto Jing Mumu, ready to launch a startling attack, also panicked. He subconsciously looked in the direction of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace.","Jing Mumu was also surprised. Shortly afterwards, her sharp presence subsided slowly, and she returned to normal. She seemed like a regular Xuan Immortal.","“How bold of you, Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. To think that you’d even threaten a guest of the Black Demon Palace!”","In an instant, all the disciples of the Black Demon Palace had already approached them. Ye Kai bellowed out and erupted with his cultivation as a peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, directly striking the disciple near Jing Mumu with a palm strike.","The disciple was also a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, but he was only a mid Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. Faced with the strongest core disciple of the Black Demon Palace, he obviously stood no chance.","With a rumble, the disciple was knocked away by Ye Kai’s palm strike and began sputtering blood. The protective energy around him was as flimsy as paper. It collapsed instantly.","Seeing how Ye Kai had injured one of their disciples as soon as he arrived, the other disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows glared at him furiously. The leader could not help but bellow out, “Ye Kai, you better not take this too far. Our Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows had no idea she would be a guest of your Black Demon Palace.”","“I held back exactly in consideration of your ignorance. Otherwise, this mid Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal of your Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows would not just be slightly injured.” Ye Kai stood in front of Jing Mumu and glared at these people coldly.","Ye Kai’s haughty attitude had completely infuriated these disciples from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows.","“Our Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows might not be as great as your Black Demon Palace, but we’re still not to be trifled with...”","“Ye Kai, aren’t you being a little too arrogant? Your Black Demon Palace is still nowhere close to being untouchable on the Taiji Heaven.”","“Don’t forget that your Black Demon Palace still has mortal enemies. If you do this, aren’t you afraid that our Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows will work with them against your Black Demon Palace...”","A few disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows spoke up indignantly and yelled out angrily.","When he heard that, Ye Kai sneered in disdain. “You want to work with the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon against our Black Demon Palace? Hmph, if this were a regular battle, then so be it, but if you want to get involved in our grievance with the Blade Sect of Tricking Moon, then we really won’t stop until one side is completely eradicated. I wonder if that is a consequence that you, mere core disciples, can afford to bear.”","The Blade Sect of Trickling Moon was also a peak organisation on the Taiji Heaven. They were equally matched with the Black Demon Palace. The two had always been mortal enemies. However, due to their similar strengths, neither of them could triumph over the other, so there were not too many open conflicts. However, the skirmishes had never stopped."]},{"number":4018,"title":"Chapter 4018: Chapter 4019: Background and Identity","paragraphs":["When the disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows heard about this potential situation, their expressions all changed.","The Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows was not the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. They were one of the peak organisations on the Taiji Heaven but a significant difference existed between them and the Black Demon Palace.","“Ye Kai, stop trying to frighten us. All of the battles and conflicts in the Taiji Heaven are just grievances between us juniors. Why would it affect the situation of the sect?” the leader from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows said in rebuke.","Ye Kai sneered. “You’re right. In the Taiji mountain range, no matter how we juniors fight against one another, that’s just feuds between the juniors. The sects won’t get involved. However, that’s only limited to regular disciples. If anything happens to this guest of ours, I can guarantee you that even if the ancestor of your Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows steps in personally, you might not be able to resolve this problem.”","The disciples from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows all became uneasy. Ye Kai’s words at the very end had truly frightened them.","Even their ancestor would not be able to settle this matter? Just what kind of background did this guest of the Black Demon Palace have?","It was not just the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. Even the hundred or so disciples of the Black Demon Palace standing behind Ye Kai were in disbelief. Shortly afterwards, they all looked at Jing Mumu curiously while habouring various doubts.","“Hmph Ye Kai, I won’t forget what happened today. Let’s go.” In the end, the disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows backed off. They were not bold enough to go to war with the Black Demon Palace.","In just a short moment, only Jing Mumu and the disciples of the Black Demon Palace remained in the valley. There were still many cultivators lurking above the valley, silently watching everything that unfolded there.","Ye Kai turned towards Jing Mumu and smiled resplendently. He clasped his fist and said, “Fellow, I am Ye Kai, currently a core disciple of the Black Demon Palace.”","“I am Jing Mumu. Fellow Ye Kai, I’ve caused problems for your Black Demon Palace for what happened just now.” Jing Mumu returned the gesture with matching politeness.","“Not at all, not at all. You exaggerate, fellow Jing. It’s but a mere trifle. How can that be regarded as a problem for our Black Demon Palace. Though, the disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows should be glad that they didn’t touch you. Otherwise, their sect would be in for a world of hurt,” Ye Kai said in a hurry. Despite being the strongest core disciple and possessing some status, he still did not not to be careless around Jing Mumu who was only a peak Xuan Immortal. He spoke extremely politely.","×","Please enable JavaScript","Video Player is loading.Play VideoPlay","Unmute00:00","1x","Playback Rate","Captions","Settings","Auto(360pLQ)","ShareFullscreen","What is Russian Cultural Code? - A Documentary - English Subtitles.","Watch on","What is Russian Cultural Code? - A Documentary - English Subtitles.","“Senior brother Ye Kai, may I ask which organization this fellow comes from?” Behind Ye Kai, Sheng Zhiyi said rather unhappily. He felt like the background that he took great pride in was being overshadowed in front of Jing Mumu.","As if he could sense the unhappiness in Sheng Zhiyi’s voice, Ye Kai glanced at him deeply and said sternly, “Junior brother, you must be polite to fellow Jing. From what great elder Ye said, she is someone that great elder Xue personally indicated for us to watch over.”","“What? Great elder Xue?”","When they heard great elder Xue’s name, not only did Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai’s expressions change, but the way that the other disciples looked at Jing Mumu changed in an overwhelming manner as well.","Great elder Xue was a great elder of extremely special status in the Black Demon Palace. Her status was so great that it even surpassed the two other Immortal Exalt ancestors.","After all, she was the partner of the greatest expert of the Black Demon Palace, the Black Heaven Master.","Although she was a great elder, no one actually treated her like one.","“You’ve met my master?” Jing Yao who stood beside Ye Kai suddenly spoke up. Her eyes reddened as she stared straight at Jing Mumu. She was slightly emotional.","Jing Mumu blinked and said to Jing Yao, “Are you talking about senior Xue? Senior Xue is watching outside right now. She’s with my master.”","“Is great elder Xue really watching outside the Taiji mountain range?” Ye Kai was shocked. He subconsciously glanced at the sky and immediately became rather cautious.","“Master...” Jing Yao was filled with sorrow and confusion. She looked around at the sky enveloped by the formation as if she wanted to find her master’s location, but she was unable to see beyond the formation.","Only the upper echelon of the Black Demon Palace knew about great elder Xue’s departure. Core disciples were still unaware of that. However, as great elder Xue’s disciple, Jing Yao was the only core disciple in the Black Demon Palace who knew about this.","“ Master, why did you leave the Black Demon Palace so suddenly. You left silently. I couldn’t even see you go, ” Jing Yao thought to herself. She was saddened. Great elder Xue’s departure did not affect her status in the Black Demon Palace. After all, the greatest expert of the Black Demon Palace, the Black Heaven Master, was still her grandmaster.","Immediately, the way that all the disciples of the Black Demon Palace treated Jing Mumu underwent a great change. They all became extremely polite and respectful. Even when Jing Mumu was weaker than them, no one dared to look down on her as a result.","Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai seemed to become completely different people as well. They gathered around Jing Mumu enthusiastically, trying to befriend her.","It was as if before Jing Mumu who had great elder Xue backing her, the backgrounds that they took great pride in were slightly lacklustre.","They were aware that while their predecessor was one of the three ancestors of the Black Demon Palace, they came nowhere close to great elder Xue in terms of status.","Just like that, under Ye Kai’s enthusiastic invitation, Jing Mumu temporarily joined the group from the Black Demon Palace.","“Fellow Jing, are you a disciple of the Wind Guiding Pavilion?” At this moment, Ye Kai noticed the tablet hidden in Jing Mumu’s sleeve with his sharp eyes. He was surprised.","The Wind Guiding Pavilion possessed some fame on the Taiji Heaven. They had Immortal Emperors. However, an organisation with such strength could only be described as far too ordinary in the eyes of the Black Demon Palace.","“Actually, I’m not from the Taiji Heaven. Senior Xue had arranged this identity of a disciple of the Wind Guiding Pavilion for me.” Jing Mumu told the truth.","When they heard that, the surrounding disciples all looked at Jing Mumu in an even sterner way. Not everyone could get great elder Xue to personally make arrangements for them.","“Fellow Jing, we’ll watch over you personally. You better absorb the Taiji spiritual Qi quickly. Otherwise, if you take too long, its effects will drastically diminish, “Sheng Zhiyi said from the side.","Jing Mumu nodded before sitting down on the ground and beginning to absorb the Taiji spiritual Qi.","Meanwhile, all the disciples of the Black Demon Palace silently watched over her. They scanned the surroundings coldly as if they were warning all the cultivators that had gathered around the valley.","Jing Mumu absorbed the Taiji spiritual Qi with astonishing speed. In just a few minutes, she had completely absorbed the strand of Taiji spiritual Qi.","When she opened her eyes again, they were filled with undisguised joy and eagerness.","That was because the strand of Taiji spiritual Qi had made the invisible barrier that blocked her path of cultivation loosen slightly.","She was getting closer and closer to Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal!","“Fellow Jing, y-you’ve finished absorbing it so quickly?” Ye Kai widened his eyes. He was in disbelief.","The surrounding disciples of the Black Demon Palace all turned around and stared at Jing Mumu. They were shocked.","Even peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals could not absorb Taiji spiritual Qi so quickly."]},{"number":4019,"title":"Chapter 4019: Chapter 4020: Cosmic Hollow","paragraphs":["Seeing Ye Kai and the surrounding disciple’s faces filled with surprise, Jing Mumu blinked in some confusion. “Don’t tell me it’s very time-consuming to absorb Taiji spiritual Qi?”","“You may not be aware, fellow Jing, but even peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals will need two hours to absorb a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi. If they’re a little weaker, they’ll need even more time. Fellow Jing’s speed is truly unheard of.” Ye Kai smiled wryly. Shortly afterwards, he looked around and immediately became stern. “According to great elder Ye’s instructions, our Black Demon Palace will assist fellow Jing in obtaining a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi. You had obtained the previous strand of Taiji spiritual Qi through your own abilities, so we can’t count that one. As a result, we’ll give fellow Jing the priority with the next strand of Taiji spiritual Qi we obtain. Are there any objections?”","Ye Kai appeared to be talking to all of the disciples in the surroundings, but in reality, he observed Jing Yao as well as Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai from the corner of his eye. He was not after the opinions of the other disciples. Instead, he was seeing how these three special people would respond.","Jing Yao was in a daze and slightly sorrowful. She was still submerged in the sadness of her master’s departure, so she did not care about the Taiji spiritual Qi.","Meanwhile, Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai already knew that Jing Mumu was under great elder Xue’s care, so they obviously did not dare to have any objections. Perhaps because they that heard great elder Xue was currently observing the situation here, they even spoke up first, expressing that they would do their best to take care of Jing Mumu. They wanted to leave behind a good impression in great elder Xue’s eyes.","Afterwards, everyone left the valley together. They began searching for traces of Taiji spiritual Qi in the surrounding mountains. The sounds of battle rang out endless from afar, basically spanning the entire mountain range.","Numerous battlefields of various sizes had already taken shape. Some people fought for the sake of Taiji spiritual Qi, while others fought over previous feuds. In short, everyone was particularly aggressive. Battles of life and death unfolded, dyeing the sky red with blood.","However, the Taiji mountain range was a land of opportunity for the core disciples of various organisations to contend for fortune. None of the organisations wished for that many deaths to occur here, so they nurtured a formation spirit in the formation around the Taiji mountain range.","This was the soul of an immortal beast. It possessed the strength of an Immortal Exalt when it was still alive. Now that it had merged with the formation, it protected the lives of every single disciple here using the power of the formation.","As a result, even though there were battles everywhere in the mountain range, with many mountains dyed red with blood, none of them perished.","Whenever they were about to die, the power of the formation would interfere with the battle and forcefully transport these people outside.","Once they were sent outside by the power of the formation, that was equivalent to falling out of the competition. It was similar to death.","Ye Kai roamed the Taiji mountain range with the other disciples. He would take out his jade slip and communicate through it from time to time, contacting the other disciples of the Black Demon Palace and exchanging information.","Approximately an hour later, they finally found a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi, which they gave to Jing Mumu without any hesitation.","Jing Mumu originally wanted to decline, but she was unable to turn down their enthusiasm, so she was forced to accept the strand of Taiji spiritual Qi in the end. She absorbed it on the spot.","This time, all of the disciples from the Black Demon Palace watched Jing Mumu without blinking as if they wanted to see if she was still capable of digesting the Taiji spiritual Qi with the same terrifying speed as before.","Once again, in just a few minutes, Jing Mumu opened her eyes. She had successfully absorbed the Taiji spiritual Qi that other people would need at least an hour to refine.","The first time might have been due to luck or coincidences, but she still managed to absorb it so quickly the second time, which made the surrounding disciples of the Black Demon Palace gasp.","But at this moment, a dense wave of spiritual Qi surged forth under everyone’s feet. Over a dozen wisps of Taiji spiritual Qi emerged.","Everyone’s eyes lit up. Without any instructions, they immediately began collecting the Taiji spiritual Qi.","Very soon, the Taiji spiritual Qi all ended up in the hands of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace. Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai’s eyes shone with excitement. They did not need to participate in collecting the Taiji spiritual Qi, but they would always have priority. With the Taiji spiritual Qi, three would go to the two of them and Jing Yao. Only then would the rest go to the other disciples.","“Fellows of the Black Demon Palace, that’ll be our Taiji spiritual Qi!” But at this moment, another group of around a hundred people flew over in an extravagant manner. Their leader directly threatened the Black Demon Palace.","“It’s people from the Comic Grotto!” Many of the faces of the disciples from the Black Demon Palace changed as a result. Even Ye Kai’s face sank.","The Comic Grotto was the greatest organisation on the Taiji Heaven. They were far more powerful than the Black Demon Palace.","Of course, a new organisation had already risen up to the title of the greatest but only peak experts were aware of that.","“Sir, our Black Demon Palace and Cosmic Grotto have always minded our own business. Do you really want to steal our Taiji spiritual Qi?” Ye Kai yelled out.","“If it’s just a couple of strands, we’d obviously be too lazy to contend for them, but unfortunately, over a dozen strands of Taiji spiritual Qi have appeared. The Taiji spiritual Qi in the Taiji mountain range is only becoming rarer. Now that we’ve run into so much after all this trouble, we obviously can’t just let it slip past us,” the leader from the Cosmic Grotto said with a forced smile. Afterwards, he looked at Ye Kai and said, “You must be the greatest core disciple of the Black Demon Palace, fellow Ye Kai. I heard your battle prowess is startling, that you managed to last three rounds against an Immortal Monarch with your strength as a peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. I was wondering if you’d be interested in sparring against our senior brother Shi Tian of the Cosmic Grotto?”","When he heard Shi Tian’s name, Ye Kai’s eyes narrowed.","Shi Tian was the primary disciple of the Cosmic Grotto. He was bleeding with talent and was regarded as a peerless genius on the Taiji Heaven. His master was an Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Cosmic Grotto. He possessed numerous powerful secret techniques and startling battle prowess, earning him the title of the strongest Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal of the Taiji Heaven.","Ye Kai was confident, but he was well aware that he was not Shi Tian’s opponent.","“Give it to them!” Ye Kai ordered with a sunken face.","The disciples of the Black Demon Palace with the Taiji spiritual Qi hesitated for a moment. Their eyes were filled with intense refusal, but in the end, they could only toss their Taiji spiritual Qi over.","Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai did not dare to say anything. They could only swallow the humiliation.","If they could avoid offending the Cosmic Grotto, that would be for the best.","Jing Mumu stood beside Ye Kai silently. However, her gaze towards the disciples of the Cosmic Grotto turned cold.","“Thank you for your generosity, fellows!” Only then did the disciple from the Cosmic Grotto smile gently.","With a sunken face, Ye Kai left with everyone without uttering another word. The Cosmic Grotto was not the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. They could ignore the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, but they had to be careful around the Cosmic Grotto.","“Fellow Ye Kai, I will make them return the Taiji spiritual Qi they stole on fold in the future.” Jing Mumu comforted him.","When he heard that, Ye Kai sighed gently. “Many of our disciples have already begun fighting against people from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. We’ve sustained losses on both sides. It is not a wise idea to start any conflicts with the Cosmic Grotto at a time like this. It’s just a few strands of Taiji spiritual Qi. If they’re gone, then they’re gone.”"]},{"number":4020,"title":"Chapter 4020: Chapter 4021: Spiritual Qi Spring","paragraphs":["Ye Kai truly treated Jing Mumu’s words as an attempt at comfort. He did not think she could obtain even a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi from the disciples of the Cosmic Grotto.","After all, it would be difficult for a peak Xuan Immortal to achieve anything in the Taiji mountain range that was filled with Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. Even if she broke through, she would only be an early Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","The disciples of the Black Demon Palace were frustrated after the Cosmic Grotto’s robbery. As a result, no one said anything on the next part of the journey. The atmosphere was extremely heavy. Even Sheng Zhibai and Sheng Zhiyi who surrounded Jing Mumu in an attempt to befriend her had cut back on their enthusiasm.","“I’ve found Taiji spiritual Qi. There’s a total of eight strands...”","Suddenly, a disciple of the Black Demon Palace cried out. Several strands of Taiji spiritual Qi emerged from the ground a few hundred kilometres away, floating around aimlessly among the dense spiritual Qi.","The eyes of the depressed disciples of the Black Demon Palace immediately lit up. However, right when they wanted to head over and collect the strands, a closer group reached there before them. They collected all eight strands of Taiji spiritual Qi.","“Fellows of the Black Demon Palace, you were one step too slow.” One of them smiled at the disciples of the Black Demon Palace. Even though their group only had around sixty people, they did not fear the Black Demon Palace.","Ye Kai said nothing. He clasped his fist towards them before leading his group away without any hesitation.","“Fellow Ye Kai, which organisation do they belong to? If you wanted to fight them for it, we’d probably succeed,” Jing Mumu asked curiously. Her eyes shone with fighting spirit. She was eager to have a go as if she had been holding back for a very long time now.","“They’re from the Thousand Mountains clan. They’re second only to the Cosmic Grotto. When we came to the Taiji mountain range this time, great elder Ye specially instructed us to never, ever antagonise the Thousand Mountains clan,” Ye Kai said emotionlessly.","In the blink of an eye, seven days had already passed. During these seven days, the group from the Black Demon Palace had a small harvest. They obtained a total of twenty-six strands of Taiji spiritual Qi over the course of the week.","Jing Mumu did not obtain any of the twenty-six strands of Taiji spiritual Qi. After all, these disciples had only received an order to give Jing Mumu a strand of it. Then they only needed to ensure her safety in the Taiji mountain range.","Over the next few days, Jing Mumu was disinterested. She was already considering leaving them, as she had discovered that travelling with the disciples of the Black Demon Palace would instead get in her way. If she were alone, she could freely fight for the Taiji spiritual Qi. That way, she would be able to obtain some no matter what. However, by travelling with the Black Demon Palace, they would merely treat her as someone they needed to protect. She basically would not receive a share.","“ My master sent me in here to collect as much Taiji spiritual Qi as I could, yet I’ve failed to make any progress. How am I supposed to face my master once I leave? ” Jing Mumu stood on a boulder and kicked the weeds that grew out from the cracks in boredom. Her desire to leave intensified.","Several hundred metres away, a few core disciples of the Black Demon Palace were absorbing the Taiji spiritual Qi while the remaining disciples watched the surroundings.","Over the past few days, Jing Yao’s mental state had recovered substantially. She still said very little, but she paid particular attention to Jing Mumu. Her gaze would always gloss over Jing Mumu.","She seemed to notice something from Jing Mumu’s expression. She turned around suddenly and said to Ye Kai, “Give my portion of Taiji spiritual Qi to Jing Mumu from here on out.”","When he heard that, Ye Kai furrowed his brows slightly. He was troubled, as the order he had received was only to help Jing Mumu obtain a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi.","He had already given her that strand of Taiji spiritual Qi. If he continued to give her more, that would be equivalent to acting against the Black Demon Palace’s interests.","If Jing Mumu were a disciple of the Black Demon Palace, Ye Kai obviously would not have too many qualms. Just her connection to great elder Xue warranted special care.","However, she did not belong to the Black Demon Palace at the end of the day.","Most importantly, he did not know what kind of relationship existed between Jing Mumu and great elder Xue. Was it just a deal? Or was it something else? If it were merely a deal, giving her any more Taiji spiritual Qi would be inappropriate.","“What? Is there an issue?” Seeing how Ye Kai did not respond, Jing Yao’s face sank, showing signs of anger.","She understood her master. She knew that since her master had made such arrangements and was even personally keeping an eye out for what happened in the Taiji mountain range, her relationship with Jing Mumu must have been extremely deep.","That was because inside the Taiji mountain range, she struggled to imagine just who else or what else could result in her master personally paying attention. There was only Jing Mumu.","As for Jing Yao herself, her master did not even bid farewell to her before she left, so she obviously would not come to the Taiji mountain range for her.","Ye Kai furrowed his brows even further. After some thought, he explained his thoughts to Jing Yao secretly.","However, his explanation was not enough to persuade Jing Yao. The two of them began arguing very soon. Ye Kai’s face was filled with distress. Meanwhile, Jing Yao was furious like an angry lion.","“Fellow Jing Yao, fellow Ye Kai, you don’t need to worry about me. I can obtain the Taiji spiritual Qi through my own abilities. I don’t need your assistance.” Jing Mumu looked up from kicking the weeds and spoke to the arguing duo.","Ye Kai wanted to say something, but his communication jade slip suddenly shook violently. An urgent message had been delivered.","After reading the message, Ye Kai became stern. He immediately yelled out to everyone, “We’ve discovered a spiritual Qi spring. Junior brother Lang’s group is currently fighting against the people of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. C’mon, we’ll go and reinforce them immediately. Junior brother Lang’s group can’t last much longer.”","“A spiritual Qi spring? It appeared so early?”","“In the past, the spiritual Qi springs only appeared in the final moments. It really appeared much earlier this time...”","“The bastards from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon really just want to chase us all out of here this time...”","Immediately, all of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace stood up. Even the disciples who were in the middle of refining Taiji spiritual Qi temporarily stopped, racing off to the spring with the group.","“Fellow Jing, I’m afraid there’ll be a bitter battle between us and the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon later. We might not be able to take care of you. You need to be very careful.” Underneath everyone’s feet, the mountains rapidly receded. Along the way to the spring, Ye Kai sternly told Jing Mumu this.","“Fellow Ye Kai, you only need to focus on the enemy. I’m not as weak as you might imagine. I can take good care of myself,” Jing Mumu said confidently.","Before long, they finally arrived at the spring with the disciples of the Black Demon Palace. The spring was simply a place where spiritual Qi erupted from, but it would appear much more frequently here. Once they occupied the spring, they would only need to guard the place to obtain a steady supply of Taiji spiritual Qi. They would not have to search the entire mountain range any more."]},{"number":4021,"title":"Chapter 4021: Chapter 4022: Battle for the Spring","paragraphs":["Springs varied in size, but even the smallest one could produce a couple hundred strands of Taiji spiritual Qi.","At this moment, a violent battle unfolded near the spring. Several hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals were locked in battle, fighting to the death.","From their uniforms, one side was the Black Demon Palace, while the other side consisted of their mortal enemies, the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.","The disciples on both sides rapidly decreased. The power of formations would emerge on the battlefield from time to time, protecting the disciples on the brink of death before forcefully transporting them out of the Taiji mountain range and disqualifying them for good.","However, the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon possessed an absolute numerical advantage. As a result, the disciples of the Black Demon Palace that stood guard near the spring were forced into a retreat.","“It’s Ye Kai, the strongest core disciple of the Black Demon Palace. Quick, ask senior Wen for reinforcements...”","“Oh no, Ye Kai is here. It’s said that he can contend with Immortal Monarchs in battle with his cultivation at the peak of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. We’re not his opponent at all...”","“Senior brother Wen, only senior brother Wen can fend off Ye Kai in battle...”","The arrival of Ye Kai’s group immediately caused the expressions of many of the disciples from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon to change drastically. They became wary.","“Kill them all!” Ye Kai roared furiously, entering the encirclement with over a hundred disciples without any hesitation. Like a sharp blade, they pierced deeply into the ranks of the disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.","Ye Kai erupted with a powerful presence. He wore a pair of low quality god artifact gloves on his hands, heavily injuring a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon with a single punch, sending him flying backwards while coughing up blood.","However, before the disciple could steady himself, Ye Kai immediately caught up. His gloves shone with blinding light as he swung out a second time.","However, right when his punch was about to land, the power of the formation protecting the Taiji mountain range appeared, forming a barrier that blocked his attack. At the same time, it disqualified the disciple from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, sending him out of the Taiji mountain range and making him disappear before Ye Kai.","At this moment, Ye Kai was like a hungry wolf in a flock of sheep. He carried out a massacre with no one to stop him. In just half a minute, seven Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon had been expelled from the Taiji mountain range.","In the end, the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon mobilised ten late Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals to finally manage to keep Ye Kai busy.","The entry of Ye Kai’s group turned the tides of the battle for the disciples of the Black Demon Palace guarding the spring. They directly gained the upper hand. They completely overwhelmed the two hundred odd disciples from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.","“Ye Kai, I didn’t think you’d actually get here before me, but your Black Demon Palace is destined to have nothing to do with this spring. It belongs to our Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.”","Soon after the Black Demon Palace had gained the upper hand, a heavy voice drowned out the rumbles on the battlefield, echoing through the mountains.","The reinforcements from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon had arrived. Around two hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals shot over, joining the battle without saying anything more.","On top of that, many smaller groups of disciples from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon provided reinforcements from all directions. They either moved alone or in groups of three and five, scattered throughout the entire mountain range as they converged.","Immediately, the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon reached five or six hundred in number. On the other hand, the Black Demon Palace only had around three hundred people with Ye Kai’s group included.","The Black Demon Palace lost the upper hand once again.","Ye Kai was extremely stern. He stopped going after regular disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. His gaze was fixed on the bald, middle-aged man in front of him. His eyes shone with a vicious colour.","The bald, middle-aged man was called Wen Bozhong. He was the senior brother Wen that the core disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon had mentioned. His status in the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon was identical to Ye Kai’s status in the Black Demon Palace. He was also the strongest core disciple in his organisation.","Ye Kai said nothing. His energy surged as his gloves erupted with blinding light. He directly engaged Wen Bo in battle.","During this period, Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals arrived from all directions to provide reinforcements for both sides. However, they were all smaller groups. There were no hundred-man squads.","Despite that, the participants in the chaotic battle between the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon and the Black Demon Palace had already exceeded a thousand.","On the battlefield, the power of the formation around the Taiji mountain range appeared more and more frequently. Both sides had many disciples disqualified, forcefully expelled from the area.","“Mongrels of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, even if I die, I’m going to drag you down with me...”","“The Black Demon Palace can’t last much longer. Use your full strength, everyone. Kill them all...”","Furious roars rang out from the battlefield from time to time. The two organisations had already developed a deep feud. Now that they met, they were obviously exceptionally aggressive. All of them were locked in a battle to the death.","As a matter of fact, some disciples even gave up on defence. They desperately used their most powerful attacks in an attempt to drag the enemy down with them.","This was the Taiji mountain range after all. They were protected by the powers of the formation. They did not have to worry about their lives at all. In this battle, their greatest price they had to pay was expending some vitality.","Their expenditure here could be easily made up for with the resources rewarded to them by the sect once they returned.","The numbers on both sides rapidly decreased. Ye Kai was caught in a battle against Wen Bozhong, and they remained evenly matched. All of the disciples were already bloodied. Supreme quality immortal artifacts shattered one after another. There were even some disciples who fought until their bodies were destroyed, sent out of the Taiji mountain range under the formation’s protection as mere souls.","However, the difference in numbers put the Black Demon Palace at an obvious disadvantage, which only grew more evident as time went on.","“Lady Jing, let’s go. We won’t be able to hold onto this spiritual Qi spring...”","“Damned Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, there will be a day when I make you pay. Let’s go, let’s go. If we don’t leave now, we won’t be able to leave anymore...”","Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai had already retreated to the back. They arrived before Jing Mumu and urged her anxiously.","“You want to leave? I’m afraid it’s not going to be that easy!” A disciple of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon noticed them. He sneered as he arrived from afar with just a few flashes.","Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai’s faces immediately paled, as the disciple from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon blocking their way was a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","He was not an early or mid Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal but a late one!","With a sudden flash, Jing Yao flew over with a sword in hand. The low quality god artifact sword in her hand shone brilliantly. She became locked in battle against the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.","Boom! Jing Yao swung out at full strength, forcing back the disciple of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. As sword Qi scattered everywhere, she suddenly looked back at Jing Mumu and said, “Quick, leave here.” After saying that, she rushed back out with her sword, engaging the disciple again.","“Lady Jing, we better leave. Don’t worry about that. It’s not like they can die.” Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai were extremely anxious, urging Jing Mumu to leave. If it were not for Ye Kai’s damned order, coupled with how great elder Xue was watching from outside the formation, they would have never bothered with Jing Mumu at all.","“You should go. I still don’t want to leave yet,” Jing Mumu replied calmly. She looked around the battlefield before directing her gaze towards the spring that produced Taiji spiritual Qi from time to time. Immediately, a strange light flashed through her eyes."]},{"number":4022,"title":"Chapter 4022: Chapter 4023: Startling Battle Prowess","paragraphs":["Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai blanked out. They had never expected Jing Mumu to remain so composed even in the face of danger. Did she want to leave the Taiji mountain range already?","“Jing Mumu, if you’re not leaving, then we’re leaving without you,” Sheng Zhibai said sternly and extremely hurriedly. The Blade Sect of Trickling Moon’s advantage in numbers was only becoming clearer now. More and more people were being freed up. If more people noticed them, then they would truly be done for.","However, their worries were realised very quickly. Three streaks of light shot over from afar, surrounding Sheng Zhibai, Sheng Zhiyi, and Jing Mumu in the blink of an eye.","The three disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon were all early Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","“Why are you still here? Do you want to die?” Jing Yao, who had drifted into the distance due to her battle, looked back. Seeing how the three of them were still around, she could not help but curse in exasperation. She wanted to assist them, but her opponents were two Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. She was already stretched to her limit.","Surrounded by three Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai completely gave up on resisting. Their ancestor might have been an Immortal Exalt, but their personal strength was all too ordinary. They did not possess the ability to challenge those stronger than them.","Consequently, they did not receive any particular attention from their Immortal Exalt ancestor. They could only rely on the glory that came with their bloodline.","“Fellows of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, please do not do anything. T-the three of us will leave the Taiji mountain range by ourselves...”","“Yeah, we’ll give up on the Taiji spiritual Qi ourselves and leave the Taiji mountain range right this moment. You won’t need to expend any effort on us, fellows...”","Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai smiled dryly, wanting to avoid a bit of pain.","“If you were from another organisation, we obviously wouldn’t mind if you left the Taiji mountain range by yourselves, but you are disciples of the Black Demon Palace. Since you are from the Black Demon Palace, you can forget about leaving here so easily. You can leave your limbs behind first,” one of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon said coldly. He wielded a blade, and his eyes shone with coldness that startled Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai. He directly swung the blade towards their arms.","Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai’s faces changed drastically. They could only hold their ground against regular late Xuan Immortals. There was basically nothing that they could do to Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","However, right when the blade was about to fall, the clear thrum of a sword rang out. In that split second, Jing Mumu had struck out. With a supreme quality immortal artifact sword in hand, she released a hazy ring of light and stabbed at the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon with lightning speed.","It seemed like a casual strike, but it contained the profound aura of the laws. The power of the attack could be described as startling. It completely surpassed the range befitting of Xuan Immortals.","The disciple from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon who slashed out only felt a blur before Jing Mumu’s sword had already arrived before him. He immediately felt a sharp prick on his forehead as if the sharp sword Qi had already pierced his head before the sword had even arrived.","Simultaneously, the power of the formation that protected the Taiji mountain range appeared, turning into a barrier around the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.","Jing Mumu’s attack had failed to injure the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon in the end. It was blocked by the power of the formation.","The formation around the Taiji mountain range had already ruled the disciple as dead, expelling him from the Taiji mountain range.","It had all happened in the blink of an eye. Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai were not even able to react to what had happened yet, and a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon had already vanished from before their eyes.","In the blink of an eye, only two remained out of the three Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals that surrounded them.","But at this moment, the other two both stared at where the power of the formation had appeared in shock. They were dumbfounded.","They were left in a daze, but Jing Mumu remained on the move. Soon after sending off the first person, she struck out again. The supreme grade immortal artifact sword in her hand shone even brighter, erupting with startling sword Qi towards the second person.","The expression of the disciple of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon under attack immediately changed drastically. He forcefully dismissed his thoughts and responded. His energy erupted as he struck out with his sword with a magnificent streak of light.","Clang!","The blade and sword collided, producing a clear clash. The shockwave directly sent Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai flying.","However, the result of this forceful clash between a peak Xuan Immortal and an early Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal took everyone by surprise. The Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal actually staggered backwards uncontrollably. His blade had almost been knocked out of his hand.","On the other hand, Jing Mumu’s slender body was unshaken. Her feet seemed to be rooted deeply in the ground. She did not budge at all. Afterwards, the sword in her hand produced a beautiful afterimagine in the air, and she used the momentum to thrust out again, targeting her opponent’s forehead.","“T-this is a Xuan Immortal?” The Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon was shocked. He quickly tossed out a high quality immortal artifact bronze shield in front of him.","In the next moment, Jing Mumu shattered the bronze shield with a single attack. The tip of her sword shone with a cold sheen as it darted towards him with lightning speed and a presence of death.","The familiar power of the formation appeared once again. The second Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon had been eliminated, expelled from the Taiji mountain range under the protection of the formation.","In less than three seconds, Jing Mumu had eliminated two people with lightning speed, which left the last disciple of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon in shock.","“A-are you really a Xuan immortal?” he said in shock. His eyes were wide open as if he was trying to see through anything that Jing Mumu was hiding.","However, no matter how he tried, Jing Mumu was only a Xuan Immortal when it came to both her presence and cultivation. She was not a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","Jing Mumu’s gaze turned towards the last disciple. At that moment, she radiated with the presence of a peak Xuan Immortal, but she brought great pressure upon the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, making him back away subconsciously.","Suddenly, he made an unexpected choice. He directly turned around and fled towards the rest of the disciples in the distance.","Jing Mumu had slain two Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals with lightning speed. This startling feat had already frightened him out of his wits. Even with his cultivation as a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, he did not have the courage to face Jing Mumu in battle.","However, Jing Mumu had no plans on letting him go. She formed a seal with both hands, and her sword erupted with blinding light before shooting off as a streak of light, tailing behind him.","She had used some kind of sword technique. The sword technique did not come from Jian Chen but the Nine Limits Saint!","The Nine Limits Saint was an extremely powerful Grand Exalt. How could the power of a sword technique left behind by a figure like be judged by common sense?","With a flash, the sword had already caught up with the disciple from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. His presence was locked onto, making it unavoidable.","Every hair on the disciple’s body pricked up. A chilling coldness infiltrated his bones. He had a strong feeling that he would not be able to endure this strike no matter what.","Once the sword landed, he would be dead no matter what.","However, right when the sword was about to land, the power of the protective formation appeared in time, forming a barrier in front of the sword.","The sword immediately halted, struggling to breach the formation’s obstruction. However, the attack this time was different from the previous two times. The two previous attacks were regular strikes from Jing Mumu, while this attack was a sword technique left behind by the Nine Limits Saint.","As a result, even though the sword had been blocked, a profound aura of ways breached the obstruction of the protective formation, forming a streak of sharp light that struck its target."]},{"number":4023,"title":"Chapter 4023: Chapter 4024: Forcefully Turning the Tides (1)","paragraphs":["Spurt! Despite the formation’s protection, the disciple of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon was struck and became extremely pale. Blood sprayed out of his mouth. Most of his organs had already been obliterated. He had suffered severe injuries.","His eyes bulged from how wide he had opened them. They were filled with disbelief.","Ever since the rule had been established in the Taiji mountain range, no one had managed to cause any injury under the formation’s protection.","After all, the formation was so powerful that it was perfectly capable of blocking the violent attacks of mid Immortal Exalts. The competitors here would only be Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals at most. No matter how exceptional their methods were, it would be impossible for them to breach the formation’s defences and injure the person under protection.","Not only had he been injured while under the formation’s protection, but the person who injured him was a peak Xuan Immortal, someone with a lower cultivation.","This matter was completely unheard of!","In the next moment, the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon vanished silently before Jing Mumu’s eyes, having been forcefully transported out by the power of the formation.","In mere moments, Jing Mumu had effortlessly killed three Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.","Although they did not truly die, the formation’s power appearing was equivalent to dying.","Meanwhile, Jing Mumu had absolutely no idea what kind of impact her final attack had on the outside world.","Just as the disciple of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon was sent away, a ball of resplendent light condensed above the Taiji mountain range, forming a fist-sized rabbit in the end.","The rabbit was illusionary, shining with a bright lustre. Its tiny eyes possessed an elderliness that completely contrasted against its appearance. It also stared at Jing Mumu below in surprise and shock.","The rabbit was the spirit of the formation around the Taiji mountain range. It was an Immortal Exalt in its former life, but it had been reduced to a formation spirit for some reason.","“W-what exactly is this power? I never thought that a measly Xuan Immortal would actually possess such a wondrous power...” the palm-sized rabbit muttered in human tongue. There was a sense of amazement in its voice.","“She actually slew three Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals so quickly as a peak Xuan Immortal. She’s an absolute deviant. Who knows how long it’s been since I’ve heard of a prodigy like that. Perhaps only that legendary prodigy from the Waymight clan exceeds her.”","“But I’m going to get serious from now on. I can’t let this girl penetrate the formation’s protection anymore and harm the disciples of the various clans and sects...”","After muttering to itself, the palm-sized rabbit vanished silently again. However, Jing Mumu had clearly become a person it focused its attention on.","This was a powerful formation that could stop mid Immortal Exalts after all. It was not as weak as others might imagine. Jing Mumu was able to overwhelm the formation spirit while it was unaware, but she definitely would not succeed a second time.","“Is Jing Mumu really your disciple?” Xue Ji also witnessed Jing Mumu’s performance outside the formation around the Taiji mountain range. Her face was filled with surprise.","“Of course she’s my disciple.” Jian Chen smiled gladly. Although he knew that Jing Mumu had obtained an impressive legacy, the battle prowess she currently displayed still surpassed his estimates.","“ She truly possesses both the Sword Constitution of Soul Connection and the Sword Immortal constitution. Mumu’s current strength has already surpassed what I was capable of when I was a peak Overgod. ” Jian Chen was amazed as well. However, he also understood that Jing Mumu did not possess her current strength purely due to her special constitution. The Nine Limits Saint’s legacy played a crucial role as well.","Without any exaggeration, Jing Mumu was a successor of a Grand Exalt in the flesh. Her battle prowess obviously could not be compared to the likes of common people.","At this moment, experts from many organisations cast their gazes towards Jing Mumu outside the protective formation.","Jing Mumu had already attracted a lot of attention.","However, because virtually everyone here were Immortal Emperors, no one noticed Jing Mumu’s Sword Constitution of Soul Connection.","On the edge of the battlefield between the Black Demon Palace and the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, Jing Mumu stood with her sword in hand. Even though her presence was not particularly powerful, she gave off an indomitable aura from how she stood in the face of the storm.","After killing three Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, her gaze turned towards the battlefield in the distance.","Behind her, Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai were already completely dumbfounded. They stared at Jing Mumu’s slender figure as their hearts surged.","She had easily slain three Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals that were enough to suffocate them from their presence alone. Was she really someone that the Black Demon Palace needed to protect?","“A-are you really a Xuan Immortal?” Although Jing Yao was currently locked in battle against two other Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals in the distance, she still turned around and called out in disbelief.","“The Black Demon Palace’s defeat is already set in stone. It’s time for me to take action. At a time like this, they shouldn’t have the confidence or reason to claim the Taiji spiritual Qi all for themselves.” Jing Mumu did not bother responding to Jing Yao. Her gaze landed on the spiritual Qi spring nearby. There was a hint of eagerness and elation.","In the next moment, she strode out with her sword in hand, advancing towards the battlefield fearlessly.","At this moment, basically all of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace were outnumbered two-to-one. Defeat was only a matter of time.","“I’ll remember this day. Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, you better watch your backs from now onwards. You better not end up all by yourself!” A burly Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal of the Black Demon Palace roared furiously and reluctantly. He was riddled with wounds and all bloodied. As he faced two disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon no weaker than him, he had already run out of moves.","The two disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon directly swung their blades and slashed out with resplendent streaks of light.","The disciple from the Black Demon Palace sighed inside. He could no longer fight back. He knew that the formation's power was about to appear and disqualify him.","However, right when the two streaks of light were about to land, a slender figure appeared. Even though her presence was only a Xuan Immortal’s, she seemed like she could hold them off when she stood there.","Suddenly, Jing Mumu slashed out. The supreme quality immortal artifact sword in her hand shone with dazzling light, directly slashing out and meeting the two incoming attacks.","Boom!","With a rumble, the two attacks immediately crumbled, having been parried by Jing Mumu.","“A Xuan Immortal? How is this possible?” The two disciples widened their eyes and stared straight at Jing Mumu standing before them. They refused to believe this.","However, before they could respond, another streak of light flashed over, sweeping towards their foreheads with the profound trajectory of the ways.","However, the streak of light did not even touch their foreheads when the power of the formation appeared, expelling them from the Taiji mountain range.","“Y-you’re... Jing Mumu?” The disciple of the Black Demon Palace who had just been saved rubbed his eyes forcefully. He was filled with shock.","“Heal up. There’s still quite a lot of tough battles to come,” Jing Mumu said from behind. She recognised the man. He was one of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from Ye Kai’s group, but she did not know his name.","Shortly afterwards, Jing Mumu charged off to the next battle with her sword in hand.","“Hmm? You’re a mere Xuan Immortal, yet you want to interfere with our battle? You’re biting off more than you can chew...”","“Argh, dammit! W-who are you? Are you really a Xuan Immortal?”","“Oh no! A very powerful Xuan Immortal has appeared here. Quick, send reinforcements...”","“Impossible. That can’t be the strength of a Xuan Immortal. She must have been hiding her strength...”","......","...","Very soon, cries from disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon rang out across the battlefield."]},{"number":4024,"title":"Chapter 4024: Chapter 4025: Forcefully Turning the Tides (2)","paragraphs":["With Jing Mumu’s entry into the battlefield, the forces from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon immediately experienced quite a bit of chaos. The strength that Jing Mumu displayed as a mere peak Xuan Immortal junior brought chills to everyone present.","She was not a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, but she was even more terrifying than one. Unless they were a great expert at late Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, they definitely could not last three moves against her.","However, even late Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals would struggle to fend off her startling sword techniques when they clashed.","Every sword technique she used would always eliminate at least one Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","Jing Mumu had only joined the battle recently, but she had already buried over forty Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","Ye Kai and Wen Bozhong who were currently locked in an intense battle were also deeply shocked by the battle prowess that Jing Mumu demonstrated. Before they knew it, both of them had already stopped using their full strength. They directed most of their attention to Jing Mumu.","“There’s nothing wrong with my eyes, right? I-is that really Jing Mumu?”","“She kills Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals effortlessly like she is taking candy from a baby. Heavens, since when did Jing Mumu become so terrifying...”","“What a joke, to think that she was someone we thought we needed to protect just before. Yet now... look, who’s protecting who...”","The disciples of the Black Demon Palace who originally travelled with Jing Mumu were all dumbfounded. They struggled to believe their eyes.","Outside the protective formation, Xue Ji who had been watching Jing Mumu the entire time also went from her initial shock to absolute dumbfoundedness. She was left speechless by the alarming battle prowess that Jing Mumu demonstrated.","If she had just defeated a few Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, then perhaps that could be attributed to some kind of powerful trump card.","However, Jing Mumu had defeated far more than just a few people. She had defeated over forty of them.","Moreover, her victory over them was equivalent to killing her opponent.","That was quite terrifying.","“What kind of legacy did this girl obtain? It’s actually so powerful...” Several thousand kilometres away, great elder Ye from the Black Demon Palace cried out inexplicably. His elderly eyes were filled with shock.","Several tens of thousand kilometres away, an Immortal Emperor ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion trembled mid-air. His face was rather pale as a thin layer of sweat had already formed on his forehead.","“My little demon, can you be a little more discreet? You entered the Taiji mountain range under the name of our Wind Guiding Pavilion. You currently carry a tablet from our Wind Guiding Pavilion. Now, you go on a massacre against the disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. How are we supposed to explain ourselves to the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon now!?”","“My little demon, stop, stop this instance. You need to stop killing. Our Wind Guiding Pavilion is not the Black Demon Palace. We cannot endure the wrath of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.”","The ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion wiped away the cold sweat on his forehead again and again. He was filled with regret. Originally, he thought it was merely an entry spot and nothing major would happen if he gave it away. He had never thought that the person who used it would stir up such a great mess in the Taiji mountain range.","At this moment, a powerful presence suddenly arrived. A figure appeared before the ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion like a shadow. He shone with the magnificent sheen of a blade, which completely enveloped his figure.","This was a great elder of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, the Demon-ending Master. He was an Eighth Heavenly Layer Immortal Emperor.","“How bold of you, Wind Guiding Pavilion. If you don’t give me a satisfying explanation, the Wind Guiding Pavilion will cease to exist on the Taiji Heaven tomorrow,” the Demon-ending Master said frigidly. Powerful blade intent scattered across the surroundings as if it was forming an independent domain that enveloped the ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion.","The ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion was only an early Immortal Emperor. He was obviously powerless against the Demon-ending Master who had already reached the Eighth Heavenly Layer of Immortal Emperor. He was seized by a great force and left virtually immobilised.","“Senior Demon-ending, it’s a misunderstanding, it’s all a misunderstanding. How could our Wind Guiding Pavilion have the courage to act against your Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. If I had known that girlie would stir up such a mess here, I would have never given our Wind Guiding Pavilion’s entry spot to senior Xue.” The ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion sobbed. As an early Immortal Emperor, he only hoped to maintain and manage his own bit of territory. He did not have the courage to get involved with the grievances of these peak organisations.","“Senior Xue? You mean Xue Shuangyue of the Black Demon Palace?” The Demon-ending Master’s voice was still extremely cold. He was aware that a prodigy like Jing Mumu could not have been nurtured by a measly Wind Guiding Pavilion. However, when he thought about how several dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from his sect could not even stop a mere peak Xuan Immortal, the Demon-ending Master struggled to see past the humiliation.","“Yeah, yeah, yeah. It was senior Xue of the Black Demon Palace who came to me and asked for a spot from me. Since the Black Demon Palace asked for it, where would I find the courage to decline?” The ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion was filled with a sense of being wronged.","When he heard that, the killing intent in the Demon-ending Master’s heart immediately surged.","“That’s right, I did indeed take that spot. Demon-ending, if you’re so capable, come after me. Why bother the Wind Guiding Pavilion?” Right as his killing intent surged, Xue Ji’s voice rang out from afar at the perfect moment, directly entering the Demon-ending Master’s ear.","The Demon-ending master sucked in a deep breath and immediately withdrew his rising killing intent. He said coldly, “Xue Shuangyue, you are the Black Heaven Master’s partner, so I obviously don’t have the courage to do anything to you. However, the Wind Guiding Pavilion has done something that they shouldn’t have. As a result, they must pay a hefty price for their actions.” When the Demon-ending Master said that, the ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion became ashen.","The Taiji mountain range had its rules. None of the conflicts between the juniors could involve the seniors. However, the ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion did not have the courage to mention this rule. In this world where the strong preyed on the weak, there was no such concept of the weak arguing against the strong over rules.","“Enough, stop arguing. This girlie might have entered the Taiji mountain range under the name of the Wind Guiding Pavilion, but it’s all within the rules...” Right when the ancestor of the Wind Guiding Pavilion panicked, an elderly voice rang out from afar.","It was a great elder from the Cosmic Grotto!","The Cosmic Grotto was once the greatest organisation on the Taiji mountain range. It had also occupied this position for who knew how many years. It had fallen to second place now, but it still bore great influence.","The Demon-ending Master’s presence seized up. He was surprised. It seemed like he had never expected a great elder of the Cosmic Grotto to speak up for the measly Wind Guiding Pavilion.","“The Taiji mountain range has its own rules. Regardless of how the juniors fight amongst themselves, we are not to get involved. This is a rule that all the organisations on the Taiji Heaven agreed to. Everyone must follow it. No one is an exception. Otherwise, you will face the punishment of all the organisations on the Taiji Heaven,” the great elder of the Thousand Mountains clan also spoke up.","The Thousand Mountains clan was the second greatest organisation on the surface, but in reality, they had already replaced the Cosmic Grotto among the upper echelon of the Taiji Heaven.","This was entirely due to an unprecedented prodigy produced by the Thousand Mountains clan, Lu Wujin!!","As a Sixth Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt, he wielded the sovereign god artifact, the Way Bearing Blade, and defeated the established Seventh Heavenly Layer expert, the Space-splitting Venerable, in a single strike.","Lu Wujin’s influence and prestige on the Taiji Heaven could no longer be rivalled. Just his reputation alone could stifle the former greatest organisation, the Cosmic Grotto.","As great elders from the Thousand Mountains clan and the Cosmic Grotto had spoken up, the Demon-ending Master from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon could no longer act up anymore. He was forced to suppress his fury.","“Twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals working together. I wonder if that girl can stop them now...” At this moment, the great elder from the Cosmic Grotto spoke up. He had already stopped paying attention to the Demon-ending Master. Instead, he directed his focus towards Jing Mumu’s performance.","“Definitely not. As a peak Xuan Immortal, her foundations are nowhere near enough for her to last so long in such an intense battle. However, even if she is defeated, her name will ring across the Taiji Heaven for coming so far,” said the great elder of the Thousand Mountains clan. He did not pay attention to the performance of his own disciples. Instead, his eyes were glued in Jing Mumu’s direction. His face was also filled with undisguised amazement."]},{"number":4025,"title":"Chapter 4025: Chapter 4026: Forcefully Turning the Tides (1)","paragraphs":["At this moment, Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals had already begun organising themselves together on the chaotic battlefield formed from the forces of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon and the Blade Demon Palace.","In order to deal with Jing Mumu who had appeared out of nowhere, the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon had a total of twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals working together, surrounding Jing Mumu from all sides and striking at the same time. None of them held back whatsoever.","Immediately, resplendent streaks of light shot through the air one after another, forming a cage that enveloped Jing Mumu.","These were twelve attacks from Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, arriving from all directions and sealing off all paths of retreat. Jing Mumu could not dodge or escape. She could only take on the attack forcefully.","Faced with twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, even the likes of Ye Kai and Wen Bozhong would be put in a tough spot, let alone a mere peak Xuan Immortal like Jing Mumu.","“Be careful, Jing Mumu...”","Many disciples of the Black Demon Palace had already cried out in the surroundings. The combined attack of twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals was virtually enough to kill anyone at the same level as them. Only peerless prodigies stood a chance.","At that moment, all of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace were worried for Jing Mumu.","Ye Kai, who was currently locked in battle against Wen Bozhong, panicked as well. He wanted to abandon Wen Bozhong to reinforce her, but his opponent refused to let him go.","Faced with the encirclement of twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, Jing Mumu clearly did not panic. She swallowed the low grade God Tier pill she had kept in her mouth for all this time, and her exhausted energy immediately began to recover.","At the same time, she bit open her finger and blood flowed out. She used a droplet of blood on the tip of her finger to draw a profound glyph in the air out of nowhere.","As the glyph took shape, the surroundings fell silent as time seemed to stop. Around the glyph, the laws within several thousand metres seemed to be overwritten. A new order seemed to emerge, establishing an independent domain.","The twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals who attacked Jing Mumu all halted as if they had been frozen. They remained in the same posture as before, seized in place.","The glyph emanated with a mysterious power that restrained the twelve of them.","At that moment, they could not speak or move. Their minds still ran freely, but there was nothing else that they could do.","After completing the glyph with her own blood, Jing Mumu had clearly paid a hefty price as well. Her face paled substantially, but she did not hesitate. Like a fairy, she quickly drifted towards the twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals with her sword in hand, piercing their foreheads without any hesitation with the sharp tip of her sword.","Faced with Jing Mumu’s attacks, the twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals’ eyes were filled with deep shock and disbelief.","However, their bodies were immobilised by an invisible force. There was nothing that they could do. They could only watch helplessly as this lethal strike approached them.","If this was not the Taiji mountain range, the fate of these twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals would have been set in stone. However, under the protection of the formation around the Taiji mountain range, they would be forcefully expelled as long as their lives were at risk.","Just like that, not only did the twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals fail to injure Jing Mumu when working together, but they were even eliminated by her instead.","“W-what was that power just now...”","“I struggle to imagine that with our strength as Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, we can be restrained by the secret technique of a Xuan Immortal...”","“If it weren’t for the protection of the formation, we would have died just now...”","......","...","The twelve Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals were all transported out of the formation. At that moment, the twelve of them hovered mid-air, still shaken. They were already soaked in cold sweat.","“Hmph, how humiliating!” The great elder of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, the Demon-ending Master, appeared. He took them away with a sunken face. When the Demon-ending Master’s gaze turned towards Jing Mumu again, chilling killing intent had already appeared in the depths of his eyes.","The Cosmic Grotto, the Thousand Mountains clan, and all the great elders paying close attention to Jing Mumu were all left tongue-tied. They were left speechless.","That was because the alarming battle prowess that Jing Mumu demonstrated had already overturned their imaginations.","Jing Mumu did not have it easy in the Taiji mountain range. She wolfed down pills, having already developed a hint of exhaustion.","She was only a peak Xuan Immortal after all. Even with the Sword Constitution of Soul Connection and the Sword Immortal constitution, she was approaching her limits after slaying several dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","“She can’t last much longer. Any disciple who is free, surround and kill her!” Wen Bozhong, who was locked in a fierce battle against Ye Kai, noticed Jing Mumu’s signs of weakness. He immediately rallied the disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.","When they heard that, many of the disciples hesitated slightly. Even though they were all Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, possessing an advantage over her in terms of cultivation, the battle prowess that Jing Mumu demonstrated had already struck fear into their hearts.","If they were matched against the disciples of the Black Demon Palace, at least they could still reach a stalemate. However, no one could last very long in front of Jing Mumu. All of them had been eliminated with lightning speed.","Seeing how no one moved despite all this time, Wen Bozhong was furious. He directly threatened them with punishments from the sect.","The disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon were powerless. They could only abandon their evenly-matched opponents, assembling over a dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals again that approached Jing Mumu aggressively.","Jing Mumu was still as fearless as before. She glanced past the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals as her lips curled into a sneer.","Spurt! Suddenly, Jing Mumu sprayed out with a mouthful of blood. At the same time, she formed a seal with her fingers. As the seal changed, the bloody mist she sprayed in the air turned into a blanket of resplendent sword Qi. It engulfed the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals with a dazzling, blood-red glow.","“Oh no, this woman still has strength. Be careful, everyone...”","“Don’t underestimate her. Use your full strength...”","The disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon that approached Jing Mumu all cried out. They unleashed their various attacks, slashing out with streaks of light in an attempt to fend off the incoming sword Qi.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The attacks collided and produced a series of deep rumbles. However, the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon only lasted for a split second before being quickly swallowed by the wave of blood-red sword Qi.","When the sword Qi vanished, all of these Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon had vanished from the Taiji mountain range.","Jing Mumu’s secret technique had once again massacred over a dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals!","The sight brought chills to everyone present. Not only did the disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon tremble inside, but even the disciples of the Black Demon Palace could not help but shiver. Many of them looked at Jing Mumu in deep fear along with their gratitude.","Wen Bozhong could not help but gasp. He was shocked. Even he could not kill over a dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals in such an easy way.","He saw how Jing Mumu seemed feeble, but she still had some strength to keep fighting. After a moment of consideration, he made up his mind and finally made an extremely difficult decision. “Disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, retreat!”","With that, Wen Bozhong repelled Ye Kai with a full-strengthened slash before leaving without looking back.","There were several spiritual Qi springs in the Taiji mountain range. Now that they had lost their advantage, he did not want a fight to the death here.","The remaining disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon all felt relieved as well. They abandoned their opponents without any hesitation, rushing off in Wen Bozhong’s direction.","Immediately, all of the disciples of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon retreated. With that, the intense battle between the two organisations finally settled down.","The disciples of the Black Demon Palace had already been reduced to around three hundred people. Everyone suffered injuries of various degrees. They were scattered in the surroundings, all ingesting pills to recover. Their infrequent gazes towards Jing Mumu were filled with deep fear and reverence.","At that moment, no one dared to look down on Jing Mumu in any way just because of her cultivation as a Xuan Immortal.","“Hahaha, fellow Jing, it’s all thanks to you this time. Otherwise, the ones fleeing desperately in the end would not have been the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon but the disciples of our Black Demon Palace.” Ye Kai laughed. He arrived before Jing Mumu and thanked her gratefully.","“Jing Mumu, y-you really weren’t hiding your cultivation?” Jing Yao appeared beside Jing Mumu. The way she looked at Jing Mumu had already undergone a drastic change.","Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai also flew over from afar as they trembled. They no longer treated Jing Mumu as casually as before. The two of them became much more reserved. There was even fear in the depths of their eyes."]},{"number":4026,"title":"Chapter 4026: Chapter 4027: Jing Mumu Breaks Through (1)","paragraphs":["“Senior brother Ye, this fellow is truly powerful. This time, we only managed to repel the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon due to this fellow’s assistance.” A burly man walked over with over a dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals around him. He smiled from ear to ear and was extremely enthusiastic, except his gaze towards Jing Mumu was filled with wariness.","His name was Lang Shan, a peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. He was not as powerful as Ye kai, but he was still one of the core disciples that stood at the very top in the Black Demon Palace.","“Junior brother Lang, let me introduce her to you. This is fellow Jing. Fellow Jing is someone that great elder Xue personally introduced over to protect our Black Demon Palace,” Ye Kai said enthusiastically. He no longer had the courage to say that Jing Mumu was someone they had to protect.","With her startling feats of slaughtering several dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon, there probably were not many people in the entire Taiji mountain range that had the strength to match Jing Mumu in battle.","That kind of strength was already enough for her to do as she pleased in the Taiji mountain range. Why would she still need protection?","When they heard Ye Kai’s words, many of the disciples from the Black Demon Palace were overcome with strange expressions. Who would have ever thought that as a group of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, they would need the protection of a Xuan Immortal?","However, none of them could rebuke something so absurd either.","Following this battle, Jing Mumu’s status grew substantially. She earned the respect of all the disciples from the Black Demon Palace. Even Sheng Zhiyi and Sheng Zhibai had grown fearful of Jing Mumu, no longer possessing the courage to converse with her. Even when they interjected every now and then, they would be extremely careful with what they said.","“Fellow Jing, what are your next plans?” After a simple exchange of courteous words, Ye Kai asked carefully.","“My goal for entering the Taiji mountain range is to collect Taiji spiritual Qi, so I’ll obviously focus on collecting Taiji spiritual Qi now,” answered Jing Mumu before subconsciously glancing at the spiritual Qi spring in the distance.","Coincidentally, more Taiji spiritual Qi emerged from the spring. There were a total of three strands.","Seeing this, none of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace did anything. They only stared at the three strands of Taiji spiritual Qi without moving.","It was not that they were not interested. From the fervour in their eyes, they clearly wanted to claim it for themselves. However, Jing Mumu’s existence had prevented them from acting carelessly.","Jing Mumu’s eyes shone. She was also interested.","After a moment of hesitation, Ye Kai swung his hand and trapped the three strands of Taiji spiritual Qi in his hand with pure energy. Afterwards, he passed two of them to Jing Mumu and said sternly, “Fellow Jing, this spring will produce several hundred strands of Taiji spiritual Qi at the very least. We’ll give you two thirds of everything that emerges next and our Black Demon Palace will take the last remaining third. Is that fine?”","Jing Mumu smiled sweetly and said easily, “I can’t let you suffer too much. How about this? We’ll go half and half on the Taiji spiritual Qi.”","“Alright, then that’s that!” Ye Kai’s eyes lit up and agreed happily.","Jing Mumu accepted the two strands of Taiji spiritual Qi from Ye Kai and began refining them.","The three-hundred-odd disciples of the Black Demon Palace scattered across the surroundings. They all crossed their legs and sat down. Some of them seized every moment to heal, while others ingested pills to recover their energy. No one had any objections over the decision to give away half of the Taiji spiritual Qi.","They were all aware that if it were not for Jing Mumu, their Black Demon Palace would not have been able to claim this spiritual Qi spring at all.","Very soon, Jing Mumu completely refined the two strands of Taiji spiritual Qi. Jing Mumu felt her entire body become even lighter. A sense of understanding welled up inside her as if a brand-new door was about to open.","She was already extremely close to Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. The barrier blocking her path ahead was about to shatter.","“It’s still not enough. I need even more Taiji spiritual Qi,” Jing Mumu thought to herself. Actually, having come so far already, she only needed some time for consolidation to reach Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal sooner or later. However, she had no choice but to absorb even more Taiji spiritual Qi to accelerate the process.","Afterwards, everyone began to wait around the spiritual Qi spring quietly for more Taiji spiritual Qi to emerge. The Taiji spiritual Qi would appear every once in a while. Half of it would go to Jing Mumu, while the other half would be split among the disciples of the Black Demon Palace.","Now, many disciples of the Black Demon Palace had already obtained a strand of Taiji spiritual Qi. They immediately refined it on the spot.","More and more cultivators gathered around this spiritual Qi spring. They stared at the spring from afar and made no attempts to hide their desires.","There were even groups from other peak organisations that were prepared to steal it from them, but after comparing the strength of their forces to the Black Demon Palace’s, they were forced to give up in the end.","“Fantastic, this is fantastic. The group led by junior brother He has claimed a spiritual Qi spring as well. Our Black Demon Palace now has two spiritual Qi springs in the Taiji mountain range.” Suddenly, Ye Kai took out the communication jade slip and called out excitedly.","“What? Senior brother He Tian has claimed a spiritual Qi spring as well? Hahaha, looks like our Black Demon Palace has been quite fortunate in this struggle over Taiji spiritual Qi...”","The positive news immediately reinvigorated the disciples of the Black Demon Palace.","Afterwards, spiritual Qi springs appeared one after another in the Taiji mountain range, reaching ten in total very soon. After intense battles, these springs were all claimed by peak organisations on the Taiji Heaven.","However, the situation where peak organisations occupied the springs changed very quickly. The Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from smaller organisations began banding together, assembling a great group of people and attacking these peak organisations by using their advantage in numbers.","In the end, after a bitter battle, some of the peak organisations were defeated, losing the spiritual Qi springs.","Even Ye Kai’s group of three hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals faced a difficult battle. The smaller organisations assembled over seven hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals to launch an assault against them. If it were not for Jing Mumu who slaughtered many experts with her extraordinary methods, Ye Kai’s group would have struggled to maintain the spring.","From this battle, their numbers also dropped from around three hundred to around two hundred and fifty.","By now, there was already chaos everywhere in the Taiji mountain range. There were intense battles everywhere, as these were battles for opportunity among the juniors. It did not involve the outside world. As a result, as long as the benefits were big enough, some of the smaller organisations were bold enough to band together and go after the bigger organisations.","At this moment, the communication jade slip in Ye Kai’s hand began to flash rapidly. An emergency was happening.","He Tian was asking for reinforcements. The other spiritual Qi spring he occupied was currently under attack from the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon. They were being forced into a retreat.","Ye Kai’s face sank. He wanted to bring a group of people with him to assist. However, he could sense the vague presences lurking around in the surroundings, so he was forced to hold back.","In the current Taiji mountain range, the Taiji spiritual Qi that appeared in places aside from the springs were only diminishing in quantity. As a result, many of the smaller organisations turned their attention towards the springs. If their defences were not powerful enough, they would struggle to maintain them.","After considering the cost and benefit, Ye Kai was forced to give up on reinforcing He Tian.","Just like that, the second spiritual Qi spring claimed by the disciples of the Black Demon Palace ended up in the hands of the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon.","Time trickled by silently. In the blink of an eye, it had already been three months since Jing Mumu and Ye Kai’s group had claimed the spiritual Qi spring. During these three months, the spring had already produced over four hundred strands of Taiji spiritual Qi. All the strands that Jing Mumu had received were absorbed by her.","Her cultivation in the Taiji mountain range was still a little weak. She was unable to truly overwhelm everyone just yet. As a result, she needed a tremendous amount of Taiji spiritual Qi to reach Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal as quickly as possible.","The effects of Taiji spiritual Qi were obviously better the more one absorbed. However, very few people could claim so much Taiji spiritual Qi for themselves.","After absorbing all these strands of Taiji spiritual Qi, Jing Mumu finally overcame that bottleneck and was in the process of formally stepping into the realm of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","At that moment, Jing Mumu erupted with light. Extremely sharp sword intent radiated from her body, enveloping the nearby wilderness.","She had already entered her breakthrough. Her presence was rapidly rising, becoming more and more terrifying.","She clearly had not reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal properly, but her presence was so powerful that many of the surrounding Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals were alarmed.","“ Hmm? Look, that deviant of a Xuan Immortal has begun her breakthrough... ”","“ That can’t be. She’s actually a Xuan Immortal? Isn’t she a peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal in disguise? ”","“ Even as a Xuan Immortal, she was already so terrifying. If she reaches Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, just who in the Taiji mountain range would still be her opponent? ”","......","...","The vague presences lurking in the surroundings pulsed as many cultivators communicated amongst themselves.","On the Black Demon Palace’s side, Ye Kai looked at Jing Mumu both sternly and with mixed feelings. In the past, he had always held onto a slight hope that Jing Mumu had used an extremely impressive method to disguise herself as a Xuan Immortal. Maybe she was actually a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","But now, with Jing Mumu’s breakthrough, Ye Kai was finally forced to accept this terrifying truth. Jing Mumu really was just a Xuan Immortal.","Jing Yao stared at Jing Mumu from three hundred metres away. She was in a daze. Her master was a great elder of the Black Demon Palace, Xue Shuangyue. Even her master’s husband, the Black Heaven Master, would guide her from time to time. As a result, both her cultivation environment and cultivation resources could be considered as exceptional.","Yet in the end, there remained such a great difference between her and Jing Mumu even with such a great advantage.","That left her deeply shocked.","“Senior brother Ye, why do I feel like more and more cultivators are gathering in the surroundings? The situation probably isn’t very good.” Lang Shan arrived before Ye Kai and glanced at the surroundings sternly.","Ye Kai nodded and said sternly, “I sense it too. It’s probably because the Taiji spiritual Qi is appearing less and less frequently elsewhere. As a result, having obtained none, the cultivators from the smaller organisations have begun casting their attention towards the springs.”","After saying that, Ye Kai looked around and glanced past the disciples of the Black Demon Palace. He also became slightly worried.","With only this bit of manpower, they would struggle to maintain this spiritual Qi spring.","Earlier, due to Jing Mumu’s influence, some of these people had second thoughts, but now, Jing Mumu was in the middle of a breakthrough. She could not interfere for the time being. Without Jing Mumu’s deterrence, could they still maintain the spring with their manpower?","When he thought of that, Ye Kai became even sterner. He called out, “Everyone, be on high vigilance. Watch over fellow Jing. We have to ensure that no disturbances occur during fellow Jing’s breakthrough.”"]},{"number":4027,"title":"Chapter 4027: Chapter 4028: Jing Mumu Breaks Through (2)","paragraphs":["Immediately, all the disciples of the Black Demon Palace were on high vigilance, staring at the surroundings cautiously.","At the same time, numerous Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals gathered around the spiritual Qi spring occupied by the Black Demon Palace. They either concealed their presence and hid away carefully, or they completely exposed themselves, appearing brazenly in the Black Demon Palace disciples’ senses of souls.","Not only were there numerous smaller organisations from across the Taiji Heaven, but there were even disciples from peak organisations among them.","The Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows was one of these peak organisations.","At this moment, over a hundred disciples from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows gathered on a mountain peak. They gazed through the mist at the spiritual Qi spring guarded by the Black Demon Palace as their eyes shone greedily.","“The Immortal Sect of Taibai has already given their answer. They’re willing to work with us to claim the Black Demon Palace’s spiritual Qi spring,” a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows hurried back and said sternly.","The Immortal Sect of Taibai was also one of the peak organisations on the Taiji Heaven, but they were relatively weak. They only had a First Heavenly Layer Immortal Exalt. They were even weaker than the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows.","There were many peak organisations like the Immortal Sect of Taibai and the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows that failed to claim a spiritual Qi spring for themselves in the Taiji mountain range. After all, there were several dozen peak organisations that possessed Immortal Exalts on the Taiji Heaven. Meanwhile, only around ten spiritual Qi springs had appeared so far. That was obviously not enough to go around.","“Fellow Yun Zhan, when do we strike? If we wait any longer, the spiritual Qi spring is going to dry up.” At this moment, over a dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals arrived as a group. Each one of them represented an organisation that had Immortal Emperors. At this moment, they all looked at a man from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows.","He was a young man in his twenties. He had a handsome, striking, and masculine appearance. At this moment, he sat on a boulder with his eyes shut. He did not budge at all.","He was Yun Zhan, the greatest core disciple of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. Not only was he powerful, but his background could not be underestimated either. His master was an Immortal Exalt ancestor of the sect.","“Wait for the people from the Immortal Sect of Taibai to assemble. Then we’ll strike immediately!” Yun Zhan opened his eyes and looked at the spiritual Qi spring in the distance.","“The Immortal Sect of Taibai is joining us? That’s fantastic. I heard they still have over two hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals with them...”","“The Immortal Sect of Taibai sent in quite a few Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals this time. I heard that just a month ago, they had claimed a spiritual Qi spring for themselves, but they lost it after just a few days. They suffered heavy losses from that, or they would have even more people...”","When they heard the entry of the Immortal Sect of Taibai, the representatives of the Immortal Emperor organisations were all reinvigorated.","At this moment, a group of almost a hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan immortals flew over from afar, directly approaching the spiritual Qi spring guarded by the Black Demon Palace.","They seemed to be in an extremely poor shope. Many of them were bloodied, and their presences were slightly haggard as if they had recently experienced a great battle.","“They’re from the Black Demon Palace. I didn’t expect that aside from the people guarding this spiritual Qi spring, they’ve others scattered across the Taiji mountain range...”","“They’re just the defeated remnants of a group. They’re not worth any concern. They should be the last bit of power the Black Demon Palace has in the Taiji mountain range...”","“Their leader seems to be He Tian of the Black Demon Palace, a core disciple who is said to be only second to Ye Kai. He’s very powerful...”","In front of Yun Zhan, the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals that represented over a dozen different organizations immediately recognised this group. Some of them were stern, while others were unconcerned.","The group of almost a hundred people were led by He Tian. He had already gathered all the disciples of the Black Demon Palace scattered across the Taiji mountain range.","After numerous battles, the Black Demon Palace had already lost over half of the disciples they sent into the Taiji mountain range.","At this moment, He Tian seemed to discover the people from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. He changed directions and directly approached them.","The disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows watched quietly. Some of the disciples became nervous. However, as the greatest core disciple, Yun Zhan remained at ease as if he did not fear the Black Demon Palace.","He Tian was a scholarly middle-aged man. He led his group over to Yun Zhan. As if he already knew what they were up to, he said calmly, “Looks like the reputation of our Black Demon Palace still isn’t enough to scare off certain rascals. Look at the lot of you. Are you prepared to work together and steal our Black Demon Palace’s spiritual Qi spring?”","Faced with He Tian’s question, the representatives of the various organisations did not dare to answer. Faced with the Black Demon Palace’s forces, they were obviously lacking in confidence. As a result, they all looked towards Yun Zhan.","Yun Zhan, who was also from a peak organisation, had now become their backbone.","Sensing everyone’s gazes, Yun Zhan smiled gently. He stood up and clasped his fist politely. “You must be fellow He Tian of the Black Demon Palace. Greetings from Yun Zhan of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows.”","He Tian stared at Yun Zhan coldly and said nothing.","After a pause, Yun Zhan completely ignored He Tian’s coldness and continued, “What you said just now is not completely correct, fellow He Tian. All of the opportunities in the Taiji mountain range are for us to seize based on strength. No one had ever set the rule that this spiritual Qi spring belongs to your Black Demon Palace.”","When he heard that, He Tian’s face became even colder. “If you want to go after other spiritual Qi springs, our Black Demon Palace obviously won’t care, but if you want to extend your claws over here, you better consider the consequences.” Leaving that behind, He Tian led his group away to reunite with Ye Kai.","“Fellow Yun Zhan, why don’t we eliminate these people first?” A Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from an Immortal Emperor’s organisation asked after He Tian had left.","“There’s no hurry. Let’s wait for the people from the Immortal Sect of Taibai first. As for He Tian’s group, they’re all heavily injured. They’re nowhere close to their peak condition. Even if they reunite with Ye Kai, they won’t strengthen them by much,” Yun Zhan said confidently.","Soon after, He Tian reunited with Ye Kai’s group. With their arrival, the disciples of the Black Demon Palace guarding the spiritual Qi spring had increased to over three hundred.","Despite that, Ye Kai’s mind still weighed heavily, as he had already learnt greater details from He Tian. The situation was very dangerous.","He Tian looked at the spiritual Qi spring nearby and said sternly, “We hurried over from the very east of the Taiji mountain range. Along the way, we didn’t find a single wisp of Taiji spiritual Qi. Apart from the spiritual Qi springs, Taiji spiritual Qi basically will not appear in the Taiji mountain range anymore. As a result, these smaller organisations have all directed their attention towards the spiritual Qi springs.”","“They need a spiritual Qi spring, or they will have nothing at all.”","“However, with just us, we definitely won’t be able to hold onto this spiritual Qi spring. Ye Kai, what are your plans?”","Ye Kai furrowed his brows firmly. After a moment of thought, he let out a sigh in the end. “If we really run out of options, then we’ll give up on this spiritual Qi spring and share it with everyone. That way, the Taiji spiritual Qi we obtain will decrease, but we have no other choice.”","When he said that, many disciples of the Black Demon Palace felt very powerless. In another situation, even if they faced all of these organisations at once, they definitely could not threaten the Black Demon Palace.","However, this was the Taiji mountain range, a place for the juniors to seize opportunities. It came with its own rules. Under these rules, basically all of the peak organisations lost their superior advantage in the outside world.","Before long, around two hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Immortal Sect of Taibai finally united with the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows.","At this moment,t they stopped lurking, surging forth from the surroundings. A great group of people pressed towards the Black Demon Palace’s spiritual Qi spring in an impressive manner."]},{"number":4028,"title":"Chapter 4028: Chapter 4029: Jing Mumu Breaks Through (3)","paragraphs":["The disciples of the Black Demon Palace immediately behaved like they were facing a powerful enemy. Ye Kai’s presence surged as he stood forward in front of all of the disciples.","The Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows and the Immortal Sect of Taibai, coupled with over a dozen Immortal Emperor organisations, had formed almost a thousand people in total. Meanwhile, the Black Demon Palace only had around three hundred remaining. On top of that, many of them were no longer in peak condition, severely affecting their battle prowess. If they really began fighting, the Black Demon Palace would not have any advantages at all.","Even though they came from a peak organisation and the cultivation methods and secret techniques they grasped could not be rivalled by regular organisations, not everyone was a prodigy.","With no other choice, Ye Kai began negotiating with everyone. As a representative of the Black Demon Palace, he began making concessions, no longer claiming the spiritual Qi spring for themselves. Instead, he planned on sharing a part of it with everyone.","“We already have enough people on our side. If we have to include your Black Demon Palace as well, the bit of Taiji spiritual Qi produced by the spring won’t be enough to go around at all. As a result, it’s best if you leave here, fellows of the Black Demon Palace.”","The Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows and the Immortal Sect of Taibai declined this suggestion. An unavoidable battle erupted between the two sides.","As soon as the two sides began fighting, the Black Demon Palace lost the upper hand.","“Abandon the spiritual Qi spring. Disciples of the Black Demon Palace, protect fellow Jing!” Ye Kai bellowed out. He took on two opponents at the same time, engaging two peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals in an intense battle.","They were Yun Zhan of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows and Qiu Xue of the Immortal Sect of Taibai. Both of them were talented and very powerful, regarded as the strongest beneath Immortal Monarch in their respective organisations. Although they were not Ye Kai’s opponents if they fought alone, they matched Ye Kai when working together.","All of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace fought on with difficulty. Everyone knew that they had no chance at victory, so they held on arduously. They aimed to buy a little more time for Jing Mumu who was amidst her breakthrough.","At this moment, a golden arrow shot through the battlefield, heading straight towards Jing Mumu who sat on the ground.","A Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows went after Jing Mumu. His face was cold, and there was a hint of wariness in the depths of his eyes. He put his full strength behind the attack this time, immediately using a powerful secret technique from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. The arrow was like a bolt of lightning, flashing past instantly.","Clearly, he knew Jing Mumu’s strength, wanting to eliminate her while she was breaking through.","Jing Mumu seemed to sense the nearing danger. Her eyelids trembled gently as her presence fluctuated slightly.","“You want to launch a sneak attack against fellow Jing ? You’re asking to die!” At this precise moment, a furious bellow rang out. Lang Shan appeared in front of Jing Mumu with his burly body. He directly punched out and erupted with his strength as a peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, immediately shattering the golden arrow.","Lang Shan seemed to lock onto the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal who attacked Jing Mumu. His eyes were glued to this person as he rushed towards him aggressively in pursuit.","However, before Lang Shan could approach him, multiple disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows struck at the same time. They drew their bows and condensed arrows from their energy, shooting them towards Lang Shan at the same time.","Lang Shan swung his fists again and again, striking the incoming arrows with great precision. With a series of deafening rumbles, Lang Shan was beaten into a retreat mid-air.","His assailants were all late Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals at the very least. They might not have been Lang Shan’s opponent alone, but he obviously struggled to fend them off when there were multiple people working together.","Spurt! Lang Shan retreated in front of Jing Mumu. Blood sprayed from his mouth uncontrollably. His face was pale.","However, before Lang Shan could catch his breath, a lethal threat suddenly appeared. In front of him, over ten Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows stood in a row, drawing their bows at the same time.","Lang Shan’s heart suddenly sank.","Swish! Swish! Swish!","In the next moment, over ten golden arrows soared through the air, heading right towards Jing Mumu.","That was only the first wave of attacks as well. From another direction, another group similar in size from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrow stood in a row. Their bows were drawn, all aiming at Jing Mumu.","Apart from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, the powerful disciples of the Immortal Sect of Taibai struck as well. Eight of their Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals worked together, assembling a formation that pressed towards Jing Mumu.","At that moment, Jing Mumu had become everyone’s target. Almost thirty Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals attacked her.","The disciples of the Black Demon Palace were all furious. They abandoned their opponents and desperately rushed towards Jing Mumu, wanting to block these attacks for her.","However, with their disadvantage in numbers, all of them struggled to do anything. They even had difficulty protecting themselves, so how could they still care about others?","Lang Shan’s eyes were filled with determination. He began to ignite his vitality. At that moment, his vitality surged as his armour erupted with blinding light. His burly figure was like a steel wall, standing fearlessly in front of Jing Mumu.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","With a series of rumbles, the arrows landed on Lang Shan’s burly figure one by one, making him spurt blood again and again. The supreme quality immortal artifact armour on him exploded violently, having shattered from the attacks.","After all, these were attacks from over twenty Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. Let alone Lang Shan, even the stronger Ye Kai would end up heavily injured.","However, Lang Shan had managed to block all of those attacks from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows alone. In return, he was declared dead. The power of the formation around the Taiji mountain range descended, and he was expelled.","Lang Shan had been eliminated!","The danger that Jing Mumu faced had not been resolved with that. The disciples of the Immortal Sect of Taibai arrived. The eight Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals assembled a killing formation and arrived above Jing Mumu, raining down with terrifying beams of light.","He Tian and Jing Yao appeared above Jing Mumu with a group of disciples from the Black Demon Palace. They established a defensive formation and blocked the killing formation from the Immortal Sect of Taibai.","At this moment, resplendent golden light illuminated the surroundings. The Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows launched a second wave of attacks. Almost thirty golden arrows gathered in the air before merging as one into an even larger arrow that shot towards Jing Mumu.","This was a secret technique of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. At this moment, almost thirty Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals were working together, pushing the power of this strike beyond the boundary of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal and directly into the domain of Immortal Monarchs.","“Oh no, the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows is determined to deal with fellow Jing,” He Tian cried out. The defensive formation assembled by him, Jing Yao, and a few disciples of the Black Demon Palace immediately shifted locations, blocking the arrow with their full strength.","Boom!","With a great rumble, the defensive formation shattered. Everyone was launched away while spurting with blood. Their expressions became haggard as they suffered heavy injuries. They would struggle to keep fighting now.","After shattering the defensive formation, the golden arrow condensed by almost thirty Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows continued onwards without weakening, directly approaching Jing Mumu with terrifying power that was enough to make all Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals pale.","Above, the eight-man killing formation assembled by the Immortal Sect of Taibai quickly descended as well.","Ye Kai was tied up with Yun Zhan and Qiu Xue. He saw how Jing Mumu was in danger. He panicked inside, but he was locked in battle against them. The other disciples of the Black Demon Palace were forced into a retreat as well, struggling to protect themselves.","Having come so far, the Black Demon Palace could no longer free up any strength to assist Jing Mumu.","Moreover, the danger that Jing Mumu currently faced could not be resolved by just a few Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","At that moment, an illusionary rabbit appeared above the Taiji mountain range, staring closely at Jing Mumu.","That was not all. The Immortal Emperors from various organisations all focused on Jing Mumu outside the formation around the mountain range. They wanted to see if someone as deviously talented as her would actually be eliminated when she was breaking through.","At this moment, Jing Mumu had truly become the centre of attention.","The battle prowess she had demonstrated was far too great. As a peak Xuan Immortal, it was chilling enough that she had killed so many Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. Even late Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals could not block too many of her strikes.","Just how many people in the Immortals’ World could rival such startling feats?","“Looks like she’s going to be expelled from the Taiji mountain range soon too. What a pity. I really wanted to see just how shocking her performance would be once she reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal...”","“For a peak Xuan Immortal to come so far, it’s enough for her name to go down in history...”","“Why don’t we have a discussion about changing the rules of the Taiji mountain range? Anyone who is in the middle of breaking through will receive the full protection of the formation...”","“Yeah, I think that would work. This is a trial ground for nurturing the next generation anyway. We should make that the case...”","......","...","Many great elders from peak organisations came up with suggestions. As a matter of fact, in order to witness Jing Mumu’s performance after breaking through to Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, they were tempted to change the rules of the Taiji mountain range immediately.","As for whether their disciples would suffer as a result, that was no longer important in the eyes of a few. They only wanted to witness the glory of a supreme prodigy.","However, as soon as these suggestions appeared, the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon vehemently objected. Jing Mumu was with the Black Demon Palace. As the Black Demon Palace’s mortal enemy, the Blade Sect of Trickling Moon could not allow such a peerless prodigy to mature successfully.","The huge golden arrow had already arrived before Jing Mumu in the Taiji mountain range. It was about to plunge into her forehead.","Jing Mumu was already in the face of danger. The formation spirit that protected the Taiji mountain range was ready to interfere.","At that critical moment, Jing Mumu suddenly opened her eyes. Her eyes shone extremely brightly, and they even seemed to glow. Two strands of pure-white sword Qi seemed to pierce the air.","Suddenly, she extended her right hand. Her white, slender hand turned into a blur, reaching towards the incoming golden arrow.","The moment she took action, her entire presence swelled up like a volcano that had remained dormant for all this time. It immediately erupted, releasing unparalleled power.","The power was so great that all of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals present were stunned. They felt chills.","With a rumble, the huge golden arrow halted before Jing Mumu, unable to advance another inch. A slender white hand gripped the arrow firmly, making it come to a stop.","“Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal! Oh no, she’s broken through!” The faces of the disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows who launched the arrow all became ugly.","At this moment, Jing Mumu’s presence experienced an overwhelming change. She was no longer a peak Xuan Immortal. She had truly reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","Although Ye Kai was unable to break free from his opponents, he had obviously been keeping an eye on Jing Mumu constantly. Sensing Jing Mumu’s successful breakthrough, he finally relaxed. He could not help but let out a howl of jubilation.","“Fellow Jing has reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal successfully. Fantastic, this is just fantastic...” Nearby, many of the dishevelled disciples of the Black Demon Palace were elated as well.","At this moment, Jing Mumu suddenly swung her hand that gripped the golden arrow. In the next moment, the golden arrow that originally targeted her forehead shot up instead, turning into a golden streak of light. Its target was now the killing formation assembled by the eight Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals of the Immortal Sect of Taibai.","Their faces immediately changed as their eyes narrowed in fright and panic.","Unfortunately, the golden arrow was extremely fast. They did not have any time to respond.","Boom!","In the next moment, a rumble rang out, and the formation assembled by the eight Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals crumbled like paper. They were all blown away as blood spurted from their mouths. Meanwhile, the flood of energy from the golden arrow continued forwards right towards them.","At that critical moment, the power of the formation appeared, declaring the deaths of these eight people. As it protected them, it also expelled them from the mountain range."]},{"number":4029,"title":"Chapter 4029: Chapter 4030: Unstoppable","paragraphs":["Jing Mumu basically eliminated the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals of the Immortal Sect of Taibai with an attack that had originally targeted her. Not only did her methods shock all of the disciples on the battlefield, but even many of the experts from the various organisations observing Jing Mumu narrowed their eyes in surprise.","The arrow had condensed the power of almost thirty Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. It was so powerful that some newly-broken through Immortal Monarchs would choose to dodge instead of receiving it. Meanwhile, Jing Mumu had only just reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.","Inside the Taiji mountain range, the several dozen disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows that attacked Jing Mumu were all stunned. They were in shock.","However, they did not have too much time to think about it. A slender figure flew over from afar, moving extremely quickly and arriving in an instant.","Jing Mumu’s eyes shone with cold killing intent. The supreme quality immortal artifact sword in her hand shone brightly. As she slashed out, a long strand of sword Qi appeared in the surroundings. The sharp sword intent stirred up the world. For a moment, it actually brought chills to all the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","The Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows who stood in a row were enveloped by Jing Mumu’s sword Qi that resembled an entire galaxy. Sharp and lethal sword intent encroached on them from all directions. It was like a tightening cage, sealing off all of their paths of retreat.","“Let’s shatter the sword Qi together!” a Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows called out. Immediately, everyone erupted with powerful presences. The Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals struck out with full strength, drawing their bows and launching dazzling golden arrows.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Over a dozen golden arrows shot through the air, colliding with Jing Mumu’s sword Qi. However, following the rumbles, the golden arrows all shattered. Meanwhile, the sword Qi was unaffected, falling towards them without weakening.","The dozen or so Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows were like a group of sitting ducks.","“Hmm? Even regular Immortal Monarchs won’t be able to receive a strike like that. What an amazing girl. She’s truly unstoppable now in the Taiji mountain range.” At that split second, an ancient voice suddenly rang out from nowhere. An illusionary rabbit appeared. It hovered three hundred metres above Jing Mumu, staring at her with a strange light.","The rabbit was the formation spirit!","At the same time, the power of the formation descended, blocking the sword Qi unleashed by Jing Mumu.","However, the magnificent sword Qi was no regular attack. A wondrous power existed within the sword Qi, seemingly capable of piercing the barrier’s protection and harming the people inside.","The rabbit was unsurprised. The wondrous power was extremely great. When it encountered it the first time, a disciple it protected with the formation had ended up injured due to a moment of carelessness.","Now that Jing Mumu had broken through, this wondrous power strengthened once again. The formation’s original power was completely insufficient to stop it now.","With a thought, the rabbit made the protective power increase instantly, eradicating the wondrous power in Jing Mumu’s sword Qi before removing the disciples from the Taiji mountain range.","Jing Mumu obviously heard what the rabbit said. She stood with her sword by her side and looked up, staring straight at the rabbit. As if she had already guessed who it was, she asked calmly, “Senior, are you here to stop me?”","The rabbit met Jing Mumu’s gaze and said gently, “The Taiji mountain range has its rules. My existence is only for preventing the deaths of disciples. As long as the battles between you don’t break the rules, I won’t interfere.”","“Good then.” Jing Mumu stopped worrying and no longer paid attention to the artifact spirit. Light flickered around her as she struck out again.","This time, she went after the other row of disciples from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows that had attacked her earlier.","Immediately, another resplendent strand of sword Qi appeared. More than another dozen Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals were declared dead, expelled from the Taiji mountain range.","This was far too startling. Just the power of a single strike alone had buried over a dozen experts of the same realm. Ever since Jing Mumu broke through, her battle prowess had increased by leaps and bounds.","Afterwards, Jing Mumu entered the battlefield. She traversed the area with her sword like the embodiment of death. Wherever she passed by, all of her opponents would be declared dead, forcefully expelled from the Taiji mountain range. Not a single person present could stop her anymore.","Even when she faced peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, Jing Mumu only needed a single attack to place them under the protection of the formation.","Without any exaggeration, the strength that Jing Mumu currently displayed had surpassed Jian Chen in the past.","In less than a minute, she eliminated almost a hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals, which immediately shrunk the gap between the two sides.","However, the Black Demon Palace was still at a disadvantage.","“Jing Mumu, let me try you out!” At this moment, Yun Zhan bellowed out furiously. Battle intent burned in his eyes. He no longer engaged Ye Kai, instead rushing towards Jing Mumu fearlessly.","Resplendent flames surged on his body. He was igniting his vitality. It turned into a golden, glistening arrow and shot towards Jing Mumu with lightning speed.","Yun Zhan was the strongest Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. His master was an Immortal Exalt ancestor of the sect. The things he had mastered were well beyond what a regular disciple was capable of. Now that he had proactively engaged Jing Mumu, he immediately attracted everyone’s attention on the battlefield.","Even though no one believed Yun Zhan would be Jing Mumu’s opponent with the battle prowess she had demonstrated, they wanted to see how long he could last against her.","However, Jing Mumu did not spare a second glance at him. As she swung her supreme quality immortal artifact sword, another strand of sword Qi appeared in the surroundings, enveloping Yun Zhan in an overwhelming manner.","The glistening arrow that Yun Zhan had condensed with his vitality was swallowed by the sword Qi. It failed to even produce a wave. The sword Qi continued along its path.","Yun Zhan howled out. Energy surged across his body. He gripped his bow with both hands, wielding it as a blade as he swung out with his full strength.","Boom!","A shockwave erupted and tore through the surroundings. Yun Zhan was launched away like a broken kite. He coughed up blood uncontrollably as he became sheet-white.","He had blocked Jing Mumu’s attack, but he had paid an extremely severe price as well. His organs had ruptured, and his presence was haggard. He had basically lost the ability to keep fighting.","In the distance, Qiu Yue and Ye Kai were stern. They were extremely shocked. Yun Zhan was not a regular Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. It was virtually impossible to injure him to such an extent with a single attack unless you were an Immortal Monarch.","At this moment, Jing Mumu’s second attack arrived, targeting Yun Zhan.","However, before her supreme grade immortal artifact sword could approach him, Yun Zhan had already been sent away by the power of the formation."]},{"number":4030,"title":"Chapter 4030: Chapter 4031: Invincible God of War","paragraphs":["The power of the protective formation had appeared, which meant that Yun Zhan had been declared dead.","Despite being the most impressive core disciple of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows who had an Immortal Exalt as his master, Yun Zhan could not even receive a second strike from Jing Mumu.","After Yun Zhan had vanished, Jing Mumu did not pause at all. With the supreme quality immortal artifact sword in hand, she continued to move through the battlefield. Resplendent sword Qi swept through the surroundings, reaping the lives of the Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals like weeds.","At that moment, Jing Mumu was like a god of war. She was unstoppable. No one could put a halt to her.","Outside the protective formation, Yun Zhan had been transported to the region belonging to the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows. There were many of his eliminated junior brothers around him.","“Unbelievable. She’s clearly a junior who’s only just reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, yet she can actually kill over a dozen of us in a single strike...”","“That truly is alarming. We’re all experts who’ve reached late Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, yet even then we can’t withstand that attack...”","“During the several hundred thousand years I’ve cultivated for, I’ve never heard of, much less witnessed, such terrifying battle prowess...”","......","...","A noisy discussion occurred around Yun Zhan. These were all disciples of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows that had been eliminated by Jing Mumu. At this moment, their faces were all filled with fear as they discussed with great intensity.","“Senior brother Yun Zhan is out as well. I didn’t think that even with senior brother Yun Zhan’s great strength, he couldn't even last two strikes against her...”","“He couldn’t stop the second attack, but senior brother Yun Zhan did manage to stop the first one successfully. He’s far more powerful than us...”","At this moment, Yun Zhan sat on a cloud with a pale face. He was dejected as if he was very much affected by what had happened earlier.","Beside him, a great elder from the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows took out a low grade God Tier pill. He crushed the pill into powder and sprinkled it on Yun Zhan. However, from how dazed Yun Zhan seemed, he could only let out a helpless sigh. He had no idea how to comfort him for the time being.","“Zhan’er!” At this moment, an elderly voice rang out from beside Yun Zhan. An old man with peppered hair silently appeared. He was dressed in simple clothing and carried a huge, stone bow on his shoulder. He seemed like a hunter who lived in the mountains.","Hearing the voice, Yun Zhan shuddered and slowly looked towards the old man. He sobbed and said, “Master, I’ve brought you disgrace.”","The old man with the huge stone bow on his shoulder was an Immortal Exalt ancestor of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, the Master of Divine Rainbow!","The great elder of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows who stood to the side showed great respect and bowed politely.","The Master of Divine Rainbow’s face was gentle. There was no blame at all. “Zhan’er, you haven’t embarrassed me. Actually, I’ve always taken great pride in your talent.”","“B-but I couldn’t even block two attacks from Jing Mumu despite being a peak Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. She’s only just broken through to Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal.” Yun Zhan smiled wryly.","“Zhan’er, your talent is already extremely impressive, but you must be clear with yourself. Don’t go for what is beyond your reach. Some people are not to be compared against, as they dwell in a completely different world in the first place,” the Master of Divine Rainbow said softly. Shortly afterwards, he looked at Jing Mumu in the Taiji mountain range and continued, “I’m not trying to put you down with this. In reality, with the battle prowess that Jing Mumu has demonstrated, even those successors produced by the courts of heaven might not necessarily be her opponent if they’re at the same realm of cultivation, let alone our mere Taiji Heaven.”","“Jing Mumu’s legacy is extremely impressive. I’m not certain what kind of legacy it is, but it is extremely terrifying.”","“Let’s go. Leave with me. Adjust your mind, see yourself for yourself, and focus on studying the ways. I anticipate the day you reach Immortal Exalt and become a pillar of support for my Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows...”","The Master of Divine Rainbow took Yun Zhan with him. However, before he left, he paid a visit to the region belonging to the Black Demon Palace. He had a delightful conversation with great elder Ye.","The Taiji mountain range was only a land of fortune where juniors fought over opportunities. No matter how intense the conflict became, no matter how vicious the battles were, they would not affect the relationships between the peak organisations.","Inside the Taiji mountain range, the difference in numbers between the Black Demon Palace and the enemy quickly closed after Jing Mumu entered the battle. The original situation of certain defeat was being turned around.","After Yun Zhan of the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, the greatest core disciple of the Immortal Sect of Taibai, Qiu Xue, was also defeated by Jing Mumu. Just like Yun Zhan, he only barely managed to block the first attack from Jing Mumu. When she struck a second time, Qiu Xue was expelled by the power of the formation.","With both Yun Zhan and Qiu Xue’s elimination, the alliance formed by the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, the Immortal Sect of Taibai, and numerous Immortal Emperor organisations collapsed spectacularly. Some of the disciples from Immortal Emperor organisations were frightened out of their wits after witnessing Jing Mumu’s battle prowess. They began to flee desperately.","That seemed to set off a fuse. With someone in the lead, more and more people fled.","“Don’t let them escape. Keep them busy and buy a little more time for fellow Jing...”","The disciples of the Black Demon Palace were all reinvigorated at the sight of this. They used various secret techniques endlessly, without any concern about the consequences, trying their hardest to keep the enemy busy.","On the other side, Jing Mumu slaughtered the enemy with great speed. She illuminated the surroundings with her sword Qi, claiming the lives of Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals after Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. From time to time, sword Qi would erupt and rain down from above, instantly massacring an entire group of people.","In the end, less than two hundred people managed to escape from the alliance of almost a thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals. The remaining were all eliminated.","As the battle came to an end, the Black Demon Palace only had around a hundred and fifty people remaining. Everyone was bloodied and quite injured. They seemed to be extremely dishevelled.","Jing Mumu was dressed in pure-white clothes, without a speck of dust on her. She gave off an ethereal aura, forming a sharp contrast against the disciples of the Black Demon Palace.","Following the battle, Jing Mumu completely consolidated an impression of invincibility in the eyes of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace. These disciples of the Black Demon Palace who had lasted until now without being eliminated all began to revere Jing Mumu.","Afterwards, the disciples of the Black Demon Palace began to focus on healing. Meanwhile, Jing Mumu sat near the spiritual Qi spring alone with a gourd in hand, collecting the Taiji spiritual Qi. She would consume some pills from time to time.","Some of the disciples of the Black Demon Palace recognised these pills—they were for consolidating one’s cultivation. They were very precious pills that regular cultivators could not afford.","Under Ye Kai’s suggestion, they came up with a new plan to split the Taiji spiritual Qi produced by the spiritual Qi spring. Originally, the Black Demon Palace only wanted a tenth of it, where the remaining nine-tenths would go to Jing Mumu.","However, under Jing Mumu’s insistence, she ended up only taking two-thirds of it for herself, leaving the remaining third to the Black Demon Palace.","The Taiji spiritual Qi continued to emerge in an endless flow. After breaking through to Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, Jing Mumu no longer absorbed the Taiji spiritual Qi. Instead, she collected all of it, storing it in a gourd.","Time trickled by silently. In the blink of an eye, it had already been three months since Jing Mumu reached Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal. During this time, the Taiji spiritual Qi became even rarer in the general wilderness of the Taiji mountain range, and the few spiritual Qi springs had become objects of desire. Basically every single day, battles would erupt near each spiritual Qi springs. Many of the spiritual Qi springs changed owners multiple times as a result.","Even the spiritual Qi springs occupied by the Cosmic Grotto and the Thousand Mountains clan had been attacked. In the end, they were unable to hold off the alliances that outnumbered them by up to ten times. They all lost their spiritual Qi springs, which forced the Thousand Mountains clan and the Cosmic Grotto to work together.","However, even with their forces, they struggled against opponents that completely outnumbered them. As a result, under the lead of these two organisations, a new alliance was established. They gathered several peak organisations and over a dozen Immortal Emperor organisations and reclaimed their lost spiritual Qi springs.","Although the amount of spiritual Qi they now received had diminished drastically, it was still better than nothing.","The spiritual Qi spring occupied by Jing Mumu and the Black Demon Palace faced numerous battles as well. Even with the glorious feat of defeating the alliance of the Immortal Sect of Taibai and the Immortal Sect of Divine Arrows, it was not enough to scare off other organisations. As a result, the spiritual Qi spring faced numerous attacks as well, but Jing Mumu managed to repel them each time.","As a matter of fact, there was a time where the enemy had amassed almost two thousand people, pressing towards the spiritual Qi spring guarded by Jing Mumu in an impressive manner. They outnumbered the Black Demon Palace by several dozen times.","In the end, Jing Mumu used a supreme secret technique and condensed an enormous sword in the air, demonstrating invincible might. With a single slash, she instantly annihilated almost two hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals.","It was also that attack that frightened off the invading enemy. Even Ye Kai and the others from the Black Demon Palace were frightened out of their wits. Chills ran through their bodies as their hairs stood on end.","In the Taiji mountain range, Jing Mumu had truly demonstrated what it meant to be an invincible god of war."]},{"number":4031,"title":"Chapter 4031: Chapter 4032: Gigantic Spring","paragraphs":["Consequently, everyone’s recognition of Jing Mumu skyrocketed, becoming a living legend in their eyes. She had already reached a level where everyone in the Taiji mountain range knew about her.","At the same time, after Jing Mumu killed close to two hundred Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals with a single attack, the attacks aiming for their spiritual Qi spring ceased.","There was no longer anyone or any organisation that had the courage to challenge Jing Mumu.","As for the other spiritual Qi springs in the Taiji mountain range, the battles continued with particular intensity.","For a moment, the spiritual Qi spring occupied by Jing Mumu and the Black Demon Palace in the Taiji mountain range had instead become the only place of peace. No matter how violent the storms outside were, they were unable to disturb the peace here.","Jing Mumu obviously became a target of recruitment for the various major organisations. She was truly desired. Many alliances that occupied spiritual Qi springs sent people over in hopes of working with Jing Mumu, offering her the lion’s share.","Even the Cosmic Grotto and the Thousand Mountains clan had sent people over in an attempt to recruit Jing Mumu into their ranks.","Observant people had already recorded Jing Mumu’s appearance in battle through various methods, preserving it perfectly. With this evidence, no one had the courage to question their decisions.","As for the various recruitment attempts, Jing Mumu rejected them all.","Time moved quickly. In the blink of an eye, several more months had passed. During this period of fighting and killing, the possession of the remaining spiritual Qi springs had finally been confirmed. Apart from the spiritual Qi spring occupied by Jing Mumu and the Black Demon Palace, several thousand Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals gathered around each of the other spiritual Qi springs.","With no other choice, the various organisations both big and small were forced to make some concessions, working together and sharing the spiritual Qi spring according to an allocation plan they had come up with.","However, even though they had set up a relatively fair allocation plan, the Taiji spiritual Qi produced by the spiritual Qi springs had already begun to reduce before they managed to share it with everyone.","In the past, each spring would produce several strands of Taiji spiritual Qi at least, but it would often take two or three days before a strand appeared recently. The time between each strand was only getting longer as well.","Towards the end, even seven days would not be enough for any Taiji spiritual Qi to emerge.","The spiritual Qi springs seemed to be on the brink of drying up!","None of the spiritual Qi springs were exceptions to this. They were all affected.","The spiritual Qi spring possessed by Jing Mumu and the Black Demon Palace had also almost run out of spiritual Qi.","“There’s something off about this. The spiritual Qi springs will run dry eventually, but once a spring runs dry, new springs normally appear. Apart from the spiritual Qi springs, some Taiji spiritual Qi will emerge in the general wilderness as well for the smaller organisations to fight over. But this time, not only is there zero Taiji spiritual Qi in other places, but even the spiritual Qi springs are about to vanish. This is very different from the past.” Ye Kai furrowed his brows when he noticed these changes.","“Is the struggle for the Taiji spiritual Qi about to end?” Jing Mumu looked at the gourd in her hand. She was not completely satisfied yet.","There were only around five hundred strands of Taiji spiritual Qi in the gourd. That was nowhere near enough.","Ye Kai shook his head. “That doesn’t seem very likely. According to past events, it shouldn’t end this quickly.”","The changes in behaviour in the Taiji spiritual Qi puzzled the remaining disciples left here. None of them understood what was going on.","Towards the end, the entire Taiji mountain range had virtually run out of Taiji spiritual Qi. Even the spiritual Qi springs began to vanish.","The disciples of many organisations had already begun reporting these anomalies to their seniors outside, but they did not receive a reply.","The various experts outside obviously noticed the changes in the Taiji mountain range. In reality, even the Immortal Emperor great elders from the various organisations had no idea what was happening in the Taiji mountain range. They were all discussing amongst themselves about this.","“ It’s about to end? ” Jian Chen, who remained seated on the horizon, furrowed his brows. His lips moved gently, communicating with Xue Ji several tens of thousand kilometres away.","At this moment, Xue Ji stood with the great elders from several peak organisations as they discussed amongst themselves. When she heard Jian Chen’s message, she shook her head gently as well, expressing that she did not know.","“ If I’ve guessed correctly, the anomaly in the Taiji mountain range is probably some kind of accumulation. The last time something like this occurred was eight million years ago. That time, a gigantic spring appeared inside the Taiji mountain range. ” At this moment, an obscure voice entered Xue Ji’s ear.","When she heard the extremely familiar voice, Xue Ji immediately became filled with mixed feelings.","That was the voice of the strongest ancestor of the Black Demon Palace, as well as her partner, the Black Heaven Master.","Clearly, the Black Heaven Master was also paying constant attention to the situation here.","“ Go and tell your sect master that after the gigantic spring appears, he must get his disciple to do everything that she can to claim the Taiji spiritual Qi. The Taiji spiritual Qi produced by the gigantic spring is different from other springs. Its effects are at least ten times more potent than regular Taiji spiritual Qi. ”","“ Moreover, golden Taiji spiritual Qi will appear from the gigantic spring. It is extremely rare and it is known as the key to Immortal Monarch. It has a certain chance at allowing Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortals who were originally destined to never break through to Immortal Monarch to overcome their restraints and earn the opportunity to reach Immortal Monarch... ”","When she heard what the Black Heaven Master said, Xue Ji sank into her thoughts. Immediately after that, she returned to Jian Chen’s side and told him everything that the Black Heaven Master had told her about the gigantic spring.","“ What? The golden Taiji spiritual Qi can allow cultivators to overcome their restraints and obtain the potential to reach Immortal Monarch? ” Jian Chen’s heart thumped when he heard the effects of the golden spiritual Qi. He was extremely tempted by it.","Something like that was useless on him, but it was the perfect treasure for nurturing the disciples of his sect.","Not everyone could reach Immortal Monarch. In the vast Immortals’ World, everyone had limits to their talent. They could be trapped at Nine-heavenly Xuan Immortal, where they would not be able to break through after millions or even tens of million years.","If they wanted to progress, then they had to search for opportunities and fortunes that could change their fate.","The golden Taiji spiritual Qi was without a doubt a chance for them to change their fate.","After learning about this, Jian Chen immediately contacted Jing Mumu and told her to do everything she could to claim the golden Taiji spiritual Qi.","At this moment, some great elders from peak organisations also received messages from their ancestors, learning about the existence of the gigantic spring.","They were not ignorant. Instead, the chances for the gigantic spring to appear were far too small. The last time it appeared was eight million years ago. Let alone Immortal Emperors, even some Immortal Exalts had never heard about it.","Immediately, orders after orders were sent into the Taiji spiritual Qi. All of the peak organisations that knew about the gigantic spiritual Qi spring ordered their remaining disciples in the Taiji mountain range to try everything that they could to collect the golden Taiji spiritual Qi."]}]);
